INSERT INTO `movie_dialogues` VALUES (103,1,'who leads the coeducational independent residential liberal arts college, founded in 1861.','None','00:01:18.511','00:01:24.750','JOY','','NORMAL','2026-09-17 18:38:42','2026-09-17 18:38:42',73.39,100.00),(104,1,'She was previously the director of the Brady-Johnson Program in Grand Strategy at Yale,','None','00:01:24.783','00:01:29.755','JOY','','NORMAL','2026-09-17 18:38:42','2026-09-17 18:38:42',57.88,100.00),(105,1,'a university wide interdisciplinary program to train emerging leaders.','None','00:01:29.788','00:01:34.994','JOY','','NORMAL','2026-09-17 18:38:42','2026-09-17 18:38:42',94.95,100.00),(106,1,'The program employed a comprehensive approach to achieving large ends with limited means,','None','00:01:35.027','00:01:40.666','JOY','','NORMAL','2026-09-17 18:38:42','2026-09-17 18:38:42',91.06,100.00),(107,1,'examining disciplines across history, political science, classical literature as context to address a wide range of contemporary','None','00:01:40.699','00:01:49.075','JOY','','NORMAL','2026-09-17 18:38:42','2026-09-17 18:38:42',67.16,100.00),(108,1,'public policy challenges on security, economic inequality, global health and climate change.','None','00:01:49.108','00:01:55.648','ANGER','','NORMAL','2026-09-17 18:38:42','2026-09-17 18:38:42',39.31,100.00),(109,1,'President, I\'m delighted to welcome you here today.','None','00:01:55.681','00:01:57.617','JOY','','NORMAL','2026-09-17 18:38:42','2026-09-17 18:38:42',98.77,100.00),(110,1,'Thanks for being here.','None','00:01:57.650','00:01:58.484','JOY','','NORMAL','2026-09-17 18:38:42','2026-09-17 18:38:42',91.44,100.00),(111,1,'BRADLEY: Thank you so much, Alexander.','None','00:01:58.518','00:02:00.019','JOY','','NORMAL','2026-09-17 18:38:42','2026-09-17 18:38:42',88.68,100.00),(112,1,'and major university presidents.','None','00:02:04.156','00:02:05.591','JOY','','NORMAL','2026-09-17 18:38:42','2026-09-17 18:38:42',42.27,100.00),(113,1,'I\'m thinking of Wesleyan, Notre Dame, University of Richmond.','None','00:02:05.624','00:02:08.628','JOY','','NORMAL','2026-09-17 18:38:42','2026-09-17 18:38:42',56.03,100.00),(114,1,'We\'re delighted to have you here.','None','00:02:08.661','00:02:09.996','JOY','','NORMAL','2026-09-17 18:38:42','2026-09-17 18:38:42',98.77,100.00),(115,1,'We\'d like to get a sense of the campus commons, specifically this question of free speech and fair','None','00:02:10.029','00:02:14.834','JOY','','NORMAL','2026-09-17 18:38:42','2026-09-17 18:38:42',97.90,100.00),(116,1,'speech on campus.','None','00:02:14.867','00:02:17.203','ANGER','','NORMAL','2026-09-17 18:38:42','2026-09-17 18:38:42',59.19,100.00),(117,1,'How do you think in the midst of a contentious and sometimes even vitriolic political climate,','None','00:02:17.236','00:02:23.376','ANGER','','NORMAL','2026-09-17 18:38:42','2026-09-17 18:38:42',97.67,100.00),(118,1,'how your campus and campuses more broadly are confronting the resurgence of bigotry and the danger','None','00:02:23.409','00:02:31.984','FEAR','','NORMAL','2026-09-17 18:38:42','2026-09-17 18:38:42',49.73,100.00),(119,1,'of accepting a discourse that might be a bigoted discourse?','None','00:02:32.017','00:02:36.122','ANGER','','NORMAL','2026-09-17 18:38:42','2026-09-17 18:38:42',82.59,100.00),(120,1,'I think for most people run in colleges and universities today, this is absolutely front','None','00:02:40.793','00:02:45.498','JOY','','NORMAL','2026-09-17 18:38:42','2026-09-17 18:38:42',77.60,100.00),(121,1,'and center, a primary question for us.','None','00:02:45.531','00:02:48.000','JOY','','NORMAL','2026-09-17 18:38:42','2026-09-17 18:38:42',31.39,100.00),(122,1,'And I\'d step us back a little bit on your question.','None','00:02:48.033','00:02:51.704','ANGER','','NORMAL','2026-09-17 18:38:42','2026-09-17 18:38:42',55.73,100.00),(123,1,'You have to have it on college campuses.','None','00:02:59.178','00:03:01.314','ANGER','','NORMAL','2026-09-17 18:38:42','2026-09-17 18:38:42',47.07,100.00),(124,1,'There\'s no way around it.','None','00:03:01.347','00:03:02.815','ANGER','','NORMAL','2026-09-17 18:38:42','2026-09-17 18:38:42',34.91,100.00),(125,1,'When you do that, it\'s a really interesting campus because suddenly you are saying everybody has a voice.','None','00:03:18.297','00:03:24.870','JOY','','NORMAL','2026-09-17 18:38:42','2026-09-17 18:38:42',84.06,100.00),(126,1,'The whole goal of the campus is to bring different voices together that are really different','None','00:03:24.903','00:03:30.276','JOY','','NORMAL','2026-09-17 18:38:42','2026-09-17 18:38:42',83.26,100.00),(127,1,'and that\'s edge that brings edges to the place.','None','00:03:30.309','00:03:34.313','JOY','','NORMAL','2026-09-17 18:38:42','2026-09-17 18:38:42',42.82,100.00),(128,1,'And what happens at an edge, an edge can be all kinds of things.','None','00:03:34.346','00:03:38.784','ANGER','','NORMAL','2026-09-17 18:38:42','2026-09-17 18:38:42',49.57,100.00),(129,1,'It can be sharp and very difficult and full of tension.','None','00:03:38.817','00:03:43.055','ANGER','','NORMAL','2026-09-17 18:38:42','2026-09-17 18:38:42',90.83,100.00),(130,1,'It can be thrilling and sort of you see both sides at once cause you right on the edge.','None','00:03:43.088','00:03:47.593','JOY','','NORMAL','2026-09-17 18:38:42','2026-09-17 18:38:42',83.74,100.00),(131,1,'meet like that, the sparks will fly, but hopefully they get channeled into all kinds','None','00:03:52.831','00:03:59.505','JOY','','NORMAL','2026-09-17 18:38:42','2026-09-17 18:38:42',77.22,100.00),(132,1,'of new, I don\'t know, you spark the creativity, new friendships, new ways to look at the world,','None','00:03:59.538','00:04:05.444','JOY','','NORMAL','2026-09-17 18:38:42','2026-09-17 18:38:42',98.36,100.00),(133,1,'creativity, innovations.','None','00:04:05.477','00:04:08.080','JOY','','NORMAL','2026-09-17 18:38:42','2026-09-17 18:38:42',97.56,100.00),(134,1,'So if you allow both the freedom to speak, but you bring everybody to the table for that','None','00:04:08.113','00:04:15.021','ANGER','','NORMAL','2026-09-17 18:38:42','2026-09-17 18:38:42',48.97,100.00),(135,1,'freedom, which is sometimes what hasn\'t happened before, I think you can really make a change.','None','00:04:15.054','00:04:19.625','JOY','','NORMAL','2026-09-17 18:38:42','2026-09-17 18:38:42',96.70,100.00),(136,1,'And that skills, those kinds of skills are good for the world, not just for campuses.','None','00:04:19.658','00:04:23.696','JOY','','NORMAL','2026-09-17 18:38:42','2026-09-17 18:38:42',97.64,100.00),(137,1,'BRADLEY: Yes.','None','00:04:27.900','00:04:29.368','JOY','','NORMAL','2026-09-17 18:38:42','2026-09-17 18:38:42',81.77,100.00),(138,1,'HEFFNER: ...In the way that you participate in the democratic governance of your own institution.','None','00:04:29.401','00:04:32.672','JOY','','NORMAL','2026-09-17 18:38:42','2026-09-17 18:38:42',88.72,100.00),(139,1,'Can you tell our viewers about that?','None','00:04:32.705','00:04:33.906','ANGER','','NORMAL','2026-09-17 18:38:42','2026-09-17 18:38:42',45.89,100.00),(140,1,'BRADLEY: Yes. Well one of the strong values at Vassar has always been empowerment. The students are empowered,','None','00:04:33.939','00:04:39.111','JOY','','NORMAL','2026-09-17 18:38:42','2026-09-17 18:38:42',98.82,100.00),(141,1,'the faculty are empowered. We have shared governance.','None','00:04:39.144','00:04:42.615','JOY','','NORMAL','2026-09-17 18:38:42','2026-09-17 18:38:42',96.73,100.00),(142,1,'And you know America hasn\'t always dealt well with diversity when you think about it,','None','00:04:58.664','00:05:03.669','JOY','','NORMAL','2026-09-17 18:38:42','2026-09-17 18:38:42',91.95,100.00),(143,1,'I mean, there\'s segregation, that\'s one way in which people deal with diversity.','None','00:05:03.702','00:05:08.240','JOY','','NORMAL','2026-09-17 18:38:42','2026-09-17 18:38:42',85.22,100.00),(144,1,'They separate people into their groups, and big boundaries between them and they don\'t learn','None','00:05:08.273','00:05:13.045','JOY','','NORMAL','2026-09-17 18:38:42','2026-09-17 18:38:42',41.10,100.00),(145,1,'from each other. We\'ve had a huge history on that.','None','00:05:13.078','00:05:15.748','JOY','','NORMAL','2026-09-17 18:38:42','2026-09-17 18:38:42',85.20,100.00),(146,1,'There\'s assimilation, which we\'ve also had a huge history on where people just,','None','00:05:15.781','00:05:20.319','JOY','','NORMAL','2026-09-17 18:38:42','2026-09-17 18:38:42',79.83,100.00),(147,1,'who are diverse come in and you just need to act like the majority and you\'ll get along.','None','00:05:20.352','00:05:24.323','JOY','','NORMAL','2026-09-17 18:38:42','2026-09-17 18:38:42',97.88,100.00),(148,1,'really hear what the other side is.','None','00:05:36.902','00:05:38.437','ANGER','','NORMAL','2026-09-17 18:38:42','2026-09-17 18:38:42',39.48,100.00),(149,1,'And that\'s what we\'re trying to do throughout the campus.','None','00:05:47.646','00:05:49.982','ANGER','','NORMAL','2026-09-17 18:38:42','2026-09-17 18:38:42',80.94,100.00),(150,1,'HEFFNER: And to be specific, you\'re giving students, faculty and staff alike an','None','00:05:50.015','00:05:54.153','JOY','','NORMAL','2026-09-17 18:38:42','2026-09-17 18:38:42',82.44,100.00),(151,1,'BRADLEY: Absolutely.','None','00:06:04.830','00:06:05.765','JOY','','NORMAL','2026-09-17 18:38:42','2026-09-17 18:38:42',87.22,100.00),(152,1,'We\'ve a great example of this is we have a committee called the Priority and Planning','None','00:06:05.798','00:06:09.835','JOY','','NORMAL','2026-09-17 18:38:42','2026-09-17 18:38:42',90.03,100.00),(153,1,'Committee and that committee is fundamental to setting the strategic direction of the college','None','00:06:09.868','00:06:16.575','JOY','','NORMAL','2026-09-17 18:38:42','2026-09-17 18:38:42',92.09,100.00),(154,1,'and that committee, people on that are elected and it is students, staff, administrators, faculty.','None','00:06:16.608','00:06:24.083','JOY','','NORMAL','2026-09-17 18:38:42','2026-09-17 18:38:42',70.35,100.00),(155,1,'faculty together and staff as well and sort of there\'s an equality of voices around the table','None','00:06:37.296','00:06:42.268','JOY','','NORMAL','2026-09-17 18:38:42','2026-09-17 18:38:42',89.04,100.00),(156,1,'way we conceive of diversity or what is egalitarian on a campus.','None','00:06:47.873','00:06:52.745','JOY','','NORMAL','2026-09-17 18:38:42','2026-09-17 18:38:42',91.64,100.00),(157,1,'and that in the words of John Palfrey - we want brave and safe spaces.','None','00:07:09.394','00:07:14.800','JOY','','NORMAL','2026-09-17 18:38:42','2026-09-17 18:38:42',97.90,100.00),(158,1,'But they don\'t, they\'re not thinking that way.','None','00:07:14.833','00:07:16.836','ANGER','','NORMAL','2026-09-17 18:38:42','2026-09-17 18:38:42',32.57,100.00),(159,1,'They are absolutists when it comes to free expression right now for the most part with minimal','None','00:07:16.869','00:07:23.375','JOY','','NORMAL','2026-09-17 18:38:42','2026-09-17 18:38:42',93.13,100.00),(160,1,'banning of hate and bigotry on their platforms and also disinformation.','None','00:07:23.408','00:07:28.481','ANGER','','NORMAL','2026-09-17 18:38:42','2026-09-17 18:38:42',94.80,100.00),(161,1,'But I reject the idea that you\'re in adherent, a zealot adherent to the First Amendment or you\'re','None','00:07:28.514','00:07:33.752','JOY','','NORMAL','2026-09-17 18:38:42','2026-09-17 18:38:42',62.43,100.00),(162,1,'a zealot adherent to censorship.','None','00:07:33.785','00:07:36.088','ANGER','','NORMAL','2026-09-17 18:38:42','2026-09-17 18:38:42',84.89,100.00),(163,1,'Those are not the single courses.','None','00:07:36.121','00:07:37.957','JOY','','NORMAL','2026-09-17 18:38:42','2026-09-17 18:38:42',32.63,100.00),(164,1,'is disinformation, and I\'m wondering how that plays out at the campus level and whether that could at','None','00:07:44.229','00:07:49.602','FEAR','','NORMAL','2026-09-17 18:38:42','2026-09-17 18:38:42',89.87,100.00),(165,1,'all be emulated for these mega, mega information hubs that are so much the origin of','None','00:07:49.635','00:07:56.742','JOY','','NORMAL','2026-09-17 18:38:42','2026-09-17 18:38:42',92.41,100.00),(166,1,'the bloodstream today.','None','00:07:56.775','00:07:57.910','JOY','','NORMAL','2026-09-17 18:38:42','2026-09-17 18:38:42',41.60,100.00),(167,1,'BRADLEY: Yeah, I think the issue of what you\'re really going to do once you allow free speech and','None','00:07:57.943','00:08:04.250','JOY','','NORMAL','2026-09-17 18:38:42','2026-09-17 18:38:42',97.13,100.00),(168,1,'What does an institution do then if they have freedom to do what they want,','None','00:08:11.890','00:08:15.127','JOY','','NORMAL','2026-09-17 18:38:42','2026-09-17 18:38:42',62.34,100.00),(169,1,'they\'re a private institution, they are a media company, et cetera.','None','00:08:15.160','00:08:18.531','JOY','','NORMAL','2026-09-17 18:38:42','2026-09-17 18:38:42',59.23,100.00),(170,1,'And there are a couple of principles I think that really help us on the campus and I think could','None','00:08:18.564','00:08:23.769','JOY','','NORMAL','2026-09-17 18:38:42','2026-09-17 18:38:42',97.10,100.00),(171,1,'be thought of more broadly.','None','00:08:23.802','00:08:26.205','JOY','','NORMAL','2026-09-17 18:38:42','2026-09-17 18:38:42',56.90,100.00),(172,1,'The first is you\'ve got to make that a topic of conversation.','None','00:08:26.238','00:08:30.142','JOY','','NORMAL','2026-09-17 18:38:42','2026-09-17 18:38:42',43.65,100.00),(173,1,'their corners and stop talking.','None','00:08:37.349','00:08:39.184','ANGER','','NORMAL','2026-09-17 18:38:42','2026-09-17 18:38:42',75.42,100.00),(174,1,'They don\'t stay around the table.','None','00:08:39.217','00:08:41.120','ANGER','','NORMAL','2026-09-17 18:38:42','2026-09-17 18:38:42',52.31,100.00),(175,1,'Another approach could be, so that was hateful.','None','00:08:41.153','00:08:44.123','ANGER','','NORMAL','2026-09-17 18:38:42','2026-09-17 18:38:42',98.03,100.00),(176,1,'What\'s going on here?','None','00:08:44.156','00:08:45.057','FEAR','','NORMAL','2026-09-17 18:38:42','2026-09-17 18:38:42',50.91,100.00),(177,1,'Why are we talking about this?','None','00:08:45.090','00:08:46.292','ANGER','','NORMAL','2026-09-17 18:38:42','2026-09-17 18:38:42',87.86,100.00),(178,1,'What\'s underneath that?','None','00:08:46.325','00:08:47.626','ANGER','','NORMAL','2026-09-17 18:38:42','2026-09-17 18:38:42',47.84,100.00),(179,1,'I believe in fact you\'ve, you\'ve got freedom, but it only really is successful if you have','None','00:08:58.003','00:09:03.108','JOY','','NORMAL','2026-09-17 18:38:42','2026-09-17 18:38:42',98.59,100.00),(180,1,'will be out, often that emerges through how you talk about it.','None','00:09:13.986','00:09:18.357','ANGER','','NORMAL','2026-09-17 18:38:42','2026-09-17 18:38:42',37.08,100.00),(181,1,'That said there have to be boundaries too.','None','00:09:20.592','00:09:23.395','ANGER','','NORMAL','2026-09-17 18:38:42','2026-09-17 18:38:42',66.42,100.00),(182,1,'And we know this from millennia of theorists about, you\'re not free unless you have some boundaries, and--','None','00:09:23.428','00:09:29.768','JOY','','NORMAL','2026-09-17 18:38:42','2026-09-17 18:38:42',92.02,100.00),(183,1,'HEFFNER: Well, you don\'t have a civil free society, BRADLEY: Ultimately you\'ve got --','None','00:09:29.801','00:09:33.772','JOY','','NORMAL','2026-09-17 18:38:42','2026-09-17 18:38:42',94.49,100.00),(184,1,'HEFFNER: Those have to animate democratic rule.','None','00:09:33.805','00:09:36.375','JOY','','NORMAL','2026-09-17 18:38:42','2026-09-17 18:38:42',91.59,100.00),(185,1,'BRADLEY: Yeah.','None','00:09:36.408','00:09:37.343','JOY','','NORMAL','2026-09-17 18:38:42','2026-09-17 18:38:42',82.86,100.00),(186,1,'HEFFNER: Otherwise it slips into anarchy.','None','00:09:37.376','00:09:39.278','ANGER','','NORMAL','2026-09-17 18:38:42','2026-09-17 18:38:42',66.00,100.00),(187,1,'BRADLEY: Anarchy.','None','00:09:39.311','00:09:40.145','ANGER','','NORMAL','2026-09-17 18:38:42','2026-09-17 18:38:42',85.70,100.00),(188,1,'HEFFNER: Right.','None','00:09:40.178','00:09:40.980','JOY','','NORMAL','2026-09-17 18:38:42','2026-09-17 18:38:42',43.41,100.00),(189,1,'BRADLEY: Right. Exactly.','None','00:09:41.013','00:09:42.214','JOY','','NORMAL','2026-09-17 18:38:42','2026-09-17 18:38:42',65.03,100.00),(190,1,'drawing those boundaries in a way that is recognizable and is not censoring people.','None','00:09:48.920','00:09:54.293','JOY','','NORMAL','2026-09-17 18:38:42','2026-09-17 18:38:42',88.90,100.00),(191,1,'BRADLEY: Yep. No question about it. And...','None','00:09:54.326','00:09:55.761','JOY','','NORMAL','2026-09-17 18:38:42','2026-09-17 18:38:42',65.25,100.00),(192,1,'HEFFNER: Because we need a grand strategy right now for these social media companies that have','None','00:09:55.794','00:10:00.065','JOY','','NORMAL','2026-09-17 18:38:42','2026-09-17 18:38:42',95.87,100.00),(193,1,'abdicated responsibility.','None','00:10:00.098','00:10:01.700','ANGER','','NORMAL','2026-09-17 18:38:42','2026-09-17 18:38:42',44.65,100.00),(194,1,'BRADLEY: Yeah.','None','00:10:01.733','00:10:02.734','JOY','','NORMAL','2026-09-17 18:38:42','2026-09-17 18:38:42',82.86,100.00),(195,1,'you know, if we think about Elinor Ostrom, get the boundaries determined upfront.','None','00:10:08.640','00:10:13.212','JOY','','NORMAL','2026-09-17 18:38:42','2026-09-17 18:38:42',98.00,100.00),(196,1,'When people aren\'t so heated, when you\'re kind of calm, nothing has happened.','None','00:10:13.245','00:10:17.282','JOY','','NORMAL','2026-09-17 18:38:42','2026-09-17 18:38:42',66.09,100.00),(197,1,'And a good example of this is when we have speakers, you know, we are very alert about what speakers','None','00:10:25.757','00:10:33.365','JOY','','NORMAL','2026-09-17 18:38:42','2026-09-17 18:38:42',69.56,100.00),(198,1,'who are very controversial can do to a campus.','None','00:10:33.398','00:10:35.734','ANGER','','NORMAL','2026-09-17 18:38:42','2026-09-17 18:38:42',97.43,100.00),(199,1,'And so often, you know, the hate comes from the outside.','None','00:10:35.767','00:10:39.538','ANGER','','NORMAL','2026-09-17 18:38:42','2026-09-17 18:38:42',95.23,100.00),(200,1,'It doesn\'t emerge on the inside. It really comes to you.','None','00:10:39.571','00:10:42.775','JOY','','NORMAL','2026-09-17 18:38:42','2026-09-17 18:38:42',52.05,100.00),(201,1,'So we have developed a really great process for this that involves, we have a set of peacekeepers','None','00:10:45.711','00:10:52.551','JOY','','NORMAL','2026-09-17 18:38:42','2026-09-17 18:38:42',97.73,100.00),(202,1,'that are students who have been trained themselves about how to contain if things get completely out of control.','None','00:10:52.584','00:10:58.490','JOY','','NORMAL','2026-09-17 18:38:42','2026-09-17 18:38:42',77.00,100.00),(203,1,'For instance, at the beginning of the talk, these are the rules of the talk.','None','00:11:06.398','00:11:10.636','ANGER','','NORMAL','2026-09-17 18:38:42','2026-09-17 18:38:42',54.45,100.00),(204,1,'Everybody gets one question.','None','00:11:10.669','00:11:11.937','JOY','','NORMAL','2026-09-17 18:38:42','2026-09-17 18:38:42',56.63,100.00),(205,1,'You don\'t get more than one question.','None','00:11:11.970','00:11:13.839','ANGER','','NORMAL','2026-09-17 18:38:42','2026-09-17 18:38:42',51.92,100.00),(206,1,'The moderator will hold the microphone, you know, they\'re tiny things to very large','None','00:11:13.872','00:11:19.244','FEAR','','NORMAL','2026-09-17 18:38:42','2026-09-17 18:38:42',41.20,100.00),(207,1,'things; that it will end at seven o\'clock.','None','00:11:19.277','00:11:22.581','ANGER','','NORMAL','2026-09-17 18:38:42','2026-09-17 18:38:42',38.86,100.00),(208,1,'It won\'t just keep bleeding on if like things are getting out of control. It ends at this time.','None','00:11:22.614','00:11:27.352','SADNESS','','NORMAL','2026-09-17 18:38:42','2026-09-17 18:38:42',76.43,100.00),(209,1,'the devil is in the details, and some of these they\'re like leverage points,','None','00:11:32.257','00:11:36.862','ANGER','','NORMAL','2026-09-17 18:38:42','2026-09-17 18:38:42',83.90,100.00),(210,1,'small bounded rules that you put in place when people are calm and they agree to the rules and','None','00:11:36.895','00:11:43.635','JOY','','NORMAL','2026-09-17 18:38:42','2026-09-17 18:38:42',95.31,100.00),(211,1,'then you enforce the rules when it happens.','None','00:11:43.668','00:11:45.504','ANGER','','NORMAL','2026-09-17 18:38:42','2026-09-17 18:38:42',60.29,100.00),(212,1,'HEFFNER: As you said from the outset, you do have to determine whether someone\'s intent','None','00:11:45.537','00:11:51.210','ANGER','','NORMAL','2026-09-17 18:38:42','2026-09-17 18:38:42',40.10,100.00),(213,1,'or an institution\'s intent is constructive or destructive.','None','00:11:51.243','00:11:54.980','ANGER','','NORMAL','2026-09-17 18:38:42','2026-09-17 18:38:42',74.31,100.00),(214,1,'And, you know, that\'s a nuanced conversation that we can only have once we have a First Amendment,','None','00:11:55.013','00:12:00.986','JOY','','NORMAL','2026-09-17 18:38:42','2026-09-17 18:38:42',59.22,100.00),(215,1,'but we have to have it.','None','00:12:01.019','00:12:01.954','ANGER','','NORMAL','2026-09-17 18:38:42','2026-09-17 18:38:42',31.06,100.00),(216,1,'BRADLEY: Yeah.','None','00:12:01.987','00:12:02.821','JOY','','NORMAL','2026-09-17 18:38:42','2026-09-17 18:38:42',82.86,100.00),(217,1,'And if someone\'s intent is destructive, you hope your rules are robust enough that you can','None','00:12:02.855','00:12:08.961','JOY','','NORMAL','2026-09-17 18:38:42','2026-09-17 18:38:42',97.92,100.00),(218,1,'protect people from that destruction. And that\'s what you\'re going for because it\'s hard to tell at the time.','None','00:12:08.994','00:12:14.500','ANGER','','NORMAL','2026-09-17 18:38:42','2026-09-17 18:38:42',64.75,100.00),(219,1,'HEFFNER: And what is defined as counterproductive or destructive as opposed to constructive or productive','None','00:12:14.533','00:12:19.371','ANGER','','NORMAL','2026-09-17 18:38:42','2026-09-17 18:38:42',82.59,100.00),(220,1,'in terms of speech and governance, that is viewed as a subjective matter now more','None','00:12:19.404','00:12:24.476','ANGER','','NORMAL','2026-09-17 18:38:42','2026-09-17 18:38:42',45.71,100.00),(221,1,'than an objective matter.','None','00:12:24.509','00:12:26.145','JOY','','NORMAL','2026-09-17 18:38:42','2026-09-17 18:38:42',91.40,100.00),(222,1,'private and public around the country, what are they saying about these kinds of subjective','None','00:12:31.216','00:12:35.220','ANGER','','NORMAL','2026-09-17 18:38:42','2026-09-17 18:38:42',72.36,100.00),(223,1,'tests that we employ?','None','00:12:35.253','00:12:37.089','ANGER','','NORMAL','2026-09-17 18:38:42','2026-09-17 18:38:42',52.80,100.00),(224,1,'BRADLEY: You know, I think that most college presidents and universities are thinking','None','00:12:37.122','00:12:42.127','JOY','','NORMAL','2026-09-17 18:38:42','2026-09-17 18:38:42',37.87,100.00),(225,1,'all the time about how to allow both freedom and safety to be on the campus.','None','00:12:42.160','00:12:48.433','JOY','','NORMAL','2026-09-17 18:38:42','2026-09-17 18:38:42',87.25,100.00),(226,1,'And I, I think this is a really important thing as we talk about campuses, we have to remember that','None','00:12:51.736','00:12:56.642','JOY','','NORMAL','2026-09-17 18:38:42','2026-09-17 18:38:42',98.10,100.00),(227,1,'these students, they start as first years, they\'re 18 years old, then they\'re sophomores and','None','00:12:56.675','00:13:02.447','JOY','','NORMAL','2026-09-17 18:38:42','2026-09-17 18:38:42',68.28,100.00),(228,1,'sophomoric is a word for a reason.','None','00:13:02.480','00:13:04.483','ANGER','','NORMAL','2026-09-17 18:38:42','2026-09-17 18:38:42',69.88,100.00),(229,1,'Because often in sophomore year, you know, people grab on an ideology and they\'re','None','00:13:04.516','00:13:08.854','ANGER','','NORMAL','2026-09-17 18:38:42','2026-09-17 18:38:42',58.86,100.00),(230,1,'putting on that ideology for three weeks and then they\'re going to put on another.','None','00:13:08.887','00:13:12.291','ANGER','','NORMAL','2026-09-17 18:38:42','2026-09-17 18:38:42',66.97,100.00),(231,1,'And so, so often colleges are sort of made fun of for the silly things that happen because people take','None','00:13:13.392','00:13:20.065','ANGER','','NORMAL','2026-09-17 18:38:42','2026-09-17 18:38:42',89.51,100.00),(232,1,'But by the time that student\'s a senior, if they\'ve gone through several of these events','None','00:13:24.202','00:13:29.875','FEAR','','NORMAL','2026-09-17 18:38:42','2026-09-17 18:38:42',36.50,100.00),(233,1,'and there\'ve been boundaries and there\'s been good leadership, you know, they\'re going to laugh at themselves back when','None','00:13:29.908','00:13:34.079','JOY','','NORMAL','2026-09-17 18:38:42','2026-09-17 18:38:42',69.59,100.00),(234,1,'they\'re sophomores too. We all did that stuff like that.','None','00:13:34.112','00:13:36.615','ANGER','','NORMAL','2026-09-17 18:38:42','2026-09-17 18:38:42',53.67,100.00),(235,1,'What\'s dangerous in our own world and in terms of how we get media around is just today\'s world those','None','00:13:36.648','00:13:44.323','ANGER','','NORMAL','2026-09-17 18:38:42','2026-09-17 18:38:42',97.13,100.00),(236,1,'silly mistakes that get made, you know, in one lecture hall at the end of a','None','00:13:44.356','00:13:48.727','SADNESS','','NORMAL','2026-09-17 18:38:42','2026-09-17 18:38:42',53.13,100.00),(237,1,'And what used to be words can\'t hurt you: it\'s just words.','None','00:13:51.263','00:13:55.300','SADNESS','','NORMAL','2026-09-17 18:38:42','2026-09-17 18:38:42',96.78,100.00),(238,1,'HEFFNER: Right.','None','00:14:00.372','00:14:01.473','JOY','','NORMAL','2026-09-17 18:38:42','2026-09-17 18:38:42',43.41,100.00),(239,1,'BRADLEY: And your future employers can see them quickly.','None','00:14:01.507','00:14:03.175','JOY','','NORMAL','2026-09-17 18:38:42','2026-09-17 18:38:42',96.70,100.00),(240,1,'And as a result, I think that the stakes are just so high now and that we really do try to educate','None','00:14:03.208','00:14:10.749','JOY','','NORMAL','2026-09-17 18:38:42','2026-09-17 18:38:42',97.05,100.00),(241,1,'all of us about, you know, from administrators to staff, to faculty, students,','None','00:14:10.782','00:14:15.387','ANGER','','NORMAL','2026-09-17 18:38:42','2026-09-17 18:38:42',66.61,100.00),(242,1,'And so we work pretty hard on that as part of the education.','None','00:14:21.993','00:14:24.763','JOY','','NORMAL','2026-09-17 18:38:42','2026-09-17 18:38:42',91.82,100.00),(243,1,'HEFFNER: Today and today\'s unequal society is so','None','00:14:24.796','00:14:30.035','SADNESS','','NORMAL','2026-09-17 18:38:42','2026-09-17 18:38:42',73.28,100.00),(244,1,'measurable in the vastness of the inequity that we have a presidential candidate and many','None','00:14:30.068','00:14:37.976','JOY','','NORMAL','2026-09-17 18:38:42','2026-09-17 18:38:42',93.83,100.00),(245,1,'proposing major overhauls that are sometimes detailed and sometimes systemic,','None','00:14:46.851','00:14:52.024','JOY','','NORMAL','2026-09-17 18:38:42','2026-09-17 18:38:42',55.04,100.00),(246,1,'and how they\'re going to try to better our economy for more people. Being at the helm of a university,','None','00:14:52.057','00:14:57.829','JOY','','NORMAL','2026-09-17 18:38:42','2026-09-17 18:38:42',79.80,100.00),(247,1,'but also being a political scientist, to put your political scientist hat on right now,','None','00:14:57.862','00:15:02.100','JOY','','NORMAL','2026-09-17 18:38:42','2026-09-17 18:38:42',56.37,100.00),(248,1,'meant to our discourse.','None','00:15:19.084','00:15:20.385','ANGER','','NORMAL','2026-09-17 18:38:42','2026-09-17 18:38:42',80.14,100.00),(249,1,'But how successful do you anticipate they\'re going to be at negotiating with the American people on','None','00:15:20.418','00:15:29.962',