45.003','00:16:47.105','ANGER','','NORMAL','2026-09-17 18:38:42','2026-09-17 18:38:42',38.23,100.00),(261,1,'HEFFNER: I just came back from Iowa and speaking with an Uber driver who considered himself very conservative.','None','00:16:47.138','00:16:55.480','ANGER','','NORMAL','2026-09-17 18:38:42','2026-09-17 18:38:42',90.44,100.00),(262,1,'And we came to a conclusion that whether you consider yourself pretty conservative or','None','00:16:55.513','00:16:59.851','JOY','','NORMAL','2026-09-17 18:38:42','2026-09-17 18:38:42',45.13,100.00),(263,1,'pretty liberal, you are discontent with the status quo, the economic status quo in this country that','None','00:16:59.884','00:17:06.491','ANGER','','NORMAL','2026-09-17 18:38:42','2026-09-17 18:38:42',87.06,100.00),(264,1,'President Trump intended to and promised to correct.','None','00:17:06.524','00:17:10.896','JOY','','NORMAL','2026-09-17 18:38:42','2026-09-17 18:38:42',84.52,100.00),(265,1,'He said he alone could fix it when it came to economic distress.','None','00:17:10.929','00:17:17.436','SADNESS','','NORMAL','2026-09-17 18:38:42','2026-09-17 18:38:42',63.02,100.00),(266,1,'And so you don\'t really have these two populations living in silos other than maybe their registration,','None','00:17:17.469','00:17:25.644','FEAR','','NORMAL','2026-09-17 18:38:42','2026-09-17 18:38:42',32.79,100.00),(267,1,'with the exception of the oligarchic community, which wants the status quo.','None','00:17:25.677','00:17:30.082','ANGER','','NORMAL','2026-09-17 18:38:42','2026-09-17 18:38:42',69.91,100.00),(268,1,'So you have pretty conservative and pretty liberal people who would probably agree about human','None','00:17:30.115','00:17:36.288','JOY','','NORMAL','2026-09-17 18:38:42','2026-09-17 18:38:42',72.77,100.00),(269,1,'dignity and probably agree about an economy that respects human dignity.','None','00:17:36.321','00:17:42.394','JOY','','NORMAL','2026-09-17 18:38:42','2026-09-17 18:38:42',93.98,100.00),(270,1,'BRADLEY: That certainly what she is trying to do is figuring out exactly what that language is.','None','00:17:51.369','00:17:55.207','JOY','','NORMAL','2026-09-17 18:38:42','2026-09-17 18:38:42',60.45,100.00),(271,1,'HEFFNER: What is it?','None','00:17:55.240','00:17:56.308','FEAR','','NORMAL','2026-09-17 18:38:42','2026-09-17 18:38:42',57.65,100.00),(272,1,'BRADLEY: Well listen, I think your point that people agree a lot more than you think they agree is true.','None','00:17:56.341','00:18:02.147','JOY','','NORMAL','2026-09-17 18:38:42','2026-09-17 18:38:42',97.09,100.00),(273,1,'We\'ve seen it in healthcare completely, I mean everybody wants everybody to have access','None','00:18:02.180','00:18:07.052','JOY','','NORMAL','2026-09-17 18:38:42','2026-09-17 18:38:42',64.58,100.00),(274,1,'to healthcare who doesn\'t want, someone who needs to get healthy to have access to healthcare.','None','00:18:07.085','00:18:11.623','JOY','','NORMAL','2026-09-17 18:38:42','2026-09-17 18:38:42',97.13,100.00),(275,1,'Everybody wants it.','None','00:18:11.656','00:18:13.091','JOY','','NORMAL','2026-09-17 18:38:42','2026-09-17 18:38:42',55.73,100.00),(276,1,'everyone can get healthcare and yes we can have more income equality.','None','00:18:28.473','00:18:32.944','JOY','','NORMAL','2026-09-17 18:38:42','2026-09-17 18:38:42',97.38,100.00),(277,1,'We agree, but the devil is in the details.','None','00:18:36.814','00:18:39.718','JOY','','NORMAL','2026-09-17 18:38:42','2026-09-17 18:38:42',57.26,100.00),(278,1,'Again, when you get to, okay...','None','00:18:39.751','00:18:41.019','JOY','','NORMAL','2026-09-17 18:38:42','2026-09-17 18:38:42',88.37,100.00),(279,1,'HEFFNER: No I agree, it\'s part of the grand reconciliation.','None','00:18:41.052','00:18:43.989','JOY','','NORMAL','2026-09-17 18:38:42','2026-09-17 18:38:42',93.15,100.00),(280,1,'The grand strategy we need right now is grand reconciliation.','None','00:18:44.022','00:18:48.326','JOY','','NORMAL','2026-09-17 18:38:42','2026-09-17 18:38:42',9