 18:38:42',93.62,100.00),(291,1,'and you have to say, yeah, what\'s the policy?','None','00:20:03.635','00:20:05.637','ANGER','','NORMAL','2026-09-17 18:38:42','2026-09-17 18:38:42',58.08,100.00),(292,1,'What is the manifestation of what we\'re going to do?','None','00:20:05.670','00:20:08.039','ANGER','','NORMAL','2026-09-17 18:38:42','2026-09-17 18:38:42',56.95,100.00),(293,1,'And I think the particularly in my own field of public health, one of the most successful','None','00:20:08.072','00:20:14.613','JOY','','NORMAL','2026-09-17 18:38:42','2026-09-17 18:38:42',98.72,100.00),(294,1,'global health ever innovations happened during George Bush\'s time with PEPFAR, AIDS relief,','None','00:20:14.646','00:20:20.518','JOY','','NORMAL','2026-09-17 18:38:42','2026-09-17 18:38:42',86.06,100.00),(295,1,'and one of the grand strategies he really had was to bring the left and the right together around','None','00:20:20.551','00:20:27.659','JOY','','NORMAL','2026-09-17 18:38:42','2026-09-17 18:38:42',88.65,100.00),(296,1,'about how he would write the legislation so that the left and the right could stand behind it.','None','00:20:35.700','00:20:41.072','ANGER','','NORMAL','2026-09-17 18:38:42','2026-09-17 18:38:42',69.28,100.00),(297,1,'targeted at non-domestic crises.','None','00:20:45.977','00:20:48.980','ANGER','','NORMAL','2026-09-17 18:38:42','2026-09-17 18:38:42',87.89,100.00),(298,1,'So it\'s a matter of ordering -- HEFFNER: Right, priorities.','None','00:20:58.222','00:21:01.192','JOY','','NORMAL','2026-09-17 18:38:42','2026-09-17 18:38:42',80.92,100.00),(299,1,'BRADLEY: And where he could find the opportunity to really demonstrate some collegiality across','None','00:21:01.225','00:21:07.232','JOY','','NORMAL','2026-09-17 18:38:42','2026-09-17 18:38:42',91.34,100.00),(300,1,'the lines and then using that as leverage to say, okay, this is what we\'re doing all over Africa.','None','00:21:07.265','00:21:09.968','JOY','','NORMAL','2026-09-17 18:38:42','2026-09-17 18:38:42',91.83,100.00),(301,1,'What are we doing right here?','None','00:21:10.001','00:21:11.836','ANGER','','NORMAL','2026-09-17 18:38:42','2026-09-17 18:38:42',36.41,100.00),(302,1,'And I think that those, you know, we\'re in a different world now,','None','00:21:11.869','00:21:15.440','ANGER','','NORMAL','2026-09-17 18:38:42','2026-09-17 18:38:42',42.92,100.00),(303,1,'about supporting humanity and sticking with it for awhile.','None','00:21:21.379','00:21:24.482','JOY','','NORMAL','2026-09-17 18:38:42','2026-09-17 18:38:42',48.61,100.00),(304,1,'right to have healthcare if we have such devious inequality and extremes...','None','00:21:31.556','00:21:39.764','ANGER','','NORMAL','2026-09-17 18:38:42','2026-09-17 18:38:42',50.60,100.00),(305,1,'BRADLEY: Or divisive.','None','00:21:39.797','00:21:40.765','ANGER','','NORMAL','2026-09-17 18:38:42','2026-09-17 18:38:42',48.70,100.00),(306,1,'BRADLEY: I guess so. Yeah. Yeah.','None','00:21:44.969','00:21:46.271','JOY','','NORMAL','2026-09-17 18:38:42','2026-09-17 18:38:42',80.21,100.00),(307,1,'HEFFNER: But at least give everybody, you know, adequate quality care.','None','00:21:46.304','00:21:50.342','JOY','','NORMAL','2026-09-17 18:38:42','2026-09-17 18:38:42',98.43,100.00),(308,1,'BRADLEY: Yeah.','None','00:21:50.375','00:21:51.343','JOY','','NORMAL','2026-09-17 18:38:42','2026-09-17 18:38:42',82.86,100.00),(309,1,'BRADLEY: Yeah.','None','00:21:55.346','00:21:56.381','JOY','','NORMAL','2026-09-17 18:38:42','2026-09-17 18:38:42',82.86,100.00),(310,1,'HEFFNER: So how do you look at realizing what is American\'s left and right desire for their friends,','None','00:21:56.414','00:22:02.554','JOY','','NORMAL','2026-09-17 18:38:42','2026-09-17 18:38:42',95.84,100.00),(311,1,'family, and communities to have the right to health care?','None','00:22:02.587','00:22:05.023','ANGER','','NORMAL','2026-09-17 18:38:42','2026-09-17 18:38:42',56.77,100.00),(312,1,'with healthcare and Medicare for All.','None','00:22:10.161','00:22:11.730','JOY','','NORMAL','2026-09-17 18:38:42','2026-09-17 18:38:42',64.38,100.00),(313,1,'What you just said, we want our friends and family to have everything. That\'s so true.','None','00:22:11.763','00:22:16.735','JOY','','NORMAL','2026-09-17 18:38:42','2026-09-17 18:38:42',87.35,100.00),(314,1,'What we have a really hard time and it\'s very historical in the United States is really including','None','00:22:16.768','00:22:21.339','JOY','','NORMAL','2026-09-17 18:38:42','2026-09-17 18:38:42',67.74,100.00),(315,1,'everybody in that.','None','00:22:21.372','00:22:22.273','ANGER','','NORMAL','2026-09-17 18:38:42','2026-09-17 18:38:42',55.56,100.00),(316,1,'And when we\'ve traveled to other countries that have been quite successful in covering their entire','None','00:22:36.854','00:22:41.025','JOY','','NORMAL','2026-09-17 18:38:42','2026-09-17 18:38:42',98.47,100.00),(317,1,'interconnectedness and community.','None','00:22:49.700','00:22:51.169','JOY','','NORMAL','2026-09-17 18:38:42','2026-09-17 18:38:42',65.95,100.00),(318,1,'And because you are a citizen, you get this and that is you get a job,','None','00:22:51.202','00:22:56.741','JOY','','NORMAL','2026-09-17 18:38:42','2026-09-17 18:38:42',56.18,100.00),(319,1,'We\'re not that good at this here.','None','00:22:59.277','00:23:01.546','JOY','','NORMAL','2026-09-17 18:38:42','2026-09-17 18:38:42',95.59,100.00),(320,1,'We\'re much more, well we got it because we earned it, and you, I don\'t know.','None','00:23:01.579','00:23:06.785','JOY','','NORMAL','2026-09-17 18:38:42','2026-09-17 18:38:42',95.81,100.00),(321,1,'And I think it\'s because we\'re so big.','None','00:23:06.818','00:23:09.521','JOY','','NORMAL','2026-09-17 18:38:42','2026-09-17 18:38:42',93.01,100.00),(322,1,'I mean, we just look at our country; we have so much trouble feeling “as one.” So back','None','00:23:12.256','00:23:18.396','JOY','','NORMAL','2026-09-17 18:38:42','2026-09-17 18:38:42',80.66,100.00),(323,1,'to what you had asked about what coul