43.681','JOY','','NORMAL','2026-09-17 18:38:42','2026-09-17 18:38:42',79.41,100.00),(334,1,'sides of our healthcare system, housing, early childhood education, nutrition.','None','00:24:43.714','00:24:48.052','JOY','','NORMAL','2026-09-17 18:38:42','2026-09-17 18:38:42',55.91,100.00),(335,1,'HEFFNER: If you are going to employ a wealth tax to ensure a public option that is fair and equitable','None','00:24:48.085','00:24:54.125','JOY','','NORMAL','2026-09-17 18:38:42','2026-09-17 18:38:42',97.79,100.00),(336,1,'and high quality, and maybe Mayor Pete who\'s talked about a more moderate approach to','None','00:24:54.158','00:24:59.797','JOY','','NORMAL','2026-09-17 18:38:42','2026-09-17 18:38:42',92.50,100.00),(337,1,'Senator Warren\'s wealth tax would mean for these billionaires.','None','00:25:10.508','00:25:13.545','JOY','','NORMAL','2026-09-17 18:38:42','2026-09-17 18:38:42',84.42,100.00),(338,1,'And, you know, I think the advocates of Patriotic Millionaires and billionaires and who see','None','00:25:20.251','00:25:27.859','JOY','','NORMAL','2026-09-17 18:38:42','2026-09-17 18:38:42',93.75,100.00),(339,1,'the current tax situation as so disruptive to civil society recognize that people don\'t fully','None','00:25:27.892','00:25:33.131','ANGER','','NORMAL','2026-09-17 18:38:42','2026-09-17 18:38:42',56.32,100.00),(340,1,'understand what $1 billion dollars is.','None','00:25:33.164','00:25:36.501','JOY','','NORMAL','2026-09-17 18:38:42','2026-09-17 18:38:42',81.67,100.00),(341,1,'BRADLEY: Mmhmmm. Right.','None','00:25:36.534','00:25:37.435','JOY','','NORMAL','2026-09-17 18:38:42','2026-09-17 18:38:42',55.55,100.00),(342,1,'HEFFNER: The wealth tax is an honorable and legitimate and strategic proposal,','None','00:25:37.469','00:25:43.241','JOY','','NORMAL','2026-09-17 18:38:42','2026-09-17 18:38:42',97.97,100.00),(343,1,'a grand proposal.','None','00:25:43.274','00:25:44.776','JOY','','NORMAL','2026-09-17 18:38:42','2026-09-17 18:38:42',76.83,100.00),(344,1,'everything that everyone wants, well, that\'s in dispute.','None','00:25:51.415','00:25:53.885','ANGER','','NORMAL','2026-09-17 18:38:42','2026-09-17 18:38:42',87.25,100.00),(345,1,'What\'s not in dispute is that you would have important public funds to dedicate to important','None','00:25:53.918','00:25:59.624','JOY','','NORMAL','2026-09-17 18:38:42','2026-09-17 18:38:42',95.98,100.00),(346,1,'BRADLEY: I think the jury is out.','None','00:26:02.259','00:26:03.795','JOY','','NORMAL','2026-09-17 18:38:42','2026-09-17 18:38:42',50.75,100.00),(347,1,'HEFFNER: We don\'t know either way at this point.','None','00:26:08.032','00:26:10.468','FEAR','','NORMAL','2026-09-17 18:38:42','2026-09-17 18:38:42',59.76,100.00),(348,1,'BRADLEY: I just don\'t think we can possibly know.','None','00:26:10.501','00:26:11.636','FEAR','','NORMAL','2026-09-17 18:38:42','2026-09-17 18:38:42',77.12,100.00),(349,1,'And you know how markets respond to things.','None','00:26:11.669','00:26:14.372','JOY','','NORMAL','2026-09-17 18:38:42','2026-09-17 18:38:42',77.02,100.00),(350,1,'So once you change the rules, they\'re going to be a lot of other interactions that','None','00:26:14.405','00:26:18.476','ANGER','','NORMAL','2026-09-17 18:38:42','2026-09-17 18:38:42',64.57,100.00),(351,1,'occur that could really change the way things work too.','None','00:26:18.509','00:26:21.479','JOY','','NORMAL','2026-09-17 18:38:42','2026-09-17 18:38:42',42.19,100.00),(352,1,'So I think it is, there\'s no way to tell it would work.','None','00:26:21.512','00:26:24.549','JOY','','NORMAL','2026-09-17 18:38:42','2026-09-17 18:38:42',47.51,100.00),(353,1,'But is it enough?','None','00:26:29.153','00:26:31.389','ANGER','','NORMAL','2026-09-17 18:38:42','2026-09-17 18:38:42',36.55,100.00),(354,1,'What will the unintended effects be? Unclear.','None','00:26:31.422','00:26:34.158','FEAR','','NORMAL','2026-09-17 18:38:42','2026-09-17 18:38:42',91.94,100.00),(355,1,'And a lot of people have tried this kind of work before in our, 