corps','00:01:23.987','00:01:29.302','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','HARD_WORD','2026-09-17 19:00:37','2026-09-17 19:00:37',94.12,98.24),(2672,4,'David: Now, how many of you are familiar with Peace Corps?','peace corps','00:01:31.012','00:01:34.810','SURPRISE','Will translate during reel generation...','HARD_WORD','2026-09-17 19:00:37','2026-09-17 19:00:37',39.68,94.92),(2673,4,'Do we have any returned Peace Corps volunteers in the audience?','peace corps','00:01:36.314','00:01:40.464','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','HARD_WORD','2026-09-17 19:00:37','2026-09-17 19:00:37',34.58,94.07),(2674,4,'In the box on the application that asked for \"Country of preference,\"','country of','00:02:25.007','00:02:29.677','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','HARD_WORD','2026-09-17 19:00:37','2026-09-17 19:00:37',47.97,80.36),(2675,4,'Second, it wants to improve the understanding of America and Americans by host country nationals.','host country','00:03:15.465','00:03:21.974','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','HARD_WORD','2026-09-17 19:00:37','2026-09-17 19:00:37',96.98,98.88),(2676,4,'For the 17 years prior to Peace Corps, I was the executive director of quality at a packaging company.','peace corps','00:04:18.205','00:04:26.476','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','HARD_WORD','2026-09-17 19:00:37','2026-09-17 19:00:37',76.35,74.23),(2677,4,'So when we thought about applying to the Peace Corps, I thought that those skills between my microbiology background,','microbiology','00:04:30.330','00:04:37.986','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','HARD_WORD','2026-09-17 19:00:37','2026-09-17 19:00:37',56.51,87.26),(2678,4,'and Peace Corps would be able to utilize my skills.','peace corps','00:04:45.257','00:04:48.192','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','HARD_WORD','2026-09-17 19:00:37','2026-09-17 19:00:37',97.80,77.71),(2679,4,'In those training villages, we were given intensive language instruction in colloquial Arabic','colloquial','00:05:10.194','00:05:17.431','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','HARD_WORD','2026-09-17 19:00:37','2026-09-17 19:00:37',91.65,92.57),(2680,4,'so that we will be good Peace Corps volunteers.','peace corps','00:06:10.842','00:06:14.254','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','HARD_WORD','2026-09-17 19:00:37','2026-09-17 19:00:37',98.67,98.47),(2681,4,'Cathy: My primary assignment for Peace Corps was to teach English at a university in our town.','peace corps','00:07:12.368','00:07:18.565','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','HARD_WORD','2026-09-17 19:00:37','2026-09-17 19:00:37',69.60,71.29),(2682,4,'about coming to teach an English conversation class for them.','english conversation','00:07:44.458','00:07:48.135','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','HARD_WORD','2026-09-17 19:00:37','2026-09-17 19:00:37',49.88,82.99),(2683,4,'And David was able to go along on these trips with me,','go along','00:08:04.628','00:08:08.035','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','IDIOM','2026-09-17 19:00:37','2026-09-17 19:00:37',92.80,99.27),(2684,4,'that I did with several of our fellow Peace Corps volunteers.','peace corps','00:08:55.558','00:08:58.801','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','HARD_WORD','2026-09-17 19:00:37','2026-09-17 19:00:37',62.93,91.57),(2685,4,'The boy\'s camp was held at a retreat in Northern Jordan.','northern','00:08:59.121','00:09:02.746','FEAR','Will translate during reel generation...','HARD_WORD','2026-09-17 19:00:37','2026-09-17 19:00:37',61.89,75.22),(2686,4,'The Jordanian sense of hospitality is very different from ours here in America.','jordanian','00:09:40.127','00:09:45.620','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','HARD_WORD','2026-09-17 19:00:37','2026-09-17 19:00:37',83.91,78.19),(2687,4,'but we Americans tend to offer our hospitality','americans','00:09:51.288','00:09:57.341','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','HARD_WORD','2026-09-17 19:00:37','2026-09-17 19:00:37',89.68,90.51),(2688,4,'and someone will call out to you, the furniture dealer down the street:','furniture','00:10:18.780','00:10:23.448','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','HARD_WORD','2026-09-17 19:00:37','2026-09-17 19:00:37',72.16,92.97),(2689,4,'You can share a piece of cake, a cup of tea, a good conversation.','piece of cake','00:10:41.257','00:10:45.878','JOY','তুমি এক টুকরো কেক, এক কাপ চা আর একটা ভালো আড্ডা ভাগ করে নিতে পারো।','IDIOM','2026-09-17 19:00:37','2026-09-17 19:24:22',94.42,94.91),(2690,4,'to share with a neighbour, a friend, a family member, and sit back for a few minutes and appreciate life,','sit back','00:10:54.038','00:11:02.518','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','IDIOM','2026-09-17 19:00:37','2026-09-17 19:00:37',67.13,97.62),(2691,4,'It\'s what I sometimes refer to as \"the Arab version of Mañana culture.\"','manana','00:11:04.527','00:11:09.530','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','HARD_WORD','2026-09-17 19:00:37','2026-09-17 19:00:37',50.24,76.19),(2692,4,'Jordanian men are very demonstrative, and express affection with each other, and especially with children.','jordanian','00:11:41.946','00:11:49.191','LOVE','Will translate during reel generation...','HARD_WORD','2026-09-17 19:00:37','2026-09-17 19:00:37',92.33,82.53),(2693,4,'Children are showered with love and affection every day, in every way;','in every way','00:11:50.362','00:11:55.416','LOVE','Will translate during reel generation...','HARD_WORD','2026-09-17 19:00:37','2026-09-17 19:00:37',58.71,90.28),(2694,4,'You can meet somebody on the street whom you may know them slightly,','slightly','00:12:00.111','00:12:04.821','FEAR','Will translate during reel generation...','HARD_WORD','2026-09-17 19:00:37','2026-09-17 19:00:37',60.66,77.26),(2695,4,'We lived with a host family and the host family brother lived next door,','host family','00:12:31.172','00:12:37.179','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','HARD_WORD','2026-09-17 19:00:37','2026-09-17 19:00:37',47.14,81.84),(2696,4,'That\'s a very central part of Jordanian life, and it colors everything they do.','jordanian','00:12:47.344','00:12:54.500','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','HARD_WORD','2026-09-17 19:00:37','2026-09-17 19:00:37',88.70,88.22),(2697,4,'Tribes are the real operating force','operating','00:13:00.283','00:13:06.142','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','HARD_WORD','2026-09-17 19:00:37','2026-09-17 19:00:37',53.20,98.18),(2698,4,'in Jordanian society.','jordanian','00:13:06.302','00:13:08.262','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','HARD_WORD','2026-09-17 19:00:37','2026-09-17 19:00:37',42.03,88.92),(2699,4,'and in fact, the formal name of Jordan is \"the Hashemite Kingdom of Jordan.\"','hashemite','00:13:14.299','00:13:19.618','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','HARD_WORD','2026-09-17 19:00:37','2026-09-17 19:00:37',52.51,89.08),(2700,4,'And you can tell from a person\'s last name - well, Jordanians can; I can\'t -','jordanian','00:13:47.836','00:13:52.221','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','HARD_WORD','2026-09-17 19:00:37','2026-09-17 19:00:37',58.89,77.70),(2701,4,'they can tell from a person\'s last name what tribe they are affiliated with.','last name','00:13:52.221','00:13:55.804','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','HARD_WORD','2026-09-17 19:00:37','2026-09-17 19:00:37',43.56,72.88),(2702,4,'It\'s part of what you grow up with.','grow up with','00:13:57.009','00:13:59.208','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','IDIOM','2026-09-17 19:00:37','2026-09-17 19:00:37',47.41,92.51),(2703,4,'And these family organizations and tribes have different realms of influence.','family','00:13:59.878','00:14:07.370','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','HARD_WORD','2026-09-17 19:00:37','2026-09-17 19:00:37',42.82,90.65),(2704,4,'But what did Peace Corps teach us?','peace corps','00:14:56.829','00:14:58.796','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','HARD_WORD','2026-09-17 19:00:37','2026-09-17 19:00:37',45.36,88.08),(2705,4,'That is the single most important thing that we Peace Corps volunteers are expected to do.','peace corps','00:15:36.465','00:15:44.086','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','HARD_WORD','2026-09-17 19:00:37','2026-09-17 19:00:37',97.40,93.89),(2706,4,'Translator: Hancheng Li Reviewer: Riaki Poništ','None','00:00:00.000','00:00:07.000','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:00:37','2026-09-17 19:00:37',35.31,100.00),(2707,4,'Cathy Owens: Good morning, everyone. My name is Cathy.','None','00:00:09.045','00:00:12.168','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:00:37','2026-09-17 19:00:37',94.74,100.00),(2708,4,'David Owens: And I\'m David, but you might\'ve guessed that.','None','00:00:12.870','00:00:15.580','FEAR','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:00:37','2026-09-17 19:00:37',60.35,100.00),(2709,4,'(Laughter) We\'re here to talk with you today about how we got','None','00:00:15.580','00:00:19.883','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:00:37','2026-09-17 19:00:37',53.44,100.00),(2710,4,'to where we never thought we\'d be.','None','00:00:19.883','00:00:22.617','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:00:37','2026-09-17 19:00:37',61.96,100.00),(2711,4,'It all started several years ago as we were preparing for retirement.','None','00:00:22.928','00:00:28.270','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:00:37','2026-09-17 19:00:37',75.54,100.00),(2712,4,'Now, that\'s a difficult concept.','None','00:00:29.056','00:00:31.966','SADNESS','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:00:37','2026-09-17 19:00:37',82.32,100.00),(2713,4,'We were kind of scared of it.','None','00:00:32.752','00:00:35.064','FEAR','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:00:37','2026-09-17 19:00:37',98.07,100.00),(2714,4,'So we were planning for something different.','None','00:00:36.095','00:00:39.230','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:00:37','2026-09-17 19:00:37',45.53,100.00),(2715,4,'We wanted to travel, discover new places, explore new places, but we didn\'t want to do it in a conventional touristy sort of way.','None','00:00:39.230','00:00:47.679','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:00:37','2026-09-17 19:00:37',68.60,100.00),(2716,4,'We wanted to get inside a place and really learn about it.','None','00:00:48.179','00:00:51.735','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:00:37','2026-09-17 19:00:37',81.38,100.00),(2717,4,'We also wanted to utilize our skills to do something useful.','None','00:00:52.688','00:00:56.306','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:00:37','2026-09-17 19:00:37',98.85,100.00),(2718,4,'And we wanted to challenge ourselves to do something difficult, something we\'d never done,','None','00:00:57.323','00:01:03.463','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:00:37','2026-09-17 19:00:37',84.23,100.00),(2719,4,'something to take us out of our comfort zone.','None','00:01:03.463','00:01:06.800','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:00:37','2026-09-17 19:00:37',43.70,100.00),(2720,4,'Cathy: I had always wanted to join the Peace Corps.','None','00:01:07.600','00:01:10.730','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:00:37','2026-09-17 19:00:37',78.37,100.00),(2721,4,'And when we thought about how we were going to be able to combine','None','00:01:11.020','00:01:14.722','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:00:37','2026-09-17 19:00:37',90.38,100.00),(2722,4,'the elements that we were looking for in retirement, as David pointed out,','None','00:01:14.722','00:01:19.392','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:00:37','2026-09-17 19:00:37',62.84,100.00),(2723,4,'Peace Corps is created in 1961 by President John F. Kennedy and has operated over the last 54 years in well over 100 countries','None','00:01:41.557','00:01:51.846','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:00:37','2026-09-17 19:00:37',82.59,100.00),(2724,4,'and with more than 220,000 American volunteers.','None','00:01:51.846','00:01:56.254','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:00:37','2026-09-17 19:00:37',61.86,100.00),(2725,4,'Right now, it\'s operating in 64 countries with around 7,000 volunteers.','None','00:01:56.394','00:02:02.590','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:00:37','2026-09-17 19:00:37',83.55,100.00),(2726,4,'Peace Corps only goes to countries where it\'s been invited to participate','None','00:02:02.903','00:02:08.679','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:00:37','2026-09-17 19:00:37',88.61,100.00),(2727,4,'and invited to help with the host nations on some issues that\'s dealing with.','None','00:02:08.679','00:02:14.495','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:00:37','2026-09-17 19:00:37',48.78,100.00),(2728,4,'We applied to Peace Corps in the summer of 2011.','None','00:02:17.357','00:02:22.107','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:00:37','2026-09-17 19:00:37',83.48,100.00),(2729,4,'we marked \"No preference.\" That was part of the adventure, part of the mystery.','None','00:02:29.690','00:02:35.260','FEAR','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:00:37','2026-09-17 19:00:37',65.76,100.00),(2730,4,'Peace Corps does different things in different countries.','None','00:02:36.301','00:02:39.752','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:00:37','2026-09-17 19:00:37',79.02,100.00),(2731,4,'Among the programs it operates are teaching English as a foreign language,','None','00:02:40.032','00:02:44.355','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:00:37','2026-09-17 19:00:37',83.24,100.00),(2732,4,'which we had both done in our earlier stint in Japan.','None','00:02:44.355','00:02:48.805','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:00:37','2026-09-17 19:00:37',42.20,100.00),(2733,4,'It also does health education and secondary health care.','None','00:02:49.965','00:02:54.227','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:00:37','2026-09-17 19:00:37',73.17,100.00),(2734,4,'It does agricultural consulting, small business development, youth development.','None','00:02:54.518','00:03:00.318','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:00:37','2026-09-17 19:00:37',81.48,100.00),(2735,4,'So it does a variety of programs, and it also operates with three principal goals.','None','00:03:01.328','00:03:08.227','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:00:37','2026-09-17 19:00:37',85.87,100.00),(2736,4,'First is to help a host country with a specific technical problem that it wants help with.','None','00:03:08.227','00:03:15.365','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:00:37','2026-09-17 19:00:37',67.10,100.00),(2737,4,'And it wants to improve understanding by Americans of those nations where it operates.','None','00:03:21.974','00:03:29.753','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:00:37','2026-09-17 19:00:37',95.98,100.00),(2738,4,'So, with all this in mind, we applied to Peace Corps in the summer of 2011,','None','00:03:29.753','00:03:34.075','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:00:37','2026-09-17 19:00:37',93.53,100.00),(2739,4,'and a year later, we were invited to serve in Jordan.','None','00:03:34.925','00:03:39.896','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:00:37','2026-09-17 19:00:37',73.10,100.00),(2740,4,'Now, neither of us knew very much about Jordan.','None','00:03:40.467','00:03:43.723','FEAR','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:00:37','2026-09-17 19:00:37',71.87,100.00),(2741,4,'Certainly we didn\'t know anything of the Arabic language or Arab culture in general.','None','00:03:43.723','00:03:50.236','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:00:37','2026-09-17 19:00:37',52.13,100.00),(2742,4,'So, this was a challenge.','None','00:03:51.422','00:03:54.054','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:00:37','2026-09-17 19:00:37',58.22,100.00),(2743,4,'My background, as Sam has told you, was in American history and Asian studies.','None','00:03:54.054','00:03:59.617','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:00:37','2026-09-17 19:00:37',47.01,100.00),(2744,4,'We\'d lived in Japan and taught there for several years before going on to our careers.','None','00:03:59.836','00:04:05.539','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:00:37','2026-09-17 19:00:37',57.91,100.00),(2745,4,'But this was new; this was a challenge.','None','00:04:06.001','00:04:09.952','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:00:37','2026-09-17 19:00:37',69.48,100.00),(2746,4,'Cathy: My background is in microbiology.','None','00:04:12.975','00:04:15.885','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:00:37','2026-09-17 19:00:37',80.27,100.00),(2747,4,'Plus, we had taught in Japan.','None','00:04:26.825','00:04:30.130','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:00:37','2026-09-17 19:00:37',71.99,100.00),(2748,4,'my teaching experience, and also my business connections, that it would be a good fit for Peace Corps,','None','00:04:37.996','00:04:45.257','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:00:37','2026-09-17 19:00:37',98.55,100.00),(2749,4,'David: So off we went to Jordan in the fall of 2012.','None','00:04:49.904','00:04:54.304','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:00:37','2026-09-17 19:00:37',35.89,100.00),(2750,4,'We went with a group of 23 other volunteer trainees.','None','00:04:54.984','00:05:00.153','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:00:37','2026-09-17 19:00:37',71.64,100.00),(2751,4,'Upon arrival in the capital, we were divided into several smaller groups','None','00:05:00.213','00:05:04.342','FEAR','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:00:37','2026-09-17 19:00:37',56.49,100.00),(2752,4,'and sent out to training villages around a central training hub outside the capital.','None','00:05:04.342','00:05:09.714','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:00:37','2026-09-17 19:00:37',37.96,100.00),(2753,4,'for four to six hours a day along with lessons in various aspects of Arab culture.','None','00:05:18.180','00:05:23.673','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:00:37','2026-09-17 19:00:37',75.64,100.00),(2754,4,'We also had homestays.','None','00:05:23.953','00:05:25.666','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:00:37','2026-09-17 19:00:37',45.31,100.00),(2755,4,'Cathy: Now, Peace Corps puts all of its volunteer trainees in homes of people who live in the area where we\'re training.','None','00:05:26.478','00:05:35.411','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:00:37','2026-09-17 19:00:37',92.58,100.00),(2756,4,'And they serve to help teach us the things with real life lessons that we\'re learning in the classroom.','None','00:05:35.421','00:05:43.475','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:00:37','2026-09-17 19:00:37',91.93,100.00),(2757,4,'They reinforce what we are learning.','None','00:05:43.475','00:05:46.558','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:00:37','2026-09-17 19:00:37',96.36,100.00),(2758,4,'So, they teach us a lot about, of course, food, culture, holiday, celebrations.','None','00:05:46.558','00:05:53.325','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:00:37','2026-09-17 19:00:37',91.84,100.00),(2759,4,'They also teach us a lot about how interactions happen between family members, their neighbours, and the community at large.','None','00:05:53.325','00:06:01.652','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:00:37','2026-09-17 19:00:37',74.60,100.00),(2760,4,'They give us lessons to make sure that we are culturally adapted for our new work environment','None','00:06:02.012','00:06:10.822','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:00:37','2026-09-17 19:00:37',98.36,100.00),(2761,4,'David: And over the course of our 12-week training, we are evaluated from time to time for that cultural adaptation','None','00:06:14.254','00:06:20.968','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:00:37','2026-09-17 19:00:37',89.92,100.00),(2762,4,'and for our progress in language learning.','None','00:06:21.023','00:06:23.285','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:00:37','2026-09-17 19:00:37',75.61,100.00),(2763,4,'At the end of the 12 weeks, we were sworn in as official Peace Corps volunteers','None','00:06:23.383','00:06:27.581','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:00:37','2026-09-17 19:00:37',95.05,100.00),(2764,4,'by the U.S. Ambassador to Jordan, and then the next day sent off to our assignments all over the country.','None','00:06:27.581','00:06:34.274','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:00:37','2026-09-17 19:00:37',53.34,100.00),(2765,4,'Cathy and I were assigned to work in the city of Salt,','None','00:06:34.336','00:06:38.021','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:00:37','2026-09-17 19:00:37',61.42,100.00),(2766,4,'about 20 miles outside of the capital, Amman.','None','00:06:38.030','00:06:41.714','FEAR','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:00:37','2026-09-17 19:00:37',61.16,100.00),(2767,4,'There, I was assigned to teach English at a boy\'s middle school.','None','00:06:42.084','00:06:46.558','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:00:37','2026-09-17 19:00:37',57.37,100.00),(2768,4,'Children in Jordan are separated by gender after fourth grade','None','00:06:47.039','00:06:52.449','SADNESS','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:00:37','2026-09-17 19:00:37',53.36,100.00),(2769,4,'and I taught at a school for boys that ran from fifth grade through tenth grade.','None','00:06:52.449','00:06:57.154','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:00:37','2026-09-17 19:00:37',57.85,100.00),(2770,4,'I focused on sixth grade.','None','00:06:57.154','00:06:59.609','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:00:37','2026-09-17 19:00:37',47.20,100.00),(2771,4,'The school\'s only about a mile from where we lived.','None','00:07:01.039','00:07:03.806','FEAR','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:00:37','2026-09-17 19:00:37',35.38,100.00),(2772,4,'It was a very poor, under-resourced school with lots of behavioral problems among the boys.','None','00:07:04.406','00:07:11.559','SADNESS','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:00:37','2026-09-17 19:00:37',88.73,100.00),(2773,4,'The expectation from Peace Corps is that after we are in our communities','None','00:07:18.655','00:07:23.281','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:00:37','2026-09-17 19:00:37',95.95,100.00),(2774,4,'for a few months, we will become more fully integrated and understand how the community works.','None','00:07:23.281','00:07:29.030','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:00:37','2026-09-17 19:00:37',98.07,100.00),(2775,4,'With more contacts that we\'re able to make, we can find out what other programs','None','00:07:29.600','00:07:35.623','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:00:37','2026-09-17 19:00:37',87.86,100.00),(2776,4,'we might be able to develop and contribute to.','None','00:07:35.623','00:07:38.672','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:00:37','2026-09-17 19:00:37',98.26,100.00),(2777,4,'For example, at my school, the professors and the staff approached me','None','00:07:38.872','00:07:44.426','FEAR','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:00:37','2026-09-17 19:00:37',90.16,100.00),(2778,4,'I also had a student group who had a conservation club come and asked if I would also participate in their events.','None','00:07:49.070','00:07:57.914','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:00:37','2026-09-17 19:00:37',56.87,100.00),(2779,4,'Now, the conservation club was very interesting because we went on monthly trips through Jordan.','None','00:07:58.134','00:08:04.608','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:00:37','2026-09-17 19:00:37',86.77,100.00),(2780,4,'so we were able to explore and discover many more things about Jordan','None','00:08:08.035','00:08:12.816','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:00:37','2026-09-17 19:00:37',93.94,100.00),(2781,4,'that we never would be able to see on our own.','None','00:08:13.003','00:08:15.429','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:00:37','2026-09-17 19:00:37',41.89,100.00),(2782,4,'We went to places that are not very well known even by Jordanians themselves.','None','00:08:15.864','00:08:20.490','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:00:37','2026-09-17 19:00:37',88.72,100.00),(2783,4,'So we went to places that were historically important, culturally important, or environmentally important.','None','00:08:21.087','00:08:27.286','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:00:37','2026-09-17 19:00:37',93.95,100.00),(2784,4,'We were also able to meet more people because the women who come from the university','None','00:08:27.721','00:08:33.531','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:00:37','2026-09-17 19:00:37',91.09,100.00),(2785,4,'are frequently accompanied by their family members.','None','00:08:33.531','00:08:36.805','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:00:37','2026-09-17 19:00:37',50.01,100.00),(2786,4,'So, it gives us a chance to practice our Arabic, of course,','None','00:08:37.235','00:08:41.036','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:00:37','2026-09-17 19:00:37',91.55,100.00),(2787,4,'and to meet many more people in the community and to get a better feel for what the community needs are.','None','00:08:41.036','00:08:47.533','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:00:37','2026-09-17 19:00:37',95.92,100.00),(2788,4,'David: Among my secondary projects was the organization and execution of a special summer boy\'s camp','None','00:08:48.805','00:08:55.558','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:00:37','2026-09-17 19:00:37',90.25,100.00),(2789,4,'And it was a place where we worked on some of those behavioral issues that I mentioned before','None','00:09:02.943','00:09:07.814','FEAR','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:00:37','2026-09-17 19:00:37',41.94,100.00),(2790,4,'that are very common at public schools in most parts of Jordan.','None','00:09:07.814','00:09:12.614','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:00:37','2026-09-17 19:00:37',40.49,100.00),(2791,4,'Well, we\'ve given you a rundown of how we spent our two years in Jordan,','None','00:09:13.464','00:09:18.598','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:00:37','2026-09-17 19:00:37',42.39,100.00),(2792,4,'but the important part is: \"What did that all mean?\" \"What did we discover from this and how did it change us?\"','None','00:09:18.812','00:09:26.303','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:00:37','2026-09-17 19:00:37',40.37,100.00),(2793,4,'First of all, and the most important thing that we took away from our two years','None','00:09:26.932','00:09:33.541','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:00:37','2026-09-17 19:00:37',44.22,100.00),(2794,4,'was a new sense of hospitality, generosity, and affection.','None','00:09:33.541','00:09:39.659','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:00:37','2026-09-17 19:00:37',66.13,100.00),(2795,4,'They all see Americans as very warm, friendly, generous, hospitable,','None','00:09:45.620','00:09:50.778','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:00:37','2026-09-17 19:00:37',74.35,100.00),(2796,4,'in a very planned sort of way: at a specific time, on a specific date that\'s well known in advance.','None','00:09:57.351','00:10:03.801','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:00:37','2026-09-17 19:00:37',85.19,100.00),(2797,4,'We stick to those guidelines.','None','00:10:06.364','00:10:08.539','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:00:37','2026-09-17 19:00:37',80.92,100.00),(2798,4,'Hospitality in Jordan is spontaneous.','None','00:10:08.999','00:10:12.286','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:00:37','2026-09-17 19:00:37',98.46,100.00),(2799,4,'You can just be out doing your errands, walking down the street on the way back from, let\'s say, the grocery store,','None','00:10:12.726','00:10:18.433','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:00:37','2026-09-17 19:00:37',49.20,100.00),(2800,4,'\"Come in! Have a cup of coffee with me!\" I would frequently be beckoned,','None','00:10:23.468','00:10:27.861','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:00:37','2026-09-17 19:00:37',94.24,100.00),(2801,4,'\"Mr. David! Come in, let\'s have coffee!\" Or, you can walk down the street to visit a neighbour','None','00:10:27.861','00:10:36.027','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:00:37','2026-09-17 19:00:37',65.58,100.00),(2802,4,'and in fact, you\'re expected to.','None','00:10:36.027','00:10:38.606','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:00:37','2026-09-17 19:00:37',67.24,100.00),(2803,4,'\"Come visit!\"','None','00:10:38.956','00:10:40.187','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:00:37','2026-09-17 19:00:37',56.66,100.00),(2804,4,'There is never anything that is so pressing, so urgent that you can\'t take time from your day','None','00:10:46.843','00:10:54.038','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:00:37','2026-09-17 19:00:37',83.55,100.00),(2805,4,'and appreciate that friendship.','None','00:11:02.538','00:11:04.367','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:00:37','2026-09-17 19:00:37',55.78,100.00),(2806,4,'And that was quite revealing for us.','None','00:11:11.034','00:11:17.065','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:00:37','2026-09-17 19:00:37',51.32,100.00),(2807,4,'Also, especially,','None','00:11:17.705','00:11:19.447','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:00:37','2026-09-17 19:00:37',41.27,100.00),(2808,4,'the Jordanians are very warm and affectionate,','None','00:11:21.587','00:11:26.917','LOVE','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:00:37','2026-09-17 19:00:37',96.26,100.00),(2809,4,'and express affection much more than we do as Americans, especially men.','None','00:11:27.052','00:11:32.906','LOVE','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:00:37','2026-09-17 19:00:37',95.08,100.00),(2810,4,'We\'re used to men being a little bit withholding over here and not really being very emotive, and not being demonstrative.','None','00:11:32.936','00:11:40.791','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:00:37','2026-09-17 19:00:37',67.68,100.00),(2811,4,'they are just adored.','None','00:11:55.439','00:11:57.419','LOVE','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:00:37','2026-09-17 19:00:37',90.63,100.00),(2812,4,'It\'s not just the kids in your family.','None','00:11:57.629','00:12:00.111','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:00:37','2026-09-17 19:00:37',47.87,100.00),(2813,4,'but they will fuss over the kids.','None','00:12:04.851','00:12:07.460','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:00:37','2026-09-17 19:00:37',91.85,100.00),(2814,4,'And kids being fussed over is a central part of Jordanian family life.','None','00:12:08.790','00:12:14.748','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:00:37','2026-09-17 19:00:37',80.81,100.00),(2815,4,'Jordanians have larger families than we tend to have in this country,','None','00:12:14.898','00:12:19.463','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:00:37','2026-09-17 19:00:37',56.75,100.00),(2816,4,'very common to have 12, 13, 14 children in a family.','None','00:12:19.493','00:12:24.098','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:00:37','2026-09-17 19:00:37',63.02,100.00),(2817,4,'And families all tend to live very close to each other; their family members live close to each other.','None','00:12:24.578','00:12:30.732','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:00:37','2026-09-17 19:00:37',40.07,100.00),(2818,4,'and in our neighborhood, cousins, family stay close together,','None','00:12:37.189','00:12:42.496','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:00:37','2026-09-17 19:00:37',72.15,100.00),(2819,4,'both emotionally and physically.','None','00:12:43.465','00:12:46.058','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:00:37','2026-09-17 19:00:37',35.83,100.00),(2820,4,'Every family is part of a larger social organization, a tribe.','None','00:12:54.620','00:12:59.947','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:00:37','2026-09-17 19:00:37',62.65,100.00),(2821,4,'The royal family in Jordan comes from the Hashemite Tribe,','None','00:13:08.692','00:13:14.290','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:00:37','2026-09-17 19:00:37',62.56,100.00),(2822,4,'And the Hashemites have a special place in the social organization because traditionally, historically,','None','00:13:19.687','00:13:26.479','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:00:37','2026-09-17 19:00:37',91.20,100.00),(2823,4,'they were very closely associated with the family of the Prophet Mohammed.','None','00:13:26.479','00:13:31.652','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:00:37','2026-09-17 19:00:37',37.61,100.00),(2824,4,'This has been an influential factor in why Jordan has remained an island of stability','None','00:13:31.966','00:13:37.833','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:00:37','2026-09-17 19:00:37',96.54,100.00),(2825,4,'in a sea of chaos in the Middle East.','None','00:13:38.283','00:13:40.939','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:00:37','2026-09-17 19:00:37',68.36,100.00),(2826,4,'But every tribe has its own sphere of influence, and there are tribes scattered throughout Jordan.','None','00:13:41.439','00:13:47.826','FEAR','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:00:37','2026-09-17 19:00:37',43.33,100.00),(2827,4,'They know that.','None','00:13:55.814','00:13:56.980','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:00:37','2026-09-17 19:00:37',49.49,100.00),(2828,4,'Some are very active in politics, some are maybe much more into the economic life of the country,','None','00:14:07.370','00:14:17.263','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:00:37','2026-09-17 19:00:37',93.97,100.00),(2829,4,'others with different social aspects of the life of the nation.','None','00:14:17.293','00:14:22.039','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:00:37','2026-09-17 19:00:37',47.30,100.00),(2830,4,'Every tribe has its own sphere of influence, and every family utilizes its family connections','None','00:14:23.899','00:14:32.574','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:00:37','2026-09-17 19:00:37',81.43,100.00),(2831,4,'to gain influence or to utilize that influence.','None','00:14:32.724','00:14:36.130','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:00:37','2026-09-17 19:00:37',51.89,100.00),(2832,4,'In Chicago, they call it \"clout.\" In Jordan, they call it \"Wasta.\"','None','00:14:36.300','00:14:41.569','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:00:37','2026-09-17 19:00:37',67.02,100.00),(2833,4,'Wasta is something that you really can\'t get through life without.','None','00:14:41.759','00:14:45.457','SADNESS','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:00:37','2026-09-17 19:00:37',59.80,100.00),(2834,4,'It helps you measure your progress through life.','None','00:14:45.508','00:14:48.898','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:00:37','2026-09-17 19:00:37',96.00,100.00),(2835,4,'So these were very important lessons that we learned from Jordan.','None','00:14:49.628','00:14:55.434','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:00:37','2026-09-17 19:00:37',97.68,100.00),(2836,4,'Well, Peace Corps teach us flexibility, adaptibility, be ready for anything at any time.','None','00:14:59.016','00:15:06.333','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:00:37','2026-09-17 19:00:37',98.64,100.00),(2837,4,'Things can change.','None','00:15:06.343','00:15:07.804','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:00:37','2026-09-17 19:00:37',40.78,100.00),(2838,4,'Even your assignment, where you go, what you do, and it can change on a moment\'s notice.','None','00:15:08.464','00:15:15.759','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:00:37','2026-09-17 19:00:37',40.35,100.00),(2839,4,'So you need to be ready.','None','00:15:15.759','00:15:17.670','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:00:37','2026-09-17 19:00:37',96.62,100.00),(2840,4,'Second, Peace Corps teaches you','None','00:15:19.797','00:15:25.293','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:00:37','2026-09-17 19:00:37',91.37,100.00),(2841,4,'to be a part of your community.','None','00:15:25.323','00:15:29.950','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:00:37','2026-09-17 19:00:37',88.85,100.00),(2842,4,'You want to be integrated into your community, be a citizen, be a participant.','None','