 translate during reel generation...','HARD_WORD','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',87.48,90.36),(4658,7,'So we keep just a little bit of that faction identity, where Horde will get Seal of Blood at Level 64, on schedule,','seal of blood','00:18:32.462','00:18:37.935','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','HARD_WORD','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',58.04,99.55),(4659,7,'and then their equivalent, Seal of the Martyr, at Level 70.','seal of the martyr','00:18:43.257','00:18:45.959','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','HARD_WORD','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',55.05,95.97),(4660,7,'so if someone was sick, or unavailable one night, you couldn\'t play.','unavailable','00:19:01.608','00:19:05.128','SADNESS','Will translate during reel generation...','HARD_WORD','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',47.71,98.21),(4661,7,'Is that why we did personal ratings versus team ratings?','personal','00:19:22.196','00:19:24.498','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','HARD_WORD','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',85.48,79.99),(4662,7,'We\'re going to give players access to blood elf and draenei early,','blood elf','00:19:48.505','00:19:54.678','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','HARD_WORD','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',52.02,98.60),(4663,7,'That\'s definitely not something we did originally.','originally','00:19:59.199','00:20:01.401','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','HARD_WORD','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',65.21,81.96),(4664,7,'I remember, I had a friend who was really frustrated that the rest of us were running around in Outland,','outland','00:20:02.469','00:20:06.823','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','HARD_WORD','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',98.50,73.30),(4665,7,'-HOLLY: Yeah. -Is that pre-patch?','pre - patch','00:20:14.848','00:20:16.266','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','HARD_WORD','2026