ill translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',36.39,100.00),(4771,7,'-BRIAN: Oh, yeah. -I was an engineer, right?','None','00:03:40.103','00:03:41.905','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',76.19,100.00),(4772,7,'I wasn\'t a designer, I was working on the live ops team at the time,','None','00:03:41.939','00:03:46.043','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',58.02,100.00),(4773,7,'and, you know, I was playing my class, avid player of mage,','None','00:03:46.443','00:03:50.113','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',98.30,100.00),(4774,7,'and I kept, I sent this long email to Tom Chilton, saying, like, \"Hey. Here\'s what mage needs.\"','None','00:03:50.147','00:03:55.869','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',78.54,100.00),(4775,7,'-LAUGHTER -Dawson Manifesto.','None','00:03:55.903','00:03:57.638','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',46.45,100.00),(4776,7,'let\'s get a threat to offer the class.\" PATRICK: And I didn\'t tie those two together.','None','00:04:06.463','00:04:09.800','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',73.78,100.00),(4777,7,'along with some other new stuff for mages, like the Molten Armor and the Ice Lances,','None','00:04:14.488','00:04:17.741','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',52.46,100.00),(4778,7,'because I was frustrated getting polymorphed, and being able to reflect that back on the mage...','None','00:04:24.214','00:04:28.151','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',97.21,100.00),(4779,7,