uring reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',47.98,100.00),(4789,7,'PATRICK: That was a whole new world for us.','None','00:04:57.297','00:04:59.216','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',75.76,100.00),(4790,7,'With battlegrounds and the way they worked before, the way the matchmaking happened,','None','00:04:59.249','00:05:03.187','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',58.11,100.00),(4791,7,'usually I was pretty competitive in PvP, so I would either get in there and','None','00:05:03.220','00:05:06.540','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',97.56,100.00),(4792,7,'-stomp the enemy team... -(HOLLY LAUGHS) ...who was there to be casual,','None','00:05:06.573','00:05:09.409','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',95.70,100.00),(4793,7,'or, even though we were a good team, we weren\'t the best of the best,','None','00:05:09.443','00:05:12.863','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',96.90,100.00),(4794,7,'so when we ended up going against one of those teams, it was just, like,','None','00:05:12.896','00:05:16.300','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',87.57,100.00),(4795,7,'\"Well, jeez, we\'re just getting stomped now. This is tough.\" Arenas gave everyone an opportunity','None','00:05:16.333','00:05:21.822','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',55.27,100.00),(4796,7,'PATRICK: So if you were a little bit more casual, you get the opportunity to play against people','None','00:05:24.491','00:05:28.095','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',98.11,100.00),(4797,7,'who weren\'t maybe so competitive.','None','00:05:28.128','00:05:29.646','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',97.22,100.00),(4798,7,'Try to be the best of the best.','None','00:05:32.149','00:05:33.884','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',92.00,100.00),(4799,7,'And what was great about that, is that it really, it spawned an esport.','None','00:05:33.917','00:05:37.137','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',96.72,100.00),(4800,7,'-Yeah. -That wasn\'t...','None','00:05:37.171','00:05:38.172','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',40.09,100.00),(4801,7,'We didn\'t design it for that, we just wanted people to have fun,','None','00:05:38.205','00:05:40.541','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',43.70,100.00),(4802,7,'but when we noticed, like, \"Hey, everybody\'s playing this, everybody\'s competing in this, people are watching it,\"','None','00:05:40.574','00:05:45.729','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',47.20,100.00),(4803,7,'we had to embrace that.','None','00:05:45.762','00:05:46.763','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',35.58,100.00),(4804,7,'PATRICK: We started featuring it in BlizzCons, and we have been ever since.','None','00:05:46.797','00:05:49.850','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',72.38,100.00),(4805,7,'BRIAN: Yeah, it\'s awesome.','None','00:05:49.883','00:05:51.001','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',97.29,100.00),(4806,7,'One of my favorite memories was actually in the first zone, Hellfire Peninsula.','None','00:05:55.939','00:05:59.610','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',59.81,100.00),(4807,7,'and always living in fear of the fel reaver.','None','00:06:05.566','00:06:07.551','FEAR','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',82.78,100.00),(4808,7,'Because you\'d be out there collecting parts from a broken zeppelin, and you\'d be fighting off your helboars,','None','00:06:07.885','00:06:13.757','SADNESS','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',46.86,100.00),(4809,7,'and this thomp, thomp, thomp, and then...','None','00:06:15.893','00:06:17.761','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',46.03,100.00),(4810,7,'You\'re like, \"Oh my God, I gotta run, he\'s right on top of me.\"','None','00:06:21.248','00:06:23.634','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',66.79,100.00),(4811,7,'That sound haunts my dreams.','None','00:06:23.667','00:06:24.852','SADNESS','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',90.65,100.00),(4812,7,'Oh I know, yeah, it\'s terrifying.','None','00:06:24.885','00:06:26.820','FEAR','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',83.87,100.00),(4813,7,'Even alive, it\'s just, Feign Death.','None','00:06:26.854','00:06:28.655','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',79.09,100.00),(4814,7,'-Yeah, just like that. -LAUGHTER And then the payoff when you later go to Netherstorm,','None','00:06:29.890','00:06:35.045','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',70.45,100.00),(4815,7,'and they give you the quest, like, \"Could you get me a part from inside the fel reaver?','None','00:06:35.329','00:06:38.732','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',31.12,100.00),(4816,7,'You\'re gonna have to kill him.\" And you\'re like, \"That guy that used to terrorize me?\"','None','00:06:38.765','00:06:42.236','FEAR','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',60.77,100.00),(4817,7,'BRIAN: They\'re like, \"You could take him.\" And that was such an exciting payoff,','None','00:06:42.269','00:06:45.906','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',98.27,100.00),(4818,7,'to be able to bring that full circle and go back and see him again.','None','00:06:45.939','00:06:49.560','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',90.15,100.00),(4819,7,'For me, I snuck into beta.','None','00:06:49.593','00:06:51.929','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',38.41,100.00),(4820,7,'and of course I ignored it, -and went and explored. -(BRIAN LAUGHS)','None','00:06:56.717','00:07:00.571','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',63.48,100.00),(4821,7,'So, I remember running through Blade\'s Edge, and just seeing dragon carcasses and skeletons','None','00:07:00.938','00:07:06.743','FEAR','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',32.57,100.00),(4822,7,'impaled in the environment, and then moving on to Netherstorm, I just was blown away,','None','00:07:06.777','00:07:12.983','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',47.75,100.00),(4823,7,'HOLLY: Everything felt like its own world.','None','00:07:15.986','00:07:18.005','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',86.03,100.00),(4824,7,'and then you come up to Area 52.','None','00:07:22.342','00:07:25.612','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',37.54,100.00),(4825,7,'That\'s what I love about Wow, is you can have epic, epic storylines,','None','00:07:25.646','00:07:29.183','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',94.19,100.00),(4826,7,'and still find lightness in it, so I just loved it.','None','00:07:29.216','00:07:31.885','LOVE','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',94.03,100.00),(4827,7,'I love... I\'m an explorer, so...','None','00:07:31.919','00:07:34.037','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',90.53,100.00),(4828,7,'And that started with the Aldor and Scryer route.','None','00:07:42.329','00:07:44.982','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',39.90,100.00),(4829,7,'\'Cause I got my Aldor rep all the way up, and then I was thinking about switching to Scryer,','None','00:07:45.432','00:07:49.736','FEAR','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',51.27,100.00),(4830,7,'You know, just a few people thought...','None','00:07:54.992','00:07:57.160','FEAR','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',51.98,100.00),(4831,7,'And I did.','None','00:07:57.194','00:07:58.195','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',41.39,100.00),(4832,7,'And it was cool, it was really fun, but then I started doing other things.','None','00:07:58.228','00:08:01.665','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',98.14,100.00),(4833,7,'PATRICK: There are these new mounts, and pets, and I went back and even got some of the older raps,','None','00:08:01.698','00:08:05.769','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',54.00,100.00),(4834,7,'like Thorium Brotherhood and Winterspring.','None','00:08:05.802','00:08:07.538','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',46.84,100.00),(4835,7,'Of course, we also had flying mounts, which I loved, and then decided to play with some friends on our PvP server,','None','00:08:13.677','00:08:20.100','LOVE','অবশ্য, আমাদের ফ্লাইং মাউন্টও ছিল, যা আমার খুব পছন্দ ছিল, আর তারপর আমরা আমাদের পিভিপি সার্ভারে কিছু বন্ধুর সাথে খেলার সিদ্ধান্ত নিলাম,','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-18 20:09:40',81.01,100.00),(4836,7,'Death from above, which was likely just Pat.','None','00:08:24.838','00:08:27.925','FEAR','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',43.10,100.00),(4837,7,'-Probably. -HOLLY: Yeah.','None','00:08:27.958','00:08:29.009','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',80.95,100.00),(4838,7,'-LAUGHTER -Back in the day.','None','00:08:33.597','00:08:35.465','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',45.98,100.00),(4839,7,'-And that was 13 years ago. -Mm-hm.','None','00:08:40.170','00:08:42.139','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',29.63,100.00),(4840,7,'So that code has been hanging around for 13 years.','None','00:08:42.172','00:08:46.210','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',40.06,100.00),(4841,7,'And we\'re not just doing a \"save-as\" Burning Crusade Classic.','None','00:08:46.243','00:08:50.347','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',82.73,100.00),(4842,7,'-No, it\'s harder than that. -(HOLLY LAUGHS) Yeah.','None','00:08:50.380','00:08:52.749','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',73.40,100.00),(4843,7,'So let\'s get into some of those details.','None','00:08:52.783','00:08:54.635','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',78.33,100.00),(4844,7,'So, one of the challenges has been that we don’t actually want to ship on the old code.','None','00:08:54.668','00:08:59.039','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',35.81,100.00),(4845,7,'And the reason for that is because it\'s got a lot of bugs,','None','00:08:59.072','00:09:02.276','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',75.25,100.00),(4846,7,'and difficulties with the architecture that we don\'t wanna have to deal with.','None','00:09:02.309','00:09:06.513','SADNESS','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',30.90,100.00),(4847,7,'But we do want that old data.','None','00:09:06.547','00:09:07.748','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',41.64,100.00),(4848,7,'And we talked about this when we did the original launch of Classic,','None','00:09:07.781','00:09:10.400','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',88.73,100.00),(4849,7,'was how the data is really the thing that describes how the game is supposed to be played','None','00:09:10.434','00:09:14.505','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',45.10,100.00),(4850,7,'and what\'s supposed to happen in it.','None','00:09:14.538','00:09:15.906','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',47.11,100.00),(4851,7,'And so, we want to bring that old data and we want to run it on the modern code.','None','00:09:16.306','00:09:19.610','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',51.76,100.00),(4852,7,'The same as we did for Classic.','None','00:09:19.643','00:09:21.161','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',95.09,100.00),(4853,7,'and convert from their old formats to their new formats, and fortunately we have really talented engineers,','None','00:09:25.899','00:09:31.371','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',98.82,100.00),(4854,7,'we have to compare them with how it used to behave, and make sure that we\'ve converted correctly.','None','00:09:35.475','00:09:40.447','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',98.13,100.00),(4855,7,'And then there\'s even some things that are making it more difficult this time,','None','00:09:40.480','00:09:43.700','SADNESS','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',54.15,100.00),(4856,7,'like the fact that we\'ve made a couple of minor changes or bug fixes','None','00:09:43.734','00:09:46.570','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',48.23,100.00),(4857,7,'in the Classic data, and we want to make sure that we keep those','None','00:09:46.603','00:09:50.174','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',98.47,100.00),(4858,7,'There\'s an enormous amount of time spent looking at \"Okay, this is how it came out now.\"','None','00:10:01.752','00:10:06.490','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',97.56,100.00),(4859,7,'the original.','None','00:10:10.194','00:10:11.278','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',44.08,100.00),(4860,7,'That\'s right, we do use the old code for that.','None','00:10:11.311','00:10:13.514','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',62.07,100.00),(4861,7,'So we still have it, we just don\'t want to ship on that anymore.','None','00:10:13.547','00:10:15.883','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',55.47,100.00),(4862,7,'We have the old code, with the old data, knows exactly how it\'s supposed to behave,','None','00:10:15.916','00:10:19.386','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',75.08,100.00),(4863,7,'so those things work together, and we can bring that up internally,','None','00:10:19.419','00:10:21.972','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',66.89,100.00),(4864,7,'and take a look at it, and say, \"Okay, this is how it was back then,','None','00:10:22.005','00:10:24.875','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',95.42,100.00),(4865,7,'this is exactly what it used to look like.\" And we do sometimes find things','None','00:10:24.908','00:10:27.945','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',78.11,100.00),(4866,7,'that are bugs we still want to fix, but a lot of times it will tell us, like,','None','00:10:27.978','00:10:31.732','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',76.29,100.00),(4867,7,'\"Oh, this thing is not a bug, this is actually the intended behavior.\"','None','00:10:31.765','00:10:34.718','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',57.73,100.00),(4868,7,'Or this is something we don\'t really remember right.','None','00:10:34.751','00:10:36.820','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',71.16,100.00),(4869,7,'There\'s a tendency to want to chase your own memory, like, \"I remember it being like this!\", and it\'s like, \"No.\"','None','00:10:36.854','00:10:42.025','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',89.97,100.00),(4870,7,'It\'s not always exactly the way you remember it.','None','00:10:42.426','00:10:44.528','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',80.50,100.00),(4871,7,'Everybody has that human failing, even us, and so a lot of times we\'ll have an argument.','None','00:10:44.561','00:10:49.099','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',95.89,100.00),(4872,7,'\"I remember it this way.\" \"Well, I remember it this way.\" \"Let\'s go and check. We can look.\"','None','00:10:49.132','00:10:52.753','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',85.65,100.00),(4873,7,'and the fact that the world didn\'t look the same back in 2007 as it does today.','None','00:10:59.009','00:11:02.930','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',86.68,100.00),(4874,7,'BRIAN: That\'s true.','None','00:11:02.963','00:11:03.964','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',93.59,100.00),(4875,7,'is everything was its own server, right, they didn\'t really talk to each other very well,','None','00:11:15.976','00:11:21.031','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',94.33,100.00),(4876,7,'so each realm had 11 blades on it, and these blades were just bare metal blades,','None','00:11:21.064','00:11:26.620','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',44.44,100.00),(4877,7,'and one blade was for Azeroth, one blade was for Kalimdor, one was for Outland...','None','00:11:26.653','00:11:30.707','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',62.53,100.00),(4878,7,'and maybe a lot of people were running dungeons, and so it would give you back things like','None','00:11:37.331','00:11:41.485','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',54.37,100.00),(4879,7,'So now, we can take advantage of things like the cloud, and not have those resource issues,','None','00:11:45.556','00:11:50.110','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',61.10,100.00),(4880,7,'so shipping on this new code is a big improvement in stability.','None','00:11:50.143','00:11:53.213','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',96.35,100.00),(4881,7,'Yeah, and so we\'re basically weaving all these threads together.','None','00:11:53.247','00:11:57.451','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',81.88,100.00),(4882,7,'Super excited.','None','00:12:01.054','00:12:02.306','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',95.50,100.00),(4883,7,'The team gets together, we\'re preparing for a play test, and we go to create our characters,','None','00:12:03.407','00:12:08.028','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',89.48,100.00),(4884,7,'and we see...','None','00:12:08.529','00:12:09.963','JOY','Wil