 we call textures,','None','00:12:47.301','00:12:51.805','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',57.25,100.00),(4894,7,'and we\'d use those to build up a single composite texture that\'s then wrapped around the geometry,','None','00:12:51.839','00:12:56.159','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',69.67,100.00),(4895,7,'but of course, in this case, when we were layering them on,','None','00:12:56.193','00:12:58.395','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',39.30,100.00),(4896,7,'none of the textures were assigned, so we just started with his naked body,','None','00:12:58.428','00:13:03.483','FEAR','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',37.46,100.00),(4897,7,'but there\'s nothing there, they\'re all completely transparent.','None','00:13:10.140','00:13:12.726','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',94.25,100.00),(4898,7,'It\'s like The Emperor\'s New Clothes.','None','00:13:12.759','00:13:14.394','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',84.18,100.00),(4899,7,'-(LAUGHS) -HOLLY: That\'s crazy.','None','00:13:17.381','00:13:18.849','FEAR','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',56.49,100.00),(4900,7,'-PATRICK: That\'s not the Exodar. -BRIAN: Yeah.','None','00:13:29.026','00:13:30.894','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',56.45,100.00),(4901,7,'HOLLY: No, it... Definitely not.','None','00:13:30.928','00:13:32.446','FEAR','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',29.84,100.00),(4902,7,'It is, and that\'s exactly the problem.','None','00:13:33.664','00:13:35.232','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',42.62,100.00),(4903,7,'And so, yeah.','None','00:13:38.852','00:13:39.853','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',66.85,100.00),(4904,7,'for much shorter races, like gnomes and dwarves.','None','00:13:44.174','00:13:47.227','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',59.24,100.00),(4905,7,'BRIAN: So it\'s knee-high on a draenei.','None','00:13:47.261','00:13:50.797','FEAR','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',49.86,100.00),(4906,7,'And then, water.','None','00:13:50.831','00:13:51.999','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',31.07,100.00),(4907,7,'Really, Brian, we have water in Hellfire?','None','00:13:52.482','00:13:54.017','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',73.60,100.00),(4908,7,'-BRIAN: Yeah, so... -HOLLY: Go for a swim?','None','00:13:54.051','00:13:55.802','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',65.79,100.00),(4909,7,'BRIAN: It turns out that Outland has a funny, unique feature that it doesn\'t have any oceans,','None','00:13:55.836','00:14:00.607','SURPRISE','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',89.25,100.00),(4910,7,'because the water just all falls off the edges and goes out into space, or something.','None','00:14:00.641','00:14:04.228','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',48.26,100.00),(4911,7,'I\'m not sure how that works in the game universe.','None','00:14:04.261','00:14:06.813','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',62.22,100.00),(4912,7,'so we ended up flooding the entire world with an ocean until we found that and turned it back off (LAUGHS).','None','00:14:11.385','00:14:15.906','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',75.76,100.00),(4913,7,'So through all of these processes, yes, we\'re obviously fixing what is broken,','None','00:14:16.440','00:14:22.095','SADNESS','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',98.45,100.00),(4914,7,'but also, we thought it was a good time to start enacting what we call #somechanges...','None','00:14:22.746','00:14:29.586','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',97.34,100.00),(4915,7,'Yeah, when you think about it, with Classic, our guiding principle was no changes.','None','00:14:33.891','00:14:38.812','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',98.39,100.00),(4916,7,'Our goal was to provide as true-to-life, authentic experience of Classic that we possibly could with the community.','None','00:14:38.846','00:14:43.984','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',98.99,100.00),(4917,7,'And we accomplished that.','None','00:14:44.318','00:14:45.669','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',96.82,100.00),(4918,7,'What was interesting to me is to see this vibrant community that embraced it, and then said,','None','00:14:46.003','00:14:51.642','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',98.82,100.00),(4919,7,'\"Hey, but we\'re not exactly the same as we were 15 years ago, right?\"','None','00:14:52.009','00:14:55.896','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',85.33,100.00),(4920,7,'And they\'re right.','None','00:14:55.929','00:14:56.930','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',89.51,100.00),(4921,7,'And so, some of those things that maybe were out there, that were not great, and were warts back in the day,','None','00:14:59.766','00:15:07.724','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',40.18,100.00),(4922,7,'is not something that we would want to ship again.','None','00:15:07.758','00:15:10.077','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',34.06,100.00),(4923,7,'Like something that feels a little buggy, or wrong, or incorrect, so the idea behind this is,','None','00:15:10.110','00:15:14.982','SADNESS','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',60.62,100.00),(4924,7,'This really, I think, illustrates the...','None','00:15:19.253','00:15:21.522','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',65.69,100.00),(4925,7,'The difference is spell-batching.','None','00:15:22.439','00:15:25.042','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',43.88,100.00),(4926,7,'We actually had a lot of requests originally for spell-batching in that no-changes charge,','None','00:15:25.392','00:15:30.597','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',53.04,100.00),(4927,7,'where they said, \"Hey, I remember when I used to be able to have','None','00:15:31.248','00:15:33.634','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',88.94,100.00),(4928,7,'and so we said, \"Okay, we can put that back in.\" But the system that causes that is of course','None','00:15:38.605','00:15:42.793','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',40.72,100.00),(4929,7,'that the spells are batched up and processed in these giant batches,','None','00:15:42.826','00:15:46.563','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',52.22,100.00),(4930,7,'but over the last two years, people realized that what that comes with','None','00:15:46.597','00:15:49.283','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',75.22,100.00),(4931,7,'is about half a second of built-in latency, where you push a button','None','00:15:49.316','00:15:53.987','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',51.52,100.00),(4932,7,'and it doesn\'t actually take effect for that half a second, while it\'s queueing up the other ones to go with it.','None','00:15:54.021','00:15:59.042','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',43.63,100.00),(4933,7,'And people were starting to find that frustrating.','None','00:15:59.076','00:16:01.094','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',55.57,100.00),(4934,7,'I talked to a lot of people who said they were excited about it when it first came out with Classic,','None','00:16:01.128','00:16:05.132','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',98.18,100.00),(4935,7,'but after they\'d been playing with it for two years, they\'re really ready to see it go,','None','00:16:05.165','00:16:09.069','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',98.24,100.00),(4936,7,'That\'s definitely great.','None','00:16:12.589','00:16:13.590','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',98.61,100.00),(4937,7,'It was because of stuff like this.','None','00:16:16.844','00:16:19.112','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',79.61,100.00),(4938,7,'If you Vanish when a Fireball hits you...','None','00:16:19.146','00:16:21.231','FEAR','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',65.82,100.00),(4939,7,'-...it\'s gonna pop you out. -Exactly.','None','00:16:21.265','00:16:22.733','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',72.62,100.00),(4940,7,'And so we were trying to do all these techy solutions to it,','None','00:16:22.766','00:16:25.085','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',93.80,100.00),(4941,7,'Yeah.','None','00:16:27.538','00:16:28.539','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',66.69,100.00),(4942,7,'But we didn\'t have the ability to do that then, -so glad we\'re doing it now. -Yeah.','None','00:16:28.572','00:16:32.042','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',98.70,100.00),(4943,7,'Things were very different back in 2004, 2005 timelines, compared to today.','None','00:16:36.747','00:16:42.085','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',30.60,100.00),(4944,7,'so rather than always giving them the last version of the boss,','None','00:16:47.791','00:16:51.545','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',64.03,100.00),(4945,7,'the final form of the boss, which maybe is being hit with a few nerfs,','None','00:16:51.578','00:16:55.182','FEAR','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',49.13,100.00),(4946,7,'let\'s not do that anymore.','None','00:16:55.215','00:16:56.233','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',35.79,100.00),(4947,7,'Let\'s give \'em a more challenging version of the boss.','None','00:16:56.266','00:16:58.702','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',72.21,100.00),(4948,7,'I\'ll give you an example of M\'uru, right, where the initial version of that boss','None','00:16:58.735','00:17:03.257','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',56.89,100.00),(4949,7,'We did fix that pretty quickly, and changed the fight to allow for that.','None','00:17:09.196','00:17:13.851','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',84.19,100.00),(4950,7,'Now that\'s a change we probably would incorporate in this.','None','00:17:13.884','00:17:16.803','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',67.11,100.00),(4951,7,'But then, probably a month or so after that, we nerfed M\'uru\'s health.','None','00:17:21.425','00:17:24.578','SADNESS','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',36.93,100.00),(4952,7,'That doesn\'t need to happen.','None','00:17:24.895','00:17:26.663','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',34.97,100.00),(4953,7,'We can evaluate any changes we need to make after that, but...','None','00:17:28.382','00:17:31.034','FEAR','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',32.34,100.00),(4954,7,'Yeah. So how did your mage handle the pushback?','None','00:17:35.122','00:17:37.975','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',40.84,100.00),(4955,7,'-Uh, I just... was sad. -BRIAN: Sat on the bench?','None','00:17:38.008','00:17:40.577','SADNESS','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',97.75,100.00),(4956,7,'The one mage allowed to go.','None','00:17:46.200','00:17:47.467','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',42.78,100.00),(4957,7,'That was a really fun fight.','None','00:17:51.805','00:17:53.106','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',97.07,100.00),(4958,7,'That\'s awesome.','None','00:17:53.140','00:17:54.191','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',96.66,100.00),(4959,7,'and that was intended to be a balancing of the factions, and let\'s make them even.','None','00:18:06.286','00:18:10.791','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',48.03,100.00),(4960,7,'And then they wanted to keep a little bit of flavor of that faction identity,','None','00:18:10.824','00:18:14.795','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',53.82,100.00),(4961,7,'is we are gonna give the opposite faction\'s seal to the other faction,','None','00:18:26.840','00:18:30.711','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',59.19,100.00),(4962,7,'and then get Seal of Vengeance at Level 70, and similarly Alliance will get Seal of Vengeance at Level 64,','None','00:18:37.968','00:18:43.223','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',55.82,100.00),(4963,7,'Another thing we want to talk about is arena teams.','None','00:18:45.993','00:18:48.278','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',52.83,100.00),(4964,7,'BRIAN: When it first came out in Burning Crusade, the arena team system only let you have','None','00:18:48.312','00:18:53.584','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',71.96,100.00),(4965,7,'the same number of players on your team, that was the size of the bracket it was for.','None','00:18:53.617','00:18:57.538','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',38.30,100.00),(4966,7,'So, for example, a 3v3 team could only have three players on the team,','None','00:18:57.571','00:19:01.575','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',34.94,100.00),(4967,7,'That felt really frustrating, so we\'re definitely gonna go with the last version of that,','None','00:19:05.162','00:19:08.632','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',78.55,100.00),(4968,7,'where you could have twice the size of the bracket on your team roster,','None','00:19:08.665','00:19:12.452','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',39.75,100.00),(4969,7,'so that you had alternates you could swap in and out, and then that way,','None','00:19:12.486','00:19:16.156','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',36.19,100.00),(4970,7,'as long as anybody had participated in I think 30% of the matches,','None','00:19:16.190','00:19:19.610','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',70.09,100.00),(4971,7,'then they got the full credit for the week of participation.','None','00:19:19.643','00:19:22.162','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',93.39,100.00),(4972,7,'That came later.','None','00:19:24.531','00:19:25.532','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',35.34,100.00),(4973,7,'We\'re also considering whether or not we wanna do something with that,','None','00:19:25.566','00:19:28.285','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',82.02,100.00),(4974,7,'because another thing that was problematic about arenas was the way that the Elo system was so inflationary,','None','00:19:28.318','00:19:35.209','SADNESS','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',53.18,100.00),(4975,7,'and so we\'re talking about whether or not we want to move forward with','None','00:19:35.242','00:19:37.845','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',66.69,100.00),(4976,7,'converting that to something like the modern MMR system, so that it isn\'t as punishing to people','None','00:19:37.878','00:19:42.883','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',87.68,100.00),(4977,7,'in terms of waiting hours for a match at the highest levels,','None','00:19:42.916','00:19:46.203','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',55.10,100.00),(4978,7,'and things like that.','None','00:19:46.236','00:19:47.237','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',70.82,100.00),(4979,7,'And another change.','None','00:19:47.271','00:19:48.472','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',39.38,100.00),(4980,7,'so that before we actually open the Dark Portal, you\'ll have a chance to level those up.','None','00:19:54.711','00:19:59.166','FEAR','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',41.90,100.00),(4981,7,'-(LAUGHS) -Yeah!','None','00:20:01.435','00:20:02.436','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',64.09,100.00),(4982,7,'and he was like, \"I\'m still back in Wetlands.\" Yeah.','None','00:20:06.857','00:20:09.076','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',60.75,100.00),(4983,7,'LAUGHTER -\"What is going on?\" -HOLLY: Yeah.','None','00:20:09.109','00:20:11.995','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',31.44,100.00),(4984,7,'\"When can I play with you guys?\" So yeah, I\'m really glad we\'re doing that.','None','00:20:12.029','00:20:14.815','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',98.92,100.00),(4985,7,'-Yeah, that\'s the plan. -Very cool.','None','00:20:16.300','00:20:17.668','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',98.35,100.00),(4986,7,'Pre-patch will come out and you\'ll be able to start your blood elves and draenei.','None','00:20:17.701','00:20:21.021','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',91.99,100.00),(4987,7,'So, we\'ve got some phases happening.','None','00:20:22.990','00:20:24.908','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',67.54,100.00),(4988,7,'-Yeah. -HOLLY: Yeah.','None','00:20:24.942','00:20:25.943','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',77.51,100.00),(4989,7,'BRIAN: And we want to start with just that at release, because we found with Classic','None','00:20:34.885','00:20:38.522','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',97.68,100.00),(4990,7,'is with those raids.','None','00:20:43.093','00:20:44.745','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',56.86,100.00),(4991,7,'So as we unlock each chapter, we want to make sure everybody\'s had enough time to be','None','00:20:50.234','00:20:53.704','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',98.12,100.00),(4992,7,'a part of that chapter.','None','00:20:53.737','00:20:54.738','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',38.65,100.00),(4993,7,'-and Tempest Keep. -HOLLY: Yep.','None','00:20:59.760','00:21:01.411','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',81.61,100.00),(4994,7,'BRIAN: And the reason that\'s a change is of course, originally, Hyjal was available from the launch of Burning Crusade,','None','00:21:05.899','00:21:12.623','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',79.84,100.00),(4995,7,'but nobody could get in because of the way the achievements work,','None','00:21:12.656','00:21:15.125','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',94.96,100.00),(4996,7,'And Arena Season Three will come out alongside Zul\'Aman, with a little bit of catch-up gear for anyone','None','00:21:21.615','00:21:26.186','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',87.21,100.00),(4997,7,'It\'s another smaller instance, a ten-man.','None','00:21:27.888','00:21:30.591','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',44.69,100.00),(4998,7,'-PATRICK: Tons of content. -HOLLY: Been very busy.','None','00:21:34.661','00:21:36.697','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',86.36,100.00),(4999,7,'LAUGHTER It is, it\'s an expansion with a lot in it.','None','00:21:36.730','00:21:39.833','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',44.58,100.00),(5000,7,'And so we spent a lot of time talking about Burning Crusade Classic,','None','00:21:39.867','00:21:43.020','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',45.28,100.00),(5001,7,'Well yeah, really the question is, we have a diverse player base','None','00:21:53.764','00:21:56.450','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',97.73,100.00),(5002,7,'where people have a lot of different wants and needs.','None','00:21:56.483','00:21:58.719','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',77.06,100.00),(5003,7,'Well, the first group of people that we wanted to make sure that we were serving well','None','00:22:01.338','00:22:05.959','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',98.19,100.00),(5004,7,'We feel that most of the community is interested in this, they\'re gonna want to do this,','None','00:22:08.679','00:22:12.049','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',59.27,100.00),(5005,7,'we want to make it simple and easy for them.','None','00:22:12.082','00:22:13.750','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',92.91,100.00),(5006,7,'So, how are we gonna do that?','None','00:22:13.784','00:22:15.385','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',48.59,100.00),(5007,7,'As we said earlier, you\'re going to be able to make a choice.','None','00:22:15.419','00:22:18.021','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',97.76,100.00),(5008,7,'So we\'ll talk about and explore these choices in some detail, and I\'ll give you some examples. (CHUCKLES)','None','00:22:18.055','00:22:23.177','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',81.12,100.00),(5009,7,'And what that means is, the servers that are live now will always unlock any expansion we release.','None','00:22:31.418','00:22:37.491','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',97.60,100.00),(5010,7,'So, when we get to our patch day, you\'re gonna be presented with a choice.','None','00:22:37.791','00:22:42.179','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',97.98,100.00),(5011,7,'So, in that space, you\'re gonna do that for every single character.','None','00:22:47.701','00:22:51.271','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',85.49,100.00),(5012,7,'So I\'ve got a Level 60 I\'m definitely taking that on through to Burning Crusade,','None','00:22:54.358','00:22:59.263','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',53.80,100.00),(5013,7,'but there are options.','None','00:23:11.959','00:23:13.076','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',43.00,100.00),(5014,7,'Well that\'s awesome, I\'m excited to hear that.','None','00:23:13.110','00:23:15.128','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',98.58,100.00),(5015,7,'and so now they\'re behind.','None','00:23:22.252','00:23:23.604','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',28.36,100.00),(5016,7,'We want to make sure that those people are served too, and one of the ways we can do that','None','00:23:30.143','00:23:33.847','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',97.62,100.00),(5017,7,'but maybe aren\'t interested in doing the Classic WoW experience, but want to hop right in to Outlands as quickly as possible.','None','00:23:37.901','00:23:43.123','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',92.99,100.00),(5018,7,'Yeah, so, the team, we spent quite a bit of time discussing it','None','00:23:43.156','00:23:46.660','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',42.89,100.00),(5019,7,'It\'ll have some dungeon blues, it\'ll have Level 40 mount skill, no professions, it\'s the basics.','None','00:24:11.068','00:24:16.773','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',92.03,100.00),(5020,7,'That\'s cool. That\'s a really great way to jump into the game, for sure.','None','00:24:19.309','00:24:22.696','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',98.86,100.00),(5021,7,'Look, I know a lot of people came back to play WoW Classic.','None','00:24:24.765','00:24:27.768','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',93.79,100.00),(5022,7,'That\'s all they want, all they ever wanted.','None','00:24:27.801','00:24:29.469','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',52.62,100.00),(5023,7,'They\'re like, \"You know what?','None','00:24:29.503','00:24:30.754','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',78.64,100.00),(5024,7,'What do they get to do? What\'s their options?','None','00:24:35.726','00:24:37.794','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',42.00,100.00),(5025,7,'Yeah, that was really important for us too.','None','00:24:37.828','00:24:39.713','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',96.56,100.00),(5026,7,'So, we had all sat down and discussed how we should frame this,','None','00:24:39.746','00:24:45.335','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',44.04,100.00),(5027,7,'so, when we get to our patch day, which is prior to the Dark Portal opening,','None','00:24:45.369','00:24:50.390','FEAR','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',63.66,100.00),(5028,7,'and you will have that choice.','None','00:25:01.151','00:25:02.669','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',61.67,100.00),(5029,7,'I want to move that character to Classic era, and what Classic era means,','None','00:25:10.627','00:25:15.415','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',97.57,100.00),(5030,7,'It\'s never going to unlock expansions.','None','00:25:22.773','00:25:24.608','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',68.79,100.00),(5031,7,'You\'ll be able to make that choice for every single character.','None','00:25:24.875','00:25:27.294','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',97.86,100.00),(5032,7,'Let\'s say you\'re behind the times a little bit.','None','00:25:30.614','00:25:34.117','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',45.08,100.00),(5033,7,'You\'ll still be able to have that choice.','None','00:25:34.151','00:25:35.702','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',97.94,100.00),(5034,7,'We haven\'t locked it to a time window.','None','00:25:35.736','00:25:37.921','FEAR','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',43.29,100.00),(5035,7,'The choice sounds awesome, and choice in WoW is something meaningful, it\'s always been.','None','00:25:39.873','00:25:44.444','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',99.01,100.00),(5036,7,'I think it\'s something that\'s important when we look at the community','None','00:25:44.478','00:25:47.364','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',97.87,100.00),(5037,7,'Some people may not be comfortable with that choice.','None','00:25:51.385','00:25:53.637','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',96.25,100.00),(5038,7,'And while we think that that choice is important, we also recognize that there are folks','None','00:25:53.670','00:25:57.975','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',98.67,100.00),(5039,7,'that are gonna want to play both.','None','00:25:58.008','00:25:59.510','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',87.82,100.00),(5040,7,'that same character wants to raid with your friends.','None','00:26:07.584','00:26:09.703','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',84.02,100.00),(5041,7,'-BRIAN: That\'s exactly-- -So what does that look like?','None','00:26:09.736','00:26:12.189','FEAR','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',34.11,100.00),(5042,7,'How do we make that happen?','None','00:26:12.222','00:26:13.223','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',51.35,100.00),(5043,7,'So we\'re gonna offer a paid service to let you make a copy of your character,','None','00:26:13.257','00:26:17.394','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',91.33,100.00),(5044,7,'and I know a copy\'s a big deal, so like you said,','None','00:26:17.427','00:26:19.630','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',72.54,100.00),(5045,7,'this is something we don\'t want to make just an automatic choice for everybody,','None','00:26:19.663','00:26:23.016','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',80.26,100.00),(5046,7,'so I want to be able to say, like, \"You know what?','None','00:26:27.504','00:26:29.289','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',44.45,100.00),(5047,7,'I\'m willing to pay for this.','None','00:26:29.323','00:26:30.707','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',95.44,100.00),(5048,7,'who are really excited to go to Karazhan, I\'m really excited to go to Karazhan,','None','00:26:38.916','00:26:42.002','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',98.23,100.00),(5049,7,'of my Tier Three set from Naxxramas, I still have an opportunity to go find a new guild there,','None','00:26:45.239','00:26:49.893','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',95.26,100.00),(5050,7,'We\'ll be spending a lot of time communicating these details, so even as much detail as we\'re giving now,','None','00:26:52.946','00:26:57.868','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',77.39,100.00),(5051,7,'But, with that said... So, Pat?','None','00:27:01.972','00:27:04.358','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:46:01','2026-09-17 19:46:01',49.79,100.00),(5052,7,'-Hm? -When\'s all this happening?','None','00:27:04.741','00:27:06.243','FEAR','Will translate during reel genera