,'corners','00:03:40.090','00:03:42.950','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','IDIOM','2026-09-17 19:50:11','2026-09-17 19:50:11',50.04,76.74),(5089,8,'The next expressions that we\'re going to talk about are: To come up, and, better late than','better late than','00:03:42.950','00:03:48.340','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','IDIOM','2026-09-17 19:50:11','2026-09-17 19:50:11',58.12,85.13),(5090,8,'Vanessa: Better late than never.','better late than never','00:04:40.439','00:04:43.350','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','IDIOM','2026-09-17 19:50:11','2026-09-17 19:50:11',80.63,99.94),(5091,8,'Better late than never.','better late than never','00:04:43.350','00:04:44.629','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','IDIOM','2026-09-17 19:50:11','2026-09-17 19:50:11',67.09,99.87),(5092,8,'So I will often say, better late than never.','better late than never','00:04:54.699','00:04:57.710','SADNESS','Will translate during reel generation...','IDIOM','2026-09-17 19:50:11','2026-09-17 19:50:11',43.51,99.96),(5093,8,'Leila: No, I\'ll say it when you turn up late.','turn up','00:04:57.710','00:04:59.770','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','IDIOM','2026-09-17 19:50:11','2026-09-17 19:50:11',44.33,98.65),(5094,8,'Better late than never.\" Sabrah: So it means it\'s better to arrive than to never come, to never arrive.','better late than never','00:05:04.030','00:05:08.710','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','IDIOM','2026-09-17 19:50:11','2026-09-17 19:50:11',77.89,99.38),(5095,8,'So yes, I think it\'s very easy to understand that one, better late than never.','better late than never','00:05:08.710','00:05:12.669','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','IDIOM','2026-09-17 19:50:11','2026-09-17 19:50:11',95.44,99.96),(5096,8,'Sabrah: Yes, coming in then.','coming in','00:05:22.949','00:05:24.770','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','HARD_WORD','2026-09-17 19:50:11','2026-09-17 