ths ago the President convened a summit on countering violent extremism','None','00:02:22.208','00:02:26.513','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',94.88,100.00),(5443,9,'to try to collate best practices that are used in communities across the country,','None','00:02:26.513','00:02:32.952','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',87.68,100.00),(5444,9,'and that can be used in other communities to repel this threat.','None','00:02:32.952','00:02:35.955','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',46.89,100.00),(5445,9,'The Press: Is it time for individuals or groups or even publications to stop depicting the','None','00:02:38.958','00:02:46.032','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',44.97,100.00),(5446,9,'Mr. Earnest: Well, that\'s obviously a judgment that we leave up to individual media organizations.','None','00:02:49.869','00:03:00.113','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',92.71,100.00),(5447,9,'however offensive, that justifies an act of terrorism or even an act of violence.','None','00:03:07.520','00:03:14.294','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',96.85,100.00),(5448,9,'And that apparently is what these two individuals in Texas were trying to do.','None','00:03:14.294','00:03:20.967','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',47.86,100.00),(5449,9,'They were responding to one form of expression that they found offensive, and tried to use that as','None','00:03:20.967','00:03:27.907','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',98.08,100.00),(5450,9,'justification to