efs of','None','00:04:10.450','00:04:14.754','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',43.22,100.00),(5459,9,'Staff, respectively.','None','00:04:14.754','00:04:15.755','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',44.11,100.00),(5460,9,'The President has gotten to know General Dunford.','None','00:04:15.755','00:04:17.724','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',72.44,100.00),(5461,9,'Obviously General Dunford has proudly served this country in a variety of roles but including in','None','00:04:19.926','00:04:25.498','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',90.48,100.00),(5462,9,'combat, and that combat experience is valuable to individuals who serve in military leadership','None','00:04:25.498','00:04:32.939','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',98.73,100.00),(5463,9,'positions as well.','None','00:04:32.939','00:04:34.707','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',36.03,100.00),(5464,9,'It\'s a testament that General Dunford is somebody who doesn\'t just talk the talk,','None','00:04:34.707','00:04:39.646','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',47.75,100.00),(5465,9,'but he is somebody who walks the walk.','None','00:04:39.646','00:04:41.881','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',68.98,100.00),(5466,9,'And the President is going to rely on General Dunford both for his broader strategic advice,','None','00:04:41.881','00:04:46.586','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',85.00,100.00),(5467,9,'but the President is pleased that that strategic advice will be informed by General Dunford\'s own personal','None','00:04:46.586','00:04:51.557','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',99.16,100.00),(5468,9,'experience in combat.','None','00:04:51.557','00:04:53.960','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',46.85,100.00),(5469,9,'Obviously the President and General Dunford have talked about the challenging situation in Afghanistan','None','00:04:53.960','00:04:58.631','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',29.36,100.00),(5470,9,'over the years.','None','00:04:58.631','00:04:59.632','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',38.28,100.00),(5471,9,'General Dunford has his own firsthand experience in leading our troops there.','None','00:04:59.632','00:05:04.570','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',78.30,100.00),(5472,9,'our military strategy.','None','00:05:10.710','00:05:11.711','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',50.52,100.00),(5473,9,'Obviously one of the significant challenges facing the next Chairman of the Joint Chiefs of Staff','None','00:05:17.984','00:05:24.390','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',63.02,100.00),(5474,9,'will be considering this military policy moving forward as we continue to draw down our military','None','00:05:24.390','00:05:30.029','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',62.34,100.00),(5475,9,'personnel from Afghanistan while at the same time we\'ve preserved the important security','None','00:05:30.029','00:05:34.567','JOY','Will translate during reel gener