,'ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',33.99,100.00),(5526,9,'interest of the American people, particularly when we know they have strong','None','00:10:35.868','00:10:39.872','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',98.43,100.00),(5527,9,'bipartisan support.','None','00:10:39.872','00:10:40.873','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',90.77,100.00),(5528,9,'We know there\'s strong bipartisan support for some of the FISA reform proposals,','None','00:10:44.443','00:10:48.447','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',96.81,100.00),(5529,9,'So, surely we should be able to expect the United States Senate to do more than one thing over the course','None','00:10:51.584','00:10:58.090','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',92.09,100.00),(5530,9,'of this month.','None','00:10:58.090','00:10:59.091','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',48.32,100.00),(5531,9,'And I\'m gratified that we have seen a number of senators come forward and say that exact thing,','None','00:10:59.091','00:11:03.396','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',84.86,100.00),(5532,9,'that they welcome Senator Reid\'s interest in seeing some of these other priorities that he\'s','None','00:11:03.396','00:11:09.869','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',94.41,100.00),(5533,9,'The Press: Last week, on the USA Freedom Act, which would replace the Patriot Act,','None','00:11:15.207','00:11:20.346','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',52.21,100.00),(