g reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',92.05,100.00),(5568,9,'The Press: And I know you\'ve been asked this before, but I want another bite at it, which is,','None','00:14:34.039','00:14:37.409','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',78.53,100.00),(5569,9,'as sanctions are, I\'ll say, eased -- not lifted, but eased -- on Iran, they\'re going to get','None','00:14:37.409','00:14:43.716','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',87.78,100.00),(5570,9,'a flood of cash.','None','00:14:43.716','00:14:46.485','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',59.50,100.00),(5571,9,'in the region, that they\'re going to find some other use for it?','None','00:14:52.057','00:14:55.094','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',56.30,100.00),(5572,9,'relief to fund Hezbollah or other groups?','None','00:14:59.098','00:15:01.333','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',32.36,100.00),(5573,9,'Mr. Earnest: Well, Olivier, I think, most importantly, it\'s the hope of the Iranian people that that influx','None','00:15:01.333','00:15:06.839','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',98.45,100.00),(5574,9,'of resources will be devoted to meeting the needs of the population there and strengthening the economy','None','00:15:06.839','00:15:12.645','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',93.26,100.00),(5575,9,'that has taken a terrible toll on the daily lives','None','00:15:12.645','00:15:18.717','SADNESS','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',88.90,100.00),(5576,9,'of millio