ion...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',89.72,100.00),(5585,9,'idea that they need to get rid of -- they need to throw off the sanctions, or at least get the','None','00:16:18.944','00:16:23.449','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',68.14,100.00),(5586,9,'Again, the pressure that they\'re reacting to is from the Iranian people who are frustrated at the','None','00:16:29.355','00:16:34.827','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',98.35,100.00),(5587,9,'So, again, I wouldn\'t be in a position to predict exactly what the Iranian reaction will be,','None','00:16:39.565','00:16:45.571','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',53.37,100.00),(5588,9,'and I\'m certainly not going to be in a position to mandate what kinds of economic decisions that','None','00:16:45.571','00:16:51.110','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',79.29,100.00),(5589,9,'they\'ll make.','None','00:16:51.110','00:16:52.378','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',70.33,100.00),(5590,9,'their priority will be to use those resources to address the persistent economic problems','None','00:16:57.316','00:17:01.820','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',50.27,100.00),(5591,9,'in their country.','None','00:17:01.820','00:17:02.821','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',65.37,100.00),(5592,9,'The Press: But as you pointed out in your number one, there\'s no indication that even under all this pressure','None','00:17:02.821','00:17:06.825','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',74.97,100.00),(5593,9,'they\'ve really scaled back those destabilizing activities.','None','00:17:06.825','00:17:09.795','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',48.68,100.00),(5594,9,'So they already face this choice.','None','00:17:09.795','00:17:11.797','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',39.50,100.00),(5595,9,'They\'re making the choice to continue to fund these activities.','None','00:17:11.797','00:17:14.800','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',91.23,100.00),(5596,9,'I guess I don\'t see why that would change for a newly flush Iran.','None','00:17:14.800','00:17:18.303','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',69.87,100.00),(5597,9,'change -- you\'ll recall that when President Obama took office, there was a situation where the','None','00:17:22.307','00:17:28.380','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',35.88,100.00),(5598,9,'international community was fractured in terms of how to confront Iran and their nuclear ambitions.','None','00:17:28.380','00:17:33.852','FEAR','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',62.71,100.00),(5599,9,'At the same time, this was a problematic dynamic because the Iranian people inside of Iran was unified','None','00:17:33.852','00:17:42.161','SADNESS','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',46.47,100.00),(5600,9,'in support of the government\'s pursuit of a nuclear weapons program.','None','00:17:42.161','00:17:47.633','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',78.58,100.00),(5601,9,'Because of the President\'s leadership, because of the strong actions taken by the','None','00:17:47.633','00:17:51.637','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',92.06,100.00),(5602,9,'Now the international community is united in ensuring that Iran cannot obtain a nuclear weapon,','None','00:17:54.640','00:17:58.677','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',92.33,100.00),(5603,9,'by the poor economic conditions in that country.','None','00:18:06.919','00:18:09.154','SADNESS','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',82.84,100.00),(5604,9,'And we\'ve seen that economy only weaken further over time because of the pressure that\'s being applied','None','00:18:09.154','00:18:15.727','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',49.47,100.00),(5605,9,'by the international community.','None','00:18:15.727','00:18:17.095','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',43.13,100.00),(5606,9,'And that pressure, again, that\'s put in place by the international community and has prompted a reaction','None','00:18:17.095','00:18:23.168','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',81.67,100.00),(5607,9,'on the part of the Iranian population because of the poor economy -- that is what has prompted Iran to come','None','00:18:23.168','00:18:29.174','SADNESS','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',47.46,100.00),(5608,9,'to the negotiating table and start having constructive conversations with us about how to curtail and,','None','00:18:29.174','00:18:35.848','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',96.45,100.00),(5609,9,'a nuclear weapon.','None','00:18:39.952','00:18:40.953','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',58.04,100.00),(5610,9,'So, again, the pressure that they\'re responding to is an economic one.','None','00:18:40.953','00:18:43.922','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',96.38,100.00),(5611,9,'would use those additional resources to try to relieve that economic pressure that they\'re feeling.','None','00:18:51.530','00:18:55.634','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',95.24,100.00),(5612,9,'But again, I\'m not going to make any predictions about what they\'re going to do, and I certainly am not','None','00:18:55.634','00:18:59.638','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',68.66,100.00),(5613,9,'going to be in a position to prescribe what they should do.','None','00:18:59.638','00:19:03.342','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',53.93,100.00),(5614,9,'This is a sovereign country that will make their own decisions.','None','00:19:03.342','00:19:06.345','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',96.02,100.00),(5615,9,'The last point -- two last points that I\'ll make -- one is that there continue to be other sanctions that','None','00:19:06.345','00:19:10.549','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',70.44,100.00),(5616,9,'will remain in place even if we are able to reach a nuclear agreement.','None','00:19:10.549','00:19:15.120','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',81.96,100.00),(5617,9,'There are a host of sanctions that the international community has placed on Iran in response','None','00:19:15.120','00:19:19.892','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',76.38,100.00),(5618,9,'to their support for terrorism, some weapons proliferation activities that have aroused','None','00:19:19.892','00:19:27.099','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',56.29,100.00),(5619,9,'the concern of the international community.','None','00:19:27.099','00:19:29.401','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',47.27,100.00),(5620,9,'And so the point is there are a large number of sanctions that will remain in place.','None','00:19:29.401','00:19:35.674','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',69.93,100.00),(5621,9,'Michelle.','None','00:19:35.674','00:19:36.408','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',37.30,100.00),(5622,9,'The Press: Hey, Josh.','None','00:19:36.408','00:19:37.409','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',60.57,100.00),(5623,9,'I know you said that the incident in Texas is, of course, under investigation.','None','00:19:37.409','00:19:40.646','FEAR','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',58.87,100.00),(5624,9,'But regardless of what the investigation reveals, just given the way this played out,','None','00:19:40.646','00:19:45.484','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',42.52,100.00),(5625,9,'the type of event it was, the fact that at least one','None','00:19:45.484','00:19:47.986','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',52.56,100.00),(5626,9,'as a terrorist attack?','None','00:19:54.159','00:19:55.561','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-0