1.063','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',30.58,100.00),(5636,9,'that\'s also the hardest thing to prevent.','None','00:20:38.370','00:20:40.539','SADNESS','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',63.16,100.00),(5637,9,'of the foreign fighters?','None','00:20:47.813','00:20:49.314','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',54.91,100.00),(5638,9,'Mr. Earnest: Well, this is something that the United States government has been focused on in both','None','00:20:49.314','00:20:53.685','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',97.06,100.00),(5639,9,'of these issues, both in terms of foreign fighters, as well as efforts that are underway by extremists,','None','00:20:53.685','00:20:59.157','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',62.87,100.00),(5640,9,'including those inside of ISIL, to use social media to try to radicalize individuals','None','00:20:59.157','00:21:03.895','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',91.28,100.00),(5641,9,'and inspire them to carry out acts of violence.','None','00:21:03.895','00:21:05.897','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',81.55,100.00),(5642,9,'We\'re mindful of both threats.','None','00:21:05.897','00:21:06.898','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',70.86,100.00),(5643,9,'And when it comes to foreign fighters, the President, as you\'ll recall, convened a meeting of the','None','00:21:06.898','00:21:13.005','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',41.37,100.00),(5644,9,'to stop the flow of fighters -- or at least reduce the flow of fighters to the Middle East who are','None','00:21:17.676','00:21:26.218','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',69.93,100.00),(5645,9,'taking up arms alongside ISIL.','None','00:21:26.218','00:21:28.387','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',43.81,100.00),(5646,9,'And we\'re mindful of that threat.','None','00:21:28.387','00:21:30.389','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',64.35,100.00),(5647,9,'We\'ve worked cooperatively with the international community.','None','00:21:30.389','00:21:32.391','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',96.47,100.00),(5648,9,'And there have been steps taken by law enforcement in this country to prevent individuals in the','None','00:21:32.391','00:21:37.496','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',54.53,100.00),(5649,9,'United States from traveling to Syria or to other places in the region with the aspiration of fighting','None','00:21:37.496','00:21:43.001','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',39.55,100.00),(5650,9,'alongside ISIL.','None','00:21:43.001','00:21:44.736','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',40.95,100.00),(5651,9,'But we continue to be keenly aware and vigilant about the threat that is posed by a so-called lone wolf,','None','00:21:44.736','00:21:54.012','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',89.86,100.00),(5652,9,'where you have an individual who is disaffected and is','None','00:21:54.012','00:22:00.485','SADNESS','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',57.69,100.00),(5653,9,'vulnerable to some of the kind of recruitment efforts that we see ISIL employ through social media.','None','00:22:00.485','00:22:07.793','FEAR','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',95.66,100.00),(5654,9,'And, again, I can\'t speak to what happened in this particular situation because it\'s still under','None','00:22:07.793','00:22:12.597','SADNESS','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',53.75,100.00),(5655,9,'And there are periodically law enforcement actions','None','00:22:15.834','00:22:21.006','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',47.53,100.00),(5656,9,'And so I think that is an indication that our law enforcement community, our intelligence professionals,','None','00:22:32.984','00:22:38.356','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',84.64,100.00),(5657,9,'and our homeland security officials continue to be vigilant about this ongoing threat.','None','00:22:38.356','00:22:42.527','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',43.53,100.00),(5658,9,'The Press: Okay.','None','00:22:42.527','00:22:43.428','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',96.58,100.00),(5659,9,'And lastly, the possible release of Omar Khadr in Canada, the former Gitmo detainee -- the thought that','None','00:22:43.428','00:22:50.368','FEAR','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',86.79,100.00),(5660,9,'he may soon be released from prison there.','None','00:22:50.368','00:22:53.638','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',84.04,100.00),(5661,9,'How does the administration feel about that?','None','00:22:53.638','00:22:56.308','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',56.73,100.00),(5662,9,'Mr. Earnest: Well, I haven\'t seen those specific reports, but obviously the United States has a strong','None','00:22:56.308','00:23:01.880','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',98.42,100.00),(5663,9,'and important alliance with Canada, and whenever there are transfers that are conducted','None','00:23:01.880','00:23:11.623','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',94.31,100.00),(5664,9,'from the prison at Guantanamo Bay to other countries, it is done with a set of security requirements','None','00:23:11.623','00:23:17.596','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',33.88,100.00),(5665,9,'in place.','None','00:23:17.596','00:23:18.697','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',36.62,100.00),(5666,9,'And the United States stays in close touch with our partners who are working with us in the effort','None','00:23:18.697','00:23:25.003','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',87.29,100.00),(5667,9,'to close the prison at Guantanamo Bay as they apply the security requirements that we and they believe','None','00:23:25.003','00:23:30.976','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',57.27,100.00),(5668,9,'are necessary to protect the citizens in both our countries.','None','00:23:30.976','00:23:35.514','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',81.35,100.00),(5669,9,'Mara.','None','00:23:35.514','00:23:36.581','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',30.41,100.00),(5670,9,'The Press: To follow up on Justin\'s question about overtime.','None','00:23:36.581','00:23:39.251','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',50.43,100.00),(5671,9,'Do you have -- I know you can\'t say when OMB will make','None','00:23:39.251','00:23:42.621','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',55.17,100.00),(5672,9,'Other rules that the President has asked labor to develop have come out much quicker.','None','00:23:45.924','00:23:50.462','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',64.19,100.00),(5673,9,'Mr. Earnest: Well, this is one particular rule that was the subject of extensive study.','None','00:23:50.462','00:23:57.335','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',96.18,100.00),(5674,9,'conversations with people who would be affected by this decision -- that included a wide variety','None','00:24:01.807','00:24:09.114','FEAR','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',71.61,100.00),(5675,9,'of employers, but also organizations that represent the interests of working people.','None','00:24:09.114','00:24:16.087','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',48.51,100.00),(5676,9,'I know that there is a body of academic work that\'s been','None','00:24:16.087','00:24:18.890','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',95.68,100.00),(5677,9,'But as to why this one took longer than other rules have','None','00:24:27.699','00:24:30.602','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',52.30,100.00),(5678,9,'taken, I can\'t speak to that.','None','00:24:30.602','00:24:32.671','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',66.43,100.00),(5679,9,'That may be something that the Department of Labor can speak to once a final recommendation has been','None','00:24:32.671','00:24:37.242','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',55.45,100.00),(5680,9,'moved forward.','None','00:24:37.242','00:24:41.413','FEAR','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',47.59,100.00),(5681,9,'Let\'s see, let\'s move around a little bit.','None','00:24:41.413','00:24:42.180','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',68.00,100.00),(5682,9,'Bill Press.','None','00:24:42.180','00:24:43.281','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',40.18,100.00),(5683,9,'The Press: Josh, I want to come back to Garland, Texas for a second, in that this event was an event that','None','00:24:43.281','00:24:47.285','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',49.66,100.00),(5684,9,'was deliberately planned to offer a prize for the worst depiction, if you will, of Mohammed.','None','00:24:47.285','00:24:52.958','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',77.76,100.00),(5685,9,'Is it in -- do you believe, is it, while we all condemn the violence,','None','00:24:52.958','00:24:57.696','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',85.71,100.00),(5686,9,'Mr. Earnest: Well, again, the principle that we have cited here is that no act of expression,','None','00:25:03.068','00:25:10.308','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',82.62,100.00),(5687,9,'even if it\'s an offensive expression, can justify an act of terrorism,','None','00:25:10.308','00:25:17.148','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',97.56,100.00),(5688,9,'or even an act of violence.','None','00:25:17.148','00:25:19.417','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',84.13,100.00),(5689,9,'And that\'s why I\'m reluctant to offer -- render my own judgment or the judgment of the United States government','None','00:25:19.417','00:25:25.924','FEAR','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',98.29,100.00),(5690,9,'about this particular act of expression.','None','00:25:25.924','00:25:28.493','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',36.81,100.00),(5691,9,'But there certainly is no room in our society,','None','00:25:28.493','00:25:35.000','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',44.66,100.00),(5692,9,'and it certainly doesn\'t reflect a commitment to','None','00:25:35.000','00:25:40.572','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',92.79,100.00),(5693,9,'The Press: This organization -- you don\'t have to.','None','00:25:46.611','00:25:48.213','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',75.65,100.00),(5694,9,'The organization has been identified by the Southern Poverty Law Center as a hate group,','None','00:25:48.213','00:25:53.118','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',95.78,100.00),(5695,9,'and it seems they organized this event deliberately to provoke a response.','None','00:25:53.118','00:25:57.022','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',57.97,100.00),(5696,9,'Are they in any way responsible for what happened?','None','00:25:57.022','00:25:59.457','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',83.43,100.00),(5697,9,'Mr. Earnest: Well, again, there\'s no justification for an act of violence and an attempted act','None','00:25:59.457','00:26:03.495','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',74.98,100.00),(5698,9,'of terrorism like the one that we saw.','None','00:26:03.495','00:26:05.764','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',68.52,100.00),(5699,9,'And even those who do find these expressions offensive','None','00:26:05.764','00:26:11.536','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',98.02,100.00),(5700,9,'would say that it does not justify an act of violence.','None','00:26:22.647','00:26:25.917','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',94.37,100.00),(5701,9,'And I think that\'s the principle that\'s at stake here.','None','00:26:25.917','00:26:28.920','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',51.18,100.00),(5702,9,'And it\'s going to be something that we\'ll continue to -- there\'s a lot more for us to learn about','None','00:26:28.920','00:26:35.160','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',93.33,100.00),(5703,9,'what exactly took place in Texas and our intelligence and law enforcement professionals are','None','00:26:35.160','00:26:40.365','FEAR','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',33.05,100.00),(5704,9,'Jon.','None','00:26:43.301','00:26:44.569','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',37.15,100.00),(5705,9,'The Press: Just a couple questions on Iran.','None','00:26:44.569','00:26:47.005','FEAR','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',48.28,100.00),(5706,9,'First of all, June 30th is our deadline, correct, for the --','None','00:26:47.005','00:26:51.943','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',81.02,100.00),(5707,9,'Mr. Earnest: That is correct.','None','00:26:51.943','00:26:53.144','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',97.04,100.00),(5708,9,'The Press: Is that also -- you previously said that the earlier deadline was basically the real deadline.','None','00:26:53.144','00:26:59.050','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',70.94,100.00),(5709,9,'Is there any wiggle room on this June 30th deadline?','None','00:26:59.050','00:27:02.220','FEAR','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',48.14,100.00),(5710,9,'is the day that the Joint Plan of Action would expire.','None','00:27:04.756','00:27:09.828','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',51.12,100.00),(5711,9,'This is the interim agreement that was reached between Iran and the international community.','None','00:27:09.828','00:27:13.231','FEAR','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',36.63,100.00),(5712,9,'So the point is there are consequences for not meeting that deadline.','None','00:27:16.901','00:27:21.873','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',47.36,100.00),(5713,9,'I know that there have been earlier negotiations where the deadline has slipped a day or two.','None','00:27:21.873','00:27:30.048','FEAR','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',79.24,100.00),(5714,9,'But as the President said in relation to the April 30th deadline, we\'ve been negotiating here for more','None','00:27:30.048','00:27:37.155','FEAR','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',36.93,100.00),(5715,9,'than a year and a half -- or at least about a year and','None','00:27:37.155','00:27:41.426','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',33.32,100.00),(5716,9,'a half, and the time has come for the international community and, most importantly,','None','00:27:41.426','00:27:45.497','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',91.15,100.00),(5717,9,'Iran to make some serious decisions about their commitment to resolving this situation through diplomacy.','None','00:27:45.497','00:27:53.171','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',85.71,100.00),(5718,9,'The President and the international community have acted decisively.','None','00:27:53.171','00:27:56.241','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',90.99,100.00),(5719,9,'We\'ve been clear about what our expectations are in terms of shutting down every pathway that Iran','None','00:27:56.241','00:28:01.046','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',90.09,100.00),(5720,9,'has to a nuclear weapon, and about imposing the most stringent and intrusive set of inspections that have','None','00:28:01.046','00:28:07.252','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',60.27,100.00),(5721,9,'ever been imposed on a country\'s nuclear program.','None','00:28:07.252','00:28:11.523','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',83.21,100.00),(5722,9,'That\'s what the United States and the international community requires in this agreement.','None','00:28:11.523','00:28:16.227','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',71.13,100.00),(5723,9,'And there are still important details to be worked out.','None','00:28:16.227','00:28:20.165','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',97.27,100.00),(5724,9,'But we continue to be hopeful that we\'ll be able to successfully complete an agreement by June 30th','None','00:28:20.165','00:28:26.805','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',98.78,100.00),(5725,9,'through diplomacy, is by far the best way for us to prevent Iran from obtaining a nuclear weapon.','None','00:28:33.244','00:28:39.317','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',67.70,100.00),(5726,9,'The Press: You do have some pretty fundamental differences still.','None','00:28:39.317','00:28:42.387','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',55.21,100.00),(5727,9,'What is the alternative?','None','00:28:42.387','00:28:43.988','FEAR','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',46.16,100.00),(5728,9,'What happens if there is no agreement by the 30th or by a day or two after the 30th?','None','00:28:43.988','00:28:47.926','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',42.83,100.00),(5729,9,'What we\'re focused on right now is trying to -- is to complete these negotiations.','None','00:28:49.627','00:28:55.233','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',61.61,100.00),(5730,9,'And I know that our technical experts even this week have been in touch with their Iranian counterparts','None','00:28:55.233','00:29:00.472','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',94.84,100.00),(5731,9,'The thing we continue to be mindful of is that, while this broader political framework has been','None','00:29:04.309','00:29:08.847','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',90.79,100.00),(5732,9,'will allow both sides to live up to the terms of this broader','None','00:29:16.788','00:29:19.691','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',96.87,100.00),(5733,9,'political outline.','None','00:29:19.691','00:29:20.692','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',54.63,100.00),(5734,9,'So we\'re mindful of the importance of those details, and that\'s why, here, even a couple of months in advance','None','00:29:20.692','00:29:26.331','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',65.30,100.00),(5735,9,'of the deadline, this is something that our experts are working on.','None','00:29:26.331','00:29:31.603','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',76.44,100.00),(5736,9,'The Press: Because the President, a number of times, and you have as well, have basically portrayed the','None','00:29:31.603','00:29:36.341','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',58.15,100.00),(5737,9,'But I mean, that\'s not the choice you\'re facing at the end of June 30th, is it?','None','00:29:39.210','00:29:44.182','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',40.86,100.00),(5738,9,'So what -- that\'s what I\'m trying to get a sense of --','None','00:29:51.689','00:29:54.526','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',46.82,100.00),(5739,9,'what happens if you don\'t get a deal?','None','00:29:54.526','00:29:56.528','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',52.82,100.00),(5740,9,'Mr. Earnest: Well, the reason that we have described it this way is that those critics of this','None','00:29:56.528','00:30:00.665','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',95.28,100.00),(5741,9,'negotiation don\'t suggest that there\'s some other deal that could be reached through negotiation.','None','00:30:00.665','00:30:06.538','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',69.70,100.00),(5742,9,'They\'re essentially throwing out the diplomatic option, which I guess only leaves you with','None','00:30:06.538','00:30:12.777','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',75.53,100.00),(5743,9,'the military option.','None','00:30:12.777','00:30:13.778','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',36.80,100.00),(5744,9,'I haven\'t heard a suggestion that there is some other option out there.','None','00:30:13.778','00:30:16.781','FEAR','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',33.78,100.00),(5745,9,'The Press: Okay, but you just said a deal has got to','None','00:30:16.781','00:30:18.783','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',90.74,100.00),(5746,9,'You\'ve been negotiating for a year and a half.','None','00:30:20.952','00:30:22.587','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',41.37,100.00),(5747,9,'If you can\'t get there, you have these fundamental differences about when sanctions are being lifted,','None','00:30:22.587','00:30:25.490','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',61.24,100.00),(5748,9,'what is your alternative?','None','00:30:25.490','00:30:28.126','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',41.35,100.00),(5749,9,'Or accept war?','None','00:30:32.430','00:30:34.332','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',43.37,100.00),(5750,9,'Mr. Earnest: Well, I think what we are trying to do, and I think what we are forcing the Iranians to do,','None','00:30:34.332','00:30:41.039','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',91.31,100.00),(5751,9,'is to try to agree on all the details that support','None','00:30:41.039','00:30:48.446','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',90.17,100.00),(5752,9,'this broader political understanding that\'s been reached a month or so ago.','None','00:30:48.446','00:30:52.550','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',61.43,100.00),(5753,9,'And that\'s what we\'re focused on.','None','00:30:52.550','00:30:54.786','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',70.67,100.00),(5754,9,'We believe it\'s clearly in the best interest of the international community, and Iran has something to gain','None','00:30:54.786','00:30:59.724','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',97.44,100.00),(5755,9,'from this, as well.','None','00:30:59.724','00:31:00.992','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',41.29,100.00),(5756,9,'And that\'s why we\'re so focused on this particular objective.','None','00:31:00.992','00:31:04.229','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',78.86,100.00),(5757,9,'Would the administration be troubled if this bill died -- I mean, between the machinations of -- maneuvers','None','00:31:12.203','00:31:18.343','SADNESS','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',94.90,100.00),(5758,9,'of folks like Tom Cotton and Marco Rubio, if this bill died in the Senate?','None','00:31:18.343','00:31:23.915','SADNESS','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',48.85,100.00),(5759,9,'Would that be a problem?','None','00:31:25.550','00:31:26.551','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',49.38,100.00),(5760,9,'of negotiations.','None','00:31:31.089','00:31:32.090','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',44.99,100.00),(5761,9,'But at the same time, by working diligently in bipartisan fashion, we were able to reach','None','00:31:32.090','00:31:37.428','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',97.47,100.00),(5762,9,'a compromise that was approved unanimously -- not','None','00:31:37.428','00:31:42.667','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',69.95,100.00),(5763,9,'just with bipartisan support, but approved by every single Democrat and Republican that serves','None','00:31:42.667','00:31:46.704','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',92.26,100.00),(5764,9,'on the Senate Foreign Relations Committee.','None','00:31:46.704','00:31:49.107','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',41.63,100.00),(5765,9,'But ultimately, it will be the responsibility of individual senators to decide whether or not','None','00:31:49.107','00:31:53.244','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',49.56,100.00),(5766,9,'they\'re going to go along with this compromise proposal that\'s got strong bipartisan support,','None','00:31:53.244','00:31:58.816','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',96.18,100.00),(5767,9,'or if there might be other factors in play that might be affecting the decision that they\'re making in terms','None','00:31:58.816','00:32:04.222','FEAR','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',49.95,100.00),(5768,9,'of casting this vote.','None','00:32:04.222','00:32:05.623','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',61.77,100.00),(5769,9,'The Press: But there would be no mourning here at the White House if that bill died in the Senate?','None','00:32:05.623','00:32:09.627','SADNESS','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',89.40,100.00),(5770,9,'Mr. Earnest: Well, again, we\'ve made clear what our starting position was, but we\'ve also made clear that','None','00:32:09.627','00:32:14.666','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',96.92,100.00),(5771,9,'the compromise that was reached by Chairman Corker and Senator Cardin is a reasonable and','None','00:32:14.666','00:32:22.173','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',95.72,100.00),(5772,9,'acceptable one.','None','00:32:22.173','00:32:23.174','JOY','Will transla