4','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',77.11,100.00),(5782,9,'And the President is hopeful that Democrats, as they take a clear-eyed look at this proposal,','None','00:33:28.639','00:33:36.347','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',97.71,100.00),(5783,9,'will acknowledge that the best way to advance the kinds of progressive values and the best way','None','00:33:36.347','00:33:43.388','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',95.16,100.00),(5784,9,'to advance the interests of middle-class families all across the country is to support this particular','None','00:33:43.388','00:33:48.860','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',92.12,100.00),(5785,9,'that Democrats will give that a fair look as well.','None','00:34:02.106','00:34:04.108','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',96.80,100.00),(5786,9,'The Press: Will the President have any new message or announcement when he goes to Oregon on Friday?','None','00:34:04.108','00:34:11.115','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',39.93,100.00),(5787,9,'Byron.','None','00:34:12.617','00:34:13.985','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',40.52,100.00),(5788,9,'The Press: Thanks, Josh.','None','00:34:13.985','00:34:15.052','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',90.90,100.00),(5789,9,'FHFA is reviewing and possibly -- reviewing a possible boost to the pay of the CEOs of Fannie Mae','None','00:34:15.052','00:34:23.094','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',60.31,100.0