ill translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',35.82,100.00),(5893,9,'How closely is the President paying attention?','None','00:43:28.439','00:43:31.542','FEAR','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',40.18,100.00),(5894,9,'In fact, it could mean a total change in leadership.','None','00:43:31.542','00:43:34.578','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',49.08,100.00),(5895,9,'Mr. Earnest: The President is obviously following the elections that are taking place in a country with whom','None','00:43:34.578','00:43:40.150','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',72.86,100.00),(5896,9,'we have such a special relationship.','None','00:43:40.150','00:43:42.152','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',92.09,100.00),(5897,9,'But I don\'t know that I have a whole lot to say about','None','00:43:44.288','00:43:46.290','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',52.33,100.00),(5898,9,'the current status of those elections, again, because I\'m unwilling to speak about this election','None','00:43:46.290','00:43:52.096','FEAR','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',94.16,100.00),(5899,9,'in a way that might leave anybody with the impression that we\'re supporting one side or another.','None','00:43:52.096','00:43:57.768','LOVE','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',61.60,100.00),(5900,9,'Tommy.','None','00:43:57.768','00:43:59.069','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',37.57,100.00),(5901,9,'The Press: Thanks, Josh.','None','00:43:59.069','00:43:59.770','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',90.90,100.00),(5902,9,'I have two topics.','None','00:43:59.770','00:44:00.771','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',40.14,100.00),(5903,9,'First of all, on this string of recent incidents of police violence against unarmed citizens that the','None','00:44:00.771','00:44:06.143','FEAR','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',47.20,100.00),(5904,9,'President noted are showing up on video just about every week.','None','00:44:06.143','00:44:09.613','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',70.06,100.00),(5905,9,'Something I\'ve heard him say and then I\'ve heard you say on a number of occasions with these incidents','None','00:44:09.613','00:44:15.019','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',59.78,100.00),(5906,9,'is that in the context of those incidents, the overwhelming majority of police officers act','None','00:44:15.019','00:44:22.493','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',61.58,100.00),(5907,9,'And I\'m wondering, when we look at the Freddie Gray incident and Walter Scott and in incident after','None','00:44:24.728','00:44:30.934','FEAR','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',62.20,100.00),(5908,9,'We haven\'t seen a single incident where a police officer, other than the ones participating','None','00:44:35.706','00:44:41.945','FEAR','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',54.16,100.00),(5909,9,'in the event, have acted properly and intervened on behalf of the citizen.','None','00:44:41.945','00:44:44.948','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',52.99,100.00),(5910,9,'So I\'m wondering, on what basis do you and the President make that statement in that context?','None','00:44:44.948','00:44:49.653','FEAR','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',58.88,100.00),(5911,9,'When they\'re put to this test, when police officers are committing violence against','None','00:44:51.989','00:44:57.895','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',90.98,100.00),(5912,9,'an unarmed citizen, why would anybody think that the overwhelming majority of them are good when we\'ve','None','00:44:57.895','00:45:04.535','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',59.73,100.00),(5913,9,'seen evidence that not a single one of them has been?','None','00:45:04.535','00:45:07.604','FEAR','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',45.68,100.00),(5914,9,'Mr. Earnest: Tommy, I think we do that based on the experience that the vast majority of Americans has','None','00:45:07.604','00:45:13.277','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',97.05,100.00),(5915,9,'when they\'re dealing with local law enforcement -- that they find these individuals to be','None','00:45:13.277','00:45:17.281','FEAR','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',57.67,100.00),(5916,9,'the communities that they\'re sworn to serve and protect.','None','00:45:22.386','00:45:24.354','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',45.02,100.00),(5917,9,'And, again, I think that\'s the experience of many','None','00:45:24.354','00:45:30.994','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',73.56,100.00),(5918,9,'Americans when they come into contact with law enforcement professionals.','None','00:45:30.994','00:45:35.466','FEAR','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',55.20,100.00),(5919,9,'And, again, I think the fact that these particular -- the President alluded to this a little bit in his','None','00:45:35.466','00:45:41.071','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',73.16,100.00),(5920,9,'is because they are a departure from the','None','00:45:47.744','00:45:53.984','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',71.37,100.00),(5921,9,'experience that most Americans have when they\'re dealing with law enforcement.','None','00:45:53.984','00:45:57.988','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',40.30,100.00),(5922,9,'And they are a departure from the kind of professionalism that the vast majority','None','00:45:57.988','00:46:02.993','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',88.76,100.00),(5923,9,'of law enforcement officers show when they\'re doing their job.','None','00:46:02.993','00:46:05.963','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',45.46,100.00),(5924,9,'The Press: It doesn\'t seem like -- if we\'re having one of these every week, that if the vast majority of officers','None','00:46:05.963','00:46:10.134','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',56.59,100.00),(5925,9,'on that guy, give this guy some medical help?','None','00:46:21.812','00:46:23.814','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',50.27,100.00),(5926,9,'Why haven\'t we seen that happen even one time?','None','00:46:23.814','00:46:25.816','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',60.98,100.00),(5927,9,'the investigation and prosecution of these incidents?','None','00:46:36.894','00:46:40.130','FEAR','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',50.52,100.00),(5928,9,'Or requiring body cameras?','None','00:46:40.130','00:46:42.132','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',44.07,100.00),(5929,9,'Or data collection for profiling and use of force?','None','00:46:42.132','00:46:47.504','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',49.59,100.00),(5930,9,'Why aren\'t we pushing for that?','None','00:46:47.504','00:46:48.505','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',93.12,100.00),(5931,9,'Mr. Earnest: Well, Tommy, that\'s more than two questions; that was a long list of questions.','None','00:46:48.505','00:46:52.609','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',88.85,100.00),(5932,9,'incidents that either were or are under investigation by federal authorities at the Department of Justice.','None','00:46:58.749','00:47:04.621','FEAR','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',79.36,100.00),(5933,9,'And I think that is an indication that the Obama administration and our career prosecutors at the','None','00:47:04.621','00:47:09.927','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',71.56,100.00),(5934,9,'And the other thing that occurs to me is that are tens of thousands, if not hundreds of thousands,','None','00:47:14.131','00:47:19.503','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',38.86,100.00),(5935,9,'of hours of video footage collected every single day by dashboard cams, by body cams,','None','00:47:19.503','00:47:26.243','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',33.15,100.00),(5936,9,'by security cameras that monitor or at least are capturing the work of our law enforcement officers.','None','00:47:26.243','00:47:36.253','FEAR','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',43.02,100.00),(5937,9,'And I think that is an indication that the snippets that we do see are serious and are cause','None','00:47:36.253','00:47:44.494','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',47.03,100.00),(5938,9,'for significant concern but do not reflect the actions and professionalism of the vast majority of law enforcement','None','00:47:44.494','00:47:53.103','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',91.40,100.00),(5939,9,'officers who pursue their work in a professional way that\'s consistent with a commitment to justice and','None','00:47:53.103','00:47:59.343','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',97.97,100.00),(5940,9,'equality.','None','00:47:59.343','00:48:01.044','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',79.19,100.00),(5941,9,'But as long as we have even these isolated incidents, it\'s important for us to acknowledge that those','None','00:48:01.044','00:48:08.151','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',66.17,100.00),(5942,9,'to broader concerns in the community about the fairness','None','00:48:13.156','00:48:18.462','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',7