inal vote.','None','00:49:09.746','00:49:12.049','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',37.32,100.00),(5952,9,'If the President -- will the President be listening -- if the public wises up and says this is a terrible deal','None','00:49:12.049','00:49:16.219','SADNESS','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',82.86,100.00),(5953,9,'and we don\'t want it, would the President be listening and be willing to veto a TPP deal that passed with','None','00:49:16.219','00:49:24.528','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',92.49,100.00),(5954,9,'a simple majority?','None','00:49:24.528','00:49:26.430','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',43.31,100.00),(5955,9,'Mr. Earnest: Here\'s the thing, Tommy, that I think that the vast majority of Americans can','None','00:49:26.430','00:49:29.700','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',97.28,100.00),(5956,9,'be confident about -- that the most important thing standing between the American people and a bad','None','00:49:29.700','00:49:35.572','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',98.34,100.00),(5957,9,'TPP deal is a President of the United States that for the last six and a half years has scratched and','None','00:49:35.572','00:49:41.578','FEAR','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',62.95,100.00),(5958,9,'And they can be confident that as he weighs an agreement, if one is reached,','None','00:49:44.514','00:49:50.620','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',98.36,100.00),(5959,9,'that he will have the interests of middle-class families first in his mind.','None','00:49:50.620','00:49:53.924','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',79.56,100.00),(5960,9,'And there is no reason that anybody who has concerns','None','00:49:53.924','00:49:59.129','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',58.78,100.00),(5961,9,'about the conduct of Republicans in Congress -- and according to the latest polls,','None','00:49:59.129','00:50:05.335','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',47.47,100.00),(5962,9,'the vast of majority of Americans do -- those Americans can take solace and they should','None','00:50:05.335','00:50:10.440','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',94.88,100.00),(5963,9,'actually feel confident that any agreement that\'s reached will be one that the President believes','None','00:50:10.440','00:50:16.079','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',98.75,100.00),(5964,9,'is clearly in the best interest of the American economy, of American businesses and, most importantly,','None','00:50:16.079','00:50:20.317','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',90.31,100.00),(5965,9,'American middle-class families.','None','00:50:20.317','00:50:21.485','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',39.29,100.00),(5966,9,'The Press: But will he be listening, will he be open to the idea at that point?','None','00:50:21.485','00:50:24.888','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',67.95,100.00),(5967,9,'and I just want to make sure that President is going to be listening and open to the idea.','None','00:50:29.526','00:50:34.364','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',97.64,100.00),(5968,9,'Mr. Earnest: Well, look, the President is always going to be open to the comments of the American people and','None','00:50:34.364','00:50:39.936','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',97.13,100.00),(5969,9,'is attentive to their reaction to decisions that he\'s making.','None','00:50:39.936','00:50:44.574','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',89.24,100.00),(5970,9,'But the goal of this process that this administration has','None','00:50:44.574','00:50:49.613','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',41.75,100.00),(5971,9,'devoted years to trying to negotiate is to level the playing field in some of the most dynamic economic','None','00:50:49.613','00:50:55.185','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',87.37,100.00),(5972,9,'markets in the world, and that by leveling the playing field for Americans businesses we can create','None','00:50:55.185','00:50:59.956','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',94.64,100.00),(5973,9,'an opportunity for our entrepreneurs, our innovators, our small and large business-owners','None','00:50:59.956','00:51:05.462','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',92.35,100.00),(5974,9,'and our workers to compete and win.','None','00:51:05.462','00:51:07.831','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',77.35,100.00),(5975,9,'And that\'s going to expand opportunity for American businesses and for American middle-class families,','None','00:51:07.831','00:51:13.870','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',91.66,100.00),(5976,9,'and that\'s what we\'re focused on.','None','00:51:13.870','00:51:15.605','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',70.67,100.00),(5977,9,'Again, if the agreement doesn\'t meet that test, then the President won\'t sign it.','None','00:51:15.605','00:51:20.744','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',44.06,100.00),(5978,9,'Kevin.','None','00:51:21.278','00:51:22.112','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',42.04,100.00),(5979,9,'The Press: Thanks, Josh.','None','00:51:22.112','00:51:22.846','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',90.90,100.00),(5980,9,'I want to ask you about General Dunford.','None','00:51:22.846','00:51:24.848','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',47.17,100.00),(5981,9,'The President went to great lengths to salute General Dempsey, and describing the closeness of their','None','00:51:24.848','00:51:32.889','LOVE','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',37.94,100.00),(5982,9,'relationship and the success of that relationship.','None','00:51:32.889','00:51:35.926','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',84.76,100.00),(5983,9,'What is his expectation of General Dunford, if confirmed?','None','00:51:35.926','00:51:40.497','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',45.81,100.00),(5984,9,'And how might that expectation differ -- or even from a policy perspective differ from','None','00:51:40.497','00:51:45.335','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',43.26,100.00),(5985,9,'General Dempsey?','None','00:51:45.335','00:51:46.336','FEAR','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',41.00,100.00),(5986,9,'Mr. Earnest: Well, the President has been deeply appreciative of the service that he has received and the','None','00:51:46.336','00:51:51.408','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',98.31,100.00),(5987,9,'American people have received from both General Dempsey and from Admiral Winnefeld.','None','00:51:51.408','00:51:55.545','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',67.62,100.00),(5988,9,'Those are the current Chairman and Vice Chairman of the Joint Chiefs of Staff.','None','00:51:55.545','00:52:00.250','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',54.71,100.00),(5989,9,'The President has developed a very strong and useful working relationship with both men who represent the','None','00:52:00.250','00:52:07.224','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',98.76,100.00),(5990,9,'interests of the United States military and every single servicemember.','None','00:52:07.224','00:52:11.127','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',55.96,100.00),(5991,9,'And the President, again, as he had the opportunity to convey in the Rose Garden today,','None','00:52:11.127','00:52:16.733','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',79.12,100.00),(5992,9,'is deeply appreciative of their service to the country, not just over the last four years that they\'ve','None','00:52:16.733','00:52:20.704','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',97.45,100.00),(5993,9,'served in these positions, but throughout their careers in serving the military.','None','00:52:20.704','00:52:25.942','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',36.24,100.00),(5994,9,'And I would anticipate that the President plans to establish a similarly solid working relationship with','None','00:52:25.942','00:52:32.616','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',98.72,100.00),(5995,9,'both General Dunford and General Selva; that these are two who have long,','None','00:52:32.616','00:52:40.524','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',34.25,100.00),(5996,9,'highly decorated careers in the United States military, in the United States Marine Corps and the United States','None','00:52:40.524','00:52:44.661','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',94.85,100.00),(5997,9,'And the President has complete confidence that these are the right men to assume the important','None','00:52:46.496','00:52:52.202','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',98.49,100.00),(5998,9,'responsibility at the Joint Chiefs of Staff.','None','00:52:52.202','00:52:54.437','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',37.14,100.00),(5999,9,'Is that the expectation?','None','00:52:55.639','00:52:56.873','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',35.14,100.00),(6000,9,'Or would he expect them to do something different from their predecessors?','None','00:52:56.873','00:53:00.410','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',52.09,100.00),(6001,9,'Mr. Earnest: Well, again, I think it\'s going to depend on -- what he expects that they\'ll do the same as their','None','00:53:00.410','00:53:05.415','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',97.30,100.00),(6002,9,'predecessors is to offer him the unvarnished, direct advice that he needs from his military','None','00:53:05.415','00:53:12.455','SADNESS','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',46.90,100.00),(6003,9,'leadership.','None','00:53:12.455','00:53:13.456','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',90.09,100.00),(6004,9,'And that\'s, in fact, the reason that the President has chosen both General Dunford and General Selva.','None','00:53:13.456','00:53:20.163','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',67.98,100.00),(6005,9,'But in terms of any sort of policy announcements or policy changes that they\'re contemplating,','None','00:53:20.163','00:53:24.267','FEAR','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',47.18,100.00),(6006,9,'I\'m not sure that they\'d have a whole lot to say about that in advance of their congressional','None','00:53:24.267','00:53:28.271','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',83.41,100.00),(6007,9,'testimony.','None','00:53:28.271','00:53:29.272','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',37.90,100.00),(6008,9,'But the American people will get to hear from them about whether they\'re contemplating anything','None','00:53:29.272','00:53:33.276','FEAR','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',58.13,100.00),(6009,9,'like that when they testify before Congress.','None','00:53:33.276','00:53:35.278','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',58.05,100.00),(6010,9,'The Press: What\'s happening in Somalia that makes the White House feel like now is the time to engage?','None','00:53:35.278','00:53:39.449','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',95.29,100.00),(6011,9,'has made the first visit by a United States Secretary of State to the nation of Somalia.','None','00:53:44.421','00:53:49.259','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',50.96,100.00),(6012,9,'He went there to try to nurture the kinds of democratic reforms that we believe are critical','None','00:53:49.259','00:53:54.864','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',94.78,100.00),(6013,9,'to stabilizing the security situation in Somalia.','None','00:53:54.864','00:53:58.735','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',55.94,100.00),(6014,9,'Because of the hard work of African Union forces,','None','00:53:58.735','00:54:04.841','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',46.23,100.00),(6015,9,'we\'ve seen a lot of progress in the last several months against al-Shabaab forces that had previously taken','None','00:54:04.841','00:54:13.016','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',56.16,100.00),(6016,9,'over significant amounts of territory in that country.','None','00:54:13.016','00:54:16.152','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',48.76,100.00),(6017,9,'I think the latest estimate I heard was that 80 to 85 percent of that territory had been rolled back,','None','00:54:16.152','00:54:21.024','FEAR','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',43.29,100.00),(6018,9,'and that\'s an indication that this regional effort to combat the forces of extremism are,','None','00:54:21.024','00:54:27.297','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',56.17,100.00),(6019,9,'And in order to capitalize on those security gains, we believe, as we have in other countries,','None','00:54:31.401','00:54:37.474','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',91.91,100.00),(6020,9,'that a stable, unified, inclusive,','None','00:54:37.474','00:54:42.545','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',98.68,100.00),(6021,9,'democratic governing system will be required.','None','00:54:42.545','00:54:46.149','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',86.33,100.00),(6022,9,'And we want to encourage the efforts of the President, the Prime Minister and others,','None','00:54:46.149','00:54:50.320','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',85.00,100.00),(6023,9,'including those who are serving in parliament, to do that.','None','00:54:50.320','00:54:53.923','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',49.60,100.00),(6024,9,'And that\'s why the Secretary of State met with them today.','None','00:54:53.923','00:54:55.992','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',62.20,100.00),(6025,9,'The Press: Two others.','None','00:54:55.992','00:54:56.860','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',45.69,100.00),(6026,9,'I want to ask you about trade.','None','00:54:56.860','00:54:58.161','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',39.50,100.00),(6027,9,'Congressman Doggett of Texas, who has obviously come out very forcefully against','None','00:54:58.161','00:55:03.400','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',96.41,100.00),(6028,9,'fast-track, is concerned about secrecy.','None','00:55:03.400','00:55:05.502','FEAR','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',76.75,100.00),(6029,9,'We\'ve been hearing that a lot over the last several days -- secrecy is a problem;','None','00:55:05.502','00:55:09.973','FEAR','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',48.05,100.00),(6030,9,'the sheer volume of information on this; there\'s no enough clarity and transparency.','None','00:55:09.973','00:55:15.979','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',86.42,100.00),(6031,9,'Does the White House understand the concerns of many in Congress about that?','None','00:55:15.979','00:55:19.582','FEAR','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',50.43,100.00),(6032,9,'The fact is, any member of Congress that\'s interested in knowing exactly what\'s in the agreement doesn\'t even','None','00:55:21.351','00:55:25.422','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',54.70,100.00),(6033,9,'as it stands now.','None','00:55:31.494','00:55:33.163','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',39.91,100.00),(6034,9,'The fact is, a final agreement, however, has not been reached.','None','00:55:33.163','00:55:36.800','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',47.08,100.00),(6035,9,'And once an agreement has been reached, the American public will have 60 days to review that','None','00:55:36.800','00:55:42.872','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',76.28,100.00),(6036,9,'agreement even prior to the President signing it.','None','00:55:42.872','00:55:45.675','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',33.64,100.00),(6037,9,'And after the President signs it, Congress will then have the opportunity to continue','None','00:55:45.675','00:55:52.248','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',93.31,100.00),(6038,9,'to evaluate it.','None','00:55:52.248','00:55:53.516','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',42.28,100.00),(6039,9,'Members of Congress have also received extensive briefings from senior administration officials','None','00:55:53.516','00:55:59.789','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',62.87,100.00),(6040,9,'who are directly involved in negotiating the agreement.','None','00:55:59.789','00:56:02.692','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',36.10,100.00),(6041,9,'So the fact of the matter is, there\'s no excuse for a member of Congress who wants','None','00:56:02.692','00:56:05.895','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',85.81,100.00),(6042,9,'to know what\'s in the trade agreement for not knowing what\'s in the trade agreement.','None','00:56:05.895','00:56:08.898','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',67.11,100.00),(6043,9,'And so I guess -- reflecting his commitment to transparency, I hope Congressman Doggett will','None','00:56:08.898','00:56:13.536','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',97.74,100.00),(6044,9,'be willing to say whether or not he\'s actually read it.','None','00:56:13.536','00:56:15.538','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',98.07,100.00),(6045,9,'The Press: Including those documents that are marked confidential, still restricted to members','None','00:56:15.538','00:56:19.843','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',43.86,100.00),(6046,9,'of Congress?','None','00:56:19.843','00:56:21.277','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',49.32,100.00),(6047,9,'Mr. Earnest: Yes, that means members of Congress can read them.','None','00:56:21.277','00:56:23.379','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',97.63,100.00),(6048,9,'That\'s the point.','None','00:56:23.379','00:56:24.814','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',50.54,100.00),(6049,9,'That\'s why it\'s ridiculous for somebody to suggest that anybody is keeping a secret.','None','00:56:24.814','00:56:28.551','FEAR','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',53.30,100.00),(6050,9,'The Press: Last thing I want to ask you about -- the ongoing process that the State Department','None','00:56:28.551','00:56:33.656','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',42.32,100.00),(6051,9,'has vis-à-vis Keystone.','None','00:56:33.656','00:56:35.592','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',78.90,100.00),(6052,9,'Any timing on that?','None','00:56:35.592','00:56:38.361','FEAR','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',41.76,100.00),(6053,9,'Mr. Earne