dy.','None','01:01:08.898','01:01:11.534','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',39.12,100.00),(6106,9,'As it relates to trying to meet the needs of people in','None','01:01:11.534','01:01:16.439','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',47.78,100.00),(6107,9,'some of these economically disadvantaged communities that are often the site of these conflicts with local','None','01:01:16.439','01:01:23.112','SADNESS','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',70.16,100.00),(6108,9,'police, there are a number of things that the President has proposed that have been steadfastly blocked by','None','01:01:23.112','01:01:27.817','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',55.91,100.00),(6109,9,'Republicans.','None','01:01:27.817','01:01:28.985','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',54.46,100.00),(6110,9,'These are policy proposals that we know would benefit people in these communities and would improve the','None','01:01:28.985','01:01:34.791','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',97.28,100.00),(6111,9,'economic situation in these communities, both in the short term, but over the long term.','None','01:01:34.791','01:01:38.795','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',71.46,100.00),(6112,9,'These are things like the President\'s proposal to guarantee high-quality early childhood education for','None','01:01:38.795','01:01:44.400','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',96.32,100.00),(6113,9,'every child in America.','None','01:01:44.400','01:01:46.235','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',55.49,100.00),(6114,9,'The President has put forward a Republican-backed proposal to offer free community college to every','None','01:01:46.235','01:01:51.074','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',89.62,100.00),(6115,9,'The President has even put forward a specific plan to raise the minimum wage.','None','01:01:54.110','01:01:58.081','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',61.66,100.00),(6116,9,'We know that right now there are a lot of families who','None','01:01:58.081','01:02:01.084','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',45.36,100.00),(6117,9,'are headed by individuals who are working a full-time job; they\'re working 40 hours a week.','None','01:02:01.084','01:02:05.421','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',61.90,100.00),(6118,9,'below the poverty line.','None','01:02:09.425','01:02:10.426','SADNESS','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',64.26,100.00),(6119,9,'That\'s not fair.','None','01:02:10.426','01:02:11.427','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',93.86,100.00),(6120,9,'And it certainly isn\'t consistent with our goal of trying to ensure that hard work can lead','None','01:02:11.427','01:02:16.732','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',98.35,100.00),(6121,9,'to a decent living in this country.','None','01:02:16.732','01:02:18.901','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',95.52,100.00),(6122,9,'And that\'s why the President has strongly advocated for raising the minimum wage.','None','01:02:18.901','01:02:22.772','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',46.04,100.00),(6123,9,'There are a whole set of tax cuts that would benefit working families in this country that the President','None','01:02:22.772','01:02:27.143','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',88.11,100.00),(6124,9,'These are things like an expanded childcare tax credit, expansion of the earned income tax credit,','None','01:02:29.145','01:02:34.350','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',94.14,100.00),(6125,9,'or even a tax credit for families where both mom and dad are working.','None','01:02:34.350','01:02:37.687','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',59.99,100.00),(6126,9,'where both mom and dad are working.','None','01:02:43.025','01:02:45.661','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',38.74,100.00),(6127,9,'And the fact is, the response that we\'ve seen Republicans is to prioritize slashing unemployment','None','01:02:45.661','01:02:50.366','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',40.86,100.00),(6128,9,'benefits and slashing food stamps.','None','01:02:50.366','01:02:52.368','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',72.63,100.00),(6129,9,'I\'m not really sure how you can make the case that that\'s going to make the plight of those families','None','01:02:52.368','01:02:56.973','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',43.44,100.00),(6130,9,'who are living below the poverty line.','None','01:02:56.973','01:02:59.609','SADNESS','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',80.79,100.00),(6131,9,'I think that\'s going to have the opposite of that effect.','None','01:02:59.609','01:03:01.878','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',53.30,100.00),(6132,9,'So we\'re going to continue to have this debate.','None','01:03:01.878','01:03:04.180','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',76.51,100.00),(6133,9,'And I think this is indicative of what the President was saying in the Rose Garden one week ago','None','01:03:04.180','01:03:08.918','FEAR','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',41.53,100.00),(6134,9,'today, I believe -- where the President said he was -- that he acknowledged that the Republican majorities','None','01:03:08.918','01:03:18.561','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',90.80,100.00),(6135,9,'in Congress were going to block a lot of the efforts that','None','01:03:18.561','01:03:21.831','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',91.79,100.00),(6136,9,'he knows would benefit many of these communities.','None','01:03:21.831','01:03:28.571','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',98.27,100.00),(6137,9,'But the President is determined the use the authority of his office and to work together with','None','01:03:28.571','01:03:33.676','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',95.27,100.00),(6138,9,'So we are optimistic that we can do something like move bipartisan criminal justice reform through the Congress','None','01:03:36.612','01:03:42.919','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',98.60,100.00),(6139,9,'prison for a non-violent drug offense.','None','01:03:51.394','01:03:54.530','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',95.84,100.00),(6140,9,'The other thing that\'s moving through the United States Senate right now is a compromise education','None','01:03:54.530','01:03:58.534','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',29.74,100.00),(6141,9,'reform proposal that would strengthen local public schools and communities across the country.','None','01:03:58.534','01:04:03.105','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',49.77,100.00),(6142,9,'That certainly would be a good thing and could be an opportunity for the President and Democrats','None','01:04:03.105','01:04:07.076','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',96.46,100.00),(6143,9,'to work together with Republicans to advance a policy agenda that would benefit low-income families.','None','01:04:07.076','01:04:13.316','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',81.68,100.00),(6144,9,'But the other thing that we\'ve seen -- and I\'ll end with this -- the other thing that we\'ve seen','None','01:04:13.316','01:04:17.286','FEAR','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',40.33,100.00),(6145,9,'is substantial progress that\'s being made outside of the federal government, often at the behest of the President.','None','01:04:17.286','01:04:23.893','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',73.73,100.00),(6146,9,'So we have seen a number of states -- including states that are led by Republicans -- make serious commitments','None','01:04:23.893','01:04:30.766','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',64.37,100.00),(6147,9,'to high-quality early childhood education across their state.','None','01:04:30.766','01:04:34.670','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',96.19,100.00),(6148,9,'We\'ve seen 17 states in the District of Columbia vote in the last year and a half or so -- or pass legislation','None','01:04:34.670','01:04:40.476','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',56.33,100.00),(6149,9,'in the last year and a half to increase the minimum wage.','None','01:04:40.476','01:04:43.246','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',45.34,100.00),(6150,9,'That\'s having an impact on working families in those states.','None','01:04:43.246','01:04:47.450','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',80.49,100.00),(6151,9,'that will make it easier for working families, and those families who are trying to','None','01:04:53.823','01:04:57.660','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',62.01,100.00),(6152,9,'get into the middle class, balance the obligations at work that they have with the obligations that they have','None','01:04:57.660','01:05:02.098','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',55.85,100.00),(6153,9,'at home.','None','01:05:02.098','01:05:03.132','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',46.41,100.00),(6154,9,'And finally, all of you heard the President talk pretty powerfully about the opportunity that exists','None','01:05:03.132','01:05:07.570','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',96.02,100.00),(6155,9,'inside his My Brother\'s Keeper initiative -- that there\'s an opportunity for us to meet the special needs','None','01:05:07.570','01:05:15.044','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',97.46,100.00),(6156,9,'of young men of color in this country; and that by focusing on some of their unique challenges,','None','01:05:15.044','01:05:23.819','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',94.47,100.00),(6157,9,'that we can have a pretty important impact in those individual communities, but also a really important','None','01:05:23.819','01:05:29.325','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',98.41,100.00),(6158,9,'impact on our broader economy to make sure that we have a workforce that\'s prepared to compete and win','None','01:05:29.325','01:05:35.431','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',98.47,100.00),(6159,9,'in a 21st century global economy, but also to ensure that we have a country and','None','01:05:35.431','01:05:41.203','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',96.79,100.00),(6160,9,'communities across this country that we live in that are consistent with the kinds of values that we have','None','01:05:41.203','01:05:46.776','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',97.53,100.00),(6161,9,'in terms of ensuring that everybody has an opportunity, that everybody has a fair shot,','None','01:05:46.776','01:05:51.414','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',97.45,100.00),(6162,9,'and that everybody is getting a fair shake.','None','01:05:51.414','01:05:53.783','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',98.27,100.00),(6163,9,'And certainly, the My Brother\'s Keeper initiative would make substantial progress in pursuit of that','None','01:05:53.783','01:05:59.555','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',97.13,100.00),(6164,9,'goal.','None','01:05:59.555','01:06:00.556','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',37.55,100.00),(6165,9,'And the good news is it wouldn\'t require any congressional action.','None','01:06:00.556','01:06:03.559','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',92.13,100.00),(6166,9,'We\'ll see you all tomorrow.','None','01:06:06.162','01:06:07.630','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:11','2026-09-17 19:52:11',89.67,100.00),(6167,10,'public servants who were there to keep the peace.','public','00:00:59.526','00:01:02.796','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','HARD_WORD','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',75.20,77.55),(6168,10,'pronouncement about anything like that we certainly would want to make sure that we knew a whole lot','pronouncement','00:01:14.307','00:01:18.845','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','HARD_WORD','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',95.93,98.51),(6169,10,'the Middle East to -- that at least is an indication','middle east','00:01:46.172','00:01:52.078','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','HARD_WORD','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',56.64,73.15),(6170,10,'But it\'s one that we continue to be exceedingly vigilant about.','exceeding','00:02:35.955','00:02:38.958','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','HARD_WORD','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',93.42,83.12),(6171,10,'Prophet Muhammad in cartoons or any other types of drawings?','prophet muhammad','00:02:46.032','00:02:49.869','FEAR','Will translate during reel generation...','HARD_WORD','2026-09-17 19:52:22','20