s','earnest','00:13:40.853','00:13:47.092','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','HARD_WORD','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',88.01,70.98),(6205,10,'steps that are necessary to deescalate tensions and stabilize the security situation in the Gulf.','deesca','00:14:19.191','00:14:26.565','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','HARD_WORD','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',70.70,96.08),(6206,10,'Is it your assessment that they\'re not going to use that money to expand their destabilizing operations','destabil','00:14:46.485','00:14:52.057','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','HARD_WORD','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',62.59,70.49),(6207,10,'Or are you acknowledging that, in fact, they\'re going to turn around and use that sanctions','acknowledging','00:14:55.094','00:14:59.098','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','HARD_WORD','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',86.79,95.51),(6208,10,'pressure inside of Iran for the Iranian leadership','inside','00:15:36.969','00:15:42.174','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','HARD_WORD','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',77.73,80.34),(6209,10,'two things I\'d point out.','point out','00:15:58.691','00:15:59.692','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','IDIOM','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',86.72,95.27),(6210,10,'The first is, even while these sanctions have been in place, we\'ve not seen Iran significant scale back','significant scale back','00:15:59.692','00:16:06.398','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','HARD_WORD','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',83.44,84.70),(6211,10,'international community to relax these sanctions so that they can invest additional resources in those activities.','international community','00:16:23.449','00:16:29.355','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','HARD_WORD','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',93.73,96.87),(6212,10,'persistent, and persistently negative, economic conditions in their country.','persistent','00:16:34.827','00:16:39.565','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','HARD_WORD','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',96.83,72.54),(6213,10,'But I do think that a common-sense look at what kind of pressure they\'re reacting to indicates that','common','00:16:52.378','00:16:57.316','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','HARD_WORD','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',42.46,90.81),(6214,10,'Mr. Earnest: And, again, Olivier, the reason that they are pursuing this policy','olivier','00:17:18.303','00:17:22.307','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','HARD_WORD','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',95.42,74.27),(6215,10,'United States Congress, we\'ve seen a dramatic reversal in that dynamic.','united states congress','00:17:51.637','00:17:54.640','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','HARD_WORD','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',85.30,99.90),(6216,10,'and there now is significant disagreement inside of Iran because a large portion of the population is frustrated','inside','00:17:58.677','00:18:06.919','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','HARD_WORD','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',97.84,81.36),(6217,10,'in some cases, even scale back their nuclear program in a way that would prevent them from obtaining','scale back','00:18:35.848','00:18:39.952','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','HARD_WORD','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',46.60,96.45),(6218,10,'And so given additional economic resources, I think that a common-sense analysis would be that they','common','00:18:43.922','00:18:51.530','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','HARD_WORD','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',95.38,75.05),(6219,10,'of the gunmen had some contact with people within ISIS -- or even if he didn\'t -- are you treating this','treating','00:19:47.986','00:19:54.159','ANGER','