6','00:01:04.931','FEAR','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',64.51,100.00),(6340,10,'attack means that the Islamic State has now come to the U.S.?','None','00:01:04.931','00:01:08.868','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',45.25,100.00),(6341,10,'Mr. Earnest: Well, I think before we made a','None','00:01:08.868','00:01:14.307','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',95.72,100.00),(6342,10,'more about the facts.','None','00:01:18.845','00:01:19.846','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',37.43,100.00),(6343,10,'What we do know is we know that there are extremists around the globe, including some who are affiliated with','None','00:01:19.846','00:01:25.652','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',86.38,100.00),(6344,10,'ISIL, who are trying to capitalize on the opportunity that\'s presented by social media to try','None','00:01:25.652','00:01:30.890','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',56.71,100.00),(6345,10,'to communicate with individuals around the world, including inside the United States.','None','00:01:30.890','00:01:34.894','FEAR','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',35.58,100.00),(6346,10,'There have been a large number of -- not a large number, but there have been a number of individuals,','None','00:01:34.894','00:01:40.533','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',50.39,100.00),(6347,10,'Americans, who have been apprehended by law enforcement who were attempting to travel to','None','00:01:40.533','00:01:46.172','FEAR','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',90.65,100.00),(6348,10,'of their level of sympathy for ISIL or for extremist organizations around the world.','None','00:01:52.078','00:01:58.251','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',80.95,100.00),(6349,10,'And so we\'re very vigilant about the efforts that are underway by ISIL and other extremist organizations','None','00:01:58.251','00:02:05.425','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',80.81,100.00),(6350,10,'to try to radicalize some individuals in the United States.','None','00:02:05.425','00:02:09.863','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',95.63,100.00),(6351,10,'And we\'re working closely with community leaders, law enforcement officials, of course,','None','00:02:09.863','00:02:16.202','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',79.17,100.00),(6352,10,'to try to counter that threat and to mitigate that threat.','None','00:02:16.202','00:02:19.205','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',66.66,100.00),(6353,10,'And it\'s something that we continue to be vigilant about.','None','00:02:19.205','00:02:22.208','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',92.00,100.00),(6354,10,'You\'ll recall that a few months ago the President convened a summit on countering violent extremism','None','00:02:22.208','00:02:26.513','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',94.88,100.00),(6355,10,'to try to collate best practices that are used in communities across the country,','None','00:02:26.513','00:02:32.952','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',87.68,100.00),(6356,10,'and that can be used in other communities to repel this threat.','None','00:02:32.952','00:02:35.955','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',46.89,100.00),(6357,10,'The Press: Is it time for individuals or groups or even publications to stop depicting the','None','00:02:38.958','00:02:46.032','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',44.97,100.00),(6358,10,'Mr. Earnest: Well, that\'s obviously a judgment that we leave up to individual media organizations.','None','00:02:49.869','00:03:00.113','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',92.71,100.00),(6359,10,'however offensive, that justifies an act of terrorism or even an act of violence.','None','00:03:07.520','00:03:14.294','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',96.85,100.00),(6360,10,'And that apparently is what these two individuals in Texas were trying to do.','None','00:03:14.294','00:03:20.967','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',47.86,100.00),(6361,10,'They were responding to one form of expression that they found offensive, and tried to use that as','None','00:03:20.967','00:03:27.907','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',98.08,100.00),(6362,10,'justification to carry out an act of terror.','None','00:03:27.907','00:03:29.909','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',60.11,100.00),(6363,10,'And this is a firm principle that we\'re going to protect when it comes to the freedom of expression,','None','00:03:36.583','00:03:41.120','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',94.