00:04:17.724','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',72.44,100.00),(6373,10,'Obviously General Dunford has proudly served this country in a variety of roles but including in','None','00:04:19.926','00:04:25.498','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',90.48,100.00),(6374,10,'combat, and that combat experience is valuable to individuals who serve in military leadership','None','00:04:25.498','00:04:32.939','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',98.73,100.00),(6375,10,'positions as well.','None','00:04:32.939','00:04:34.707','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',36.03,100.00),(6376,10,'It\'s a testament that General Dunford is somebody who doesn\'t just talk the talk,','None','00:04:34.707','00:04:39.646','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',47.75,100.00),(6377,10,'but he is somebody who walks the walk.','None','00:04:39.646','00:04:41.881','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',68.98,100.00),(6378,10,'And the President is going to rely on General Dunford both for his broader strategic advice,','None','00:04:41.881','00:04:46.586','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',85.00,100.00),(6379,10,'but the President is pleased that that strategic advice will be informed by General Dunford\'s own personal','None','00:04:46.586','00:04:51.557','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',99.16,100.00),(6380,10,'experience in combat.','None','00:04:51.557','00:04:53.960','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',46.85,100.00),(6381,10,'Obviously the President and General Dunford have talked about the challenging situation in Afghanistan','None','00:04:53.960','00:04:58.631','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',29.36,100.00),(6382,10,'over the years.','None','00:04:58.631','00:04:59.632','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',38.28,100.00),(6383,10,'General Dunford has his own firsthand experience in leading our troops there.','None','00:04:59.632','00:05:04.570','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',78.30,100.00),(6384,10,'our military strategy.','None','00:05:10.710','00:05:11.711','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',50.52,100.00),(6385,10,'Obviously one of the significant challenges facing the next Chairman of the Joint Chiefs of Staff','None','00:05:17.984','00:05:24.390','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',63.02,100.00),(6386,10,'will be considering this military policy moving forward as we continue to draw down our military','None','00:05:24.390','00:05:30.029','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',62.34,100.00),(6387,10,'personnel from Afghanistan while at the same time we\'ve preserved the important security','None','00:05:30.029','00:05:34.567','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',97.93,100.00),(6388,10,'cooperation relationship with the Afghan government and the Afghan people.','None','00:05:34.567','00:05:40.840','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',84.18,100.00),(6389,10,'going to rely heavily on his advice as he makes decisions that are consistent with the national security interests','None','00:05:45.978','00:05:51.651','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',97.24,100.00),(6390,10,'of the United States.','None','00:05:51.651','00:05:53.086','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',48.06,100.00),(6391,10,'Jeff.','None','00:05:53.086','00:05:54.520','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',42.58,100.00),(6392,10,'The Press: Josh, Greece is getting closer and closer to a cash crunch, and there\'s no deal in sight yet with the IMF,','None','00:05:54.520','00:06:02.762','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',45.01,100.00),(6393,10,'with the ECB or the European Commission.','None','00:06:02.762','00:06:06.666','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',33.11,100.00),(6394,10,'Mr. Earnest: Well, Jeff, the Obama administration, for years now, has been involved in the effort','None','00:06:12.305','00:06:18.344','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',95.73,100.00),(6395,10,'to facilitate efforts by the major European economies','None','00:06:18.344','00:06:26.586','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',70.83,100.00),(6396,10,'And the President\'s Treasury Secretary, Jack Lew,','None','00:06:29.956','00:06:35.495','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',49.79,100.00),(6397,10,'and other officials at the Treasury Department continue to monitor this quite closely.','None','00:06:35.495','00:06:40.366','FEAR','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',47.29,100.00),(6398,10,'Secretary Lew is in regular touch with his counterparts in Europe and with leaders of some of these countries','None','00:06:40.366','00:06:45.571','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',91.02,100.00),(6399,10,'as they work through these disagreements.','None','00:06:45.571','00:06:51.444','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',83.28,100.00),(6400,10,'The thing that we continue to be pleased by is that individuals on all sides indicate that they believe,','None','00:06:51.444','00:06:58.785','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',99.05,100.00),(6401,10,'as the United States believes and as the President believes, that it is in the interest of the','None','00:06:58.785','00:07:03.289','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',76.24,100.00),(6402,10,'or the individual European countries, or Greece to try to resolve this in a way that doesn\'t','None','00:07:16.235','00:07:22.208','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',38.44,100.00),(6403,10,'add additional and unnecessary drama to the international economy.','None','00:07:22.208','00:07:26.379','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',68.93,100.00),(6404,10,'The Press: Are you confident that they\'ll get a deal in time?','None','00:07:26.379','00:07:28.347','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',97.90,100.00),(6405,10,'Obviously this is something that we continue to monitor closely, and we are encouraged by the efforts --','None','00:07:30.716','00:07:36.155','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',97.82,100.00),(6406,10,'the good-faith