,10,'have worsened.','None','00:08:25.071','00:08:27.073','SADNESS','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',57.96,100.00),(6415,10,'I know that the Attorney General is also planning to meet with the family of Freddie Gray.','None','00:08:29.375','00:08:33.379','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',44.12,100.00),(6416,10,'She\'s also going to spend some time meeting with those law enforcement officers that have been injured','None','00:08:33.379','00:08:39.752','SADNESS','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',67.17,100.00),(6417,10,'in the context of the violence that we\'ve seen there over the last week or so.','None','00:08:39.752','00:08:43.589','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',65.79,100.00),(6418,10,'So she\'s going to spend a lot of time on the ground,','None','00:08:43.589','00:08:45.591','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',55.41,100.00),(6419,10,'and that will be a valuable thing.','None','00:08:45.591','00:08:47.593','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',98.67,100.00),(6420,10,'strong support of law enforcement, given her track record as a career prosecutor with the','None','00:08:54.533','00:08:59.906','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',92.67,100.00),(6421,10,'white-collar criminals.','None','00:09:07.947','00:09:09.148','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',79.13,100.00),(6422,10,'And her evenhandedness and fairness and professionalism have served her well and inspires the confidence','None','00:09:09.148','00:09:15.321','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',98.04,100.00),(6423,10,'of law enforcement officers that she\'s worked closely with.','None','00:09:15.321','00:09:19.759','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',38.04,100.00),(6424,10,'also got the strong support of the Civil Rights community as well, and I think that means that she','None','00:09:24.463','00:09:29.235','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',95.23,100.00),(6425,10,'is well positioned to try to bring about the kind of healing that Baltimore is pretty desperately','None','00:09:29.235','00:09:35.341','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',98.02,100.00),(6426,10,'in need of right now.','None','00:09:35.341','00:09:36.342','SADNESS','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',40.35,100.00),(6427,10,'The Press: Did she and the President talk about her visit before she went?','None','00:09:36.342','00:09:39.645','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',52.39,100.00),(6428,10,'You\'ll recall that last week she did, on her first day on the job, come by the White House','None','00:09:41.047','00:09:46.152','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',40.67,100.00),(6429,10,'and talk to the President about a variety of issues, including the ongoing situation in Baltimore.','None','00:09:46.152','00:09:50.156','FEAR','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',41.25,100.00),(6430,10,'I don\'t know that they\'ve had the opportunity to talk about the situation since then.','None','00:09:50.156','00:09:53.159','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',32.62,100.00),(6431,10,'The Press: And lastly, any reaction to Mike Huckabee\'s announcement today as a presidential candidate?','None','00:09:53.159','00:09:57.897','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',45.65,100.00),(6432,10,'Justin.','None','00:09:58.998','00:10:02.668','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',43.69,100.00),(6433,10,'The Press: Senator Reid said yesterday that he\'d work to block movement on TPA until the Senate took care','None','00:10:02.668','00:10:11.310','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',79.45,100.00),(6434,10,'Senator Hatch expressed some disappointment with that, said he\'s been trying to work with the White House.','None','00:10:14.880','00:10:19.352','SADNESS','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',89.90,100.00),(6435,10,'So I\'m kind of wondering what your guys\' reaction to the Senator\'s comments were.','None','00:10:19.352','00:10:24.190','FEAR','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',54.61,100.00),(6436,10,'Mr. Earnest: My reaction is we\'re setting the bar awfully low if we think the Senate can only do one thing','None','00:10:24.190','00:10:27.693','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',46.89,100.00),(6437,10,'over the course of the next month.','None','00:10:27.693','00:10:29.762','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',33.99,100.00),(6438,10,'interest of the American people, particularly when we know they have strong','None','00:10:35.868','00:10:39.872','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',98.43,100.00),(6439,10,'bipartisan support.','None','00:10:39.872','00:10:40.873','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',90.77,100.00),(6440,10,'We know there\'s strong bipartisan support for some of the FISA reform proposals,','None','00:10:44.443','00:10:48.447','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',96.81,100.00),(6441,10,'So, surely we should be able to expect the United States Senate to do more than one thing over the course','None','00:10:51.584','00:10:58.090','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',92.09,100.00),(6442,10,'of this month.','None','00:10:58.090','00:10:59.091','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',48.32,100.00),(6443,10,'And I\'m gratified that we have seen a number of senators come forward and say that exact thing,','None','00:10:59.091','00:11:03.396','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',84.86,100.00),(6444,10,'that they welcome Senator Reid\'s interest in seeing some of these other priorities that he\'s','None','00:11:03.396','00:11:09.869','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',94.41,100.00),(6445,10,'The Press: Last week, on the USA Freedom Act, which would replace the Patriot Act,','None','00:11:15.207','00:11:20.346','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',52.21,100.00),(6446,10,'you said you\'re encouraged to see the bipartisan support, but you needed time to review','None','00:11:20.346','00:11:24.283','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',96.65,100.00),(6447,10,'the extra language.','None','00:11:24.283','00:11:25.885','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',44.00,100.00),(6448,10,'It\'s been a week now, so I\'m just wondering if you might','None','00:11:25.885','00:11:28.454','FEAR','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',66.59,100.00),(6449,10,'be able to firm that up any more on whether the White House supports the bill as is.','None','00:11:28.454','00:11:31.724','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',95.30,100.00),(6450,10,'Mr. Earnest: Well, we certainly are -- we continue to be supportive of the ongoing effort','None','00:11:31.724','00:11:35.461','LOVE','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',93.14,100.00),(6451,10,'in Congress to build bipartisan support and put in place the kinds of reforms that the President talked about','None','00:11:35.461','00:11:41.400','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',54.55,100.00),(6452,10,'in the speech that he gave a year and a half ago.','None','00:11:41.400','00:11:43.436','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',78.96,100.00),(6453,10,'officials have access to the information they need to keep us safe while also safeguarding the privacy','None','00:12:06.625','00:12:13.732','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',83.97,100.00),(6454,10,'of the American people.','None','00:12:13.732','00:12:15.267','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',55.76,100.00),(6455,10,'The Press: And the last thing -- the Labor Department said today that they\'ve turned over the recommendations','None','00:12:15.267','00:12:20.306','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',58.11,100.00),(6456,10,'on the overtime rules to OMB.','None','00:12:20.306','00:12:23.843','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',64.66,100.00),(6457,10,'This is something the President talked about, about a year ago.','None','00:12:23.843','00:12:26.479','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',67.11,100.00),(6458,10,'I\'m wondering, first, if you could tell us what the recommendation was in terms of the limit at which','None','00:12:26.479','00:12:32.651','FEAR','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',47.74,100.00),(6459,10,'kind of overtime rules would go into effect.','None','00:12:32.651','00:12:34.954','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',48.41,100.00),(6460,10,'And then OMB has got 90 days to review this.','None','00:12:34.954','00:12:37.323','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',56.29,100.00),(6461,10,'I\'m wondering if they can extend it if they want.','None','00:12:37.323','00:12:39.792','FEAR','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',73.72,100.00),(6462,10,'This has already kind of dragged on for a year, so I\'m wondering if that\'s sort of the time frame','None','00:12:39.792','00:12:43.629','FEAR','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',78.88,100.00),(6463,10,'in which the White House wants to see them come to a determination.','None','00:12:43.629','00:12:46.799','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',61.96,100.00),(6464,10,'of the specific recommendation or the time frame.','None','00:12:50.202','00:12:53.572','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',35.01,100.00),(6465,10,'But I can tell you that OMB has received the recommendation and is, consistent with the','None','00:12:53.572','00:12:59.945','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',97.48,100.00),(6466,10,'And once they\'re prepared to make an announcement, we\'ll be ready to talk about that recommendation','None','00:13:02.815','00:13:07.753','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',96.58,100.00),(6467,10,'in more detail.','None','00:13:07.753','00:13:08.787','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',45.57,100.00),(6468,10,'Mr. Earnest: I think what we have asked them is to follow','None','00:13:13.392','00:13:15.694','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',41.82,100.00),(6469,10,'standard procedure, and the standard procedure is for them to evaluate that recommendation before making','None','00:13:15.694','00:13:19.265','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',54.73,100.00),(6470,10,'Olivier.','None','00:13:23.936','00:13:25.237','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',32.33,100.00),(6471,10,'The Press: Josh, looking ahead to the President\'s summit with Gulf leaders, it\'s no secret that they\'re coming','None','00:13:25.237','00:13:30.276','FEAR','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',37.60,100.00),(6472,10,'At this point, is the President willing to expand American military assistance to those Gulf countries?','None','00:13:34.613','00:13:40.853','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',93.44,100.00),(6473,10,'of the discussions that the President is looking forward to next week.','None','00:13:47.092','00:13:50.796','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',94.46,100.00),(6474,10,'It obviously is an opportunity for the United States and the countries in the Gulf','None','00:13:50.796','00:13:55.167','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',80.65,100.00),(6475,10,'to discuss ways to enhance our partnership and deepen our security cooperation.','None','00:13:55.167','00:13:59.805','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',83.68,100.00),(6476,10,'It\'s also an opportunity to reaffirm the United States\' strong strategic partnership with the Gulf States.','None','00:13:59.805','00:14:06.011','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',98.23,100.00),(6477,10,'I\'m confident they\'ll discuss our shared concern about Iran\'s destabilizing activities in the region,','None','00:14:06.011','00:14:11.884','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',98.15,100.00),(6478,10,'and I think the fact that this summit is taking place demonstrates a mutual commitment to take the','None','00:14:11.884','00:14:19.191','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',96.39,100.00),(6479,10,'So this is an important meeting, but at this point, I would not prejudge the outcome.','None','00:14:26.565','00:14:34.039','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',92.05,100.00),(6480,10,'The Press: And I know you\'ve been asked this before, but I want another bite at it, which is,','None','00:14:34.039','00:14:37.409','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',78.53,100.00),(6481,10,'as sanctions are, I\'ll say, eased -- not lifted, but eased -- on Iran, they\'re going to get','None','00:14:37.409','00:14:43.716','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',87.78,100.00),(6482,10,'a flood of cash.','None','00:14:43.716','00:14:46.485','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',59.50,100.00),(6483,10,'in the region, that they\'re going to find some other use for it?','None','00:14:52.057','00:14:55.094','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',56.30,100.00),(6484,10,'relief to fund Hezbollah or other groups?','None','00:14:59.098','00:15:01.333','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',32.36,100.00),(6485,10,'Mr. Earnest: Well, Olivier, I think, most importantly, it\'s the hope of the Iranian people that that influx','None','00:15:01.333','00:15:06.839','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',98.45,100.00),(6486,10,'of resources will be devoted to meeting the needs of the population there and strengthening the economy','None','00:15:06.839','00:15:12.645','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',93.26,100.00),(6487,10,'that has taken a terrible toll on the daily lives','None','00:15:12.645','00:15:18.717','SADNESS','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',88.90,100.00),(6488,10,'of millions of Iranians.','None','00:15:18.717','00:15:21.220','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',54.67,100.00),(6489,10,'We\'ve talked before about how the significant pressure that our sanctions regime has placed on Iran has','None','00:15:21.220','00:15:29.962','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',74.74,100.00),(6490,10,'had a negative impact on their economy, and that poorly performing economy has added to some','None','00:15:29.962','00:15:36.969','SADNESS','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',81.52,100.00),(6491,10,'to consider a change in policy.','None','00:15:42.174','00:15:44.510','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',37.74,100.00),(6492,10,'And we\'re gratified by that because it\'s created an important diplomatic opportunity for us','None','00:15:44.510','00:15:50.616','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',97.53,100.00),(6493,10,'to prevent Iran from obtaining a nuclear weapon.','None','00:15:50.616','00:15:53.519','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',71.90,100.00),(6494,10,'But the fact is the -- I guess there are','None','00:15:53.519','00:15:58.691','FEAR','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',29.12,100.00),(6495,10,'their support for terrorism or their destabilizing activities in the region.','None','00:16:06.398','00:16:10.536','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',71.08,100.00),(6496,10,'And the second thing is that the pressure that they\'re feeling is not primarily rooted in the','None','00:16:10.536','00:16:18.944','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',89.72,100.00),(6497,10,'idea that they need to get rid of -- they need to throw off the sanctions, or at least get the','None','00:16:18.944','00:16:23.449','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',68.14,100.00),(6498,10,'Again, the pressure that they\'re reacting to is from the Iranian people who are frustrated at the','None','00:16:29.355','00:16:34.827','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',98.35,100.00),(6499,10,'So, again, I wouldn\'t be in a position to predict exactly what the Iranian reaction will be,','None','00:16:39.565','00:16:45.571','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',53.37,100.00),(6500,10,'and I\'m certainly not going to be in a position to mandate what kinds of economic decisions that','None','00:16:45.571','00:16:51.110','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',79.29,100.00),(6501,10,'they\'ll make.','None','00:16:51.110','00:16:52.378','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',70.33,100.00),(6502,10,'their priority will be to use those resources to address the persistent economic problems','None','00:16:57.316','00:17:01.820','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',50.27,100.00),(6503,10,'in their country.','None','00:17:01.820','00:17:02.821','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',65.37,100.00),(6504,10,'The Press: But as you pointed out in your number one, there\'s no indication that even under all this pressure','None','00:17:02.821','00:17:06.825','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',74.97,100.00),(6505,10,'they\'ve really scaled back those destabilizing activities.','None','00:17:06.825','00:17:09.795','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',48.68,100.00),(6506,10,'So they already face this choice.','None','00:17:09.795','00:17:11.797','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',39.50,100.00),(6507,10,'They\'re making the choice to continue to fund these activities.','None','00:17:11.797','00:17:14.800','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',91.23,100.00),(6508,10,'I guess I don\'t see why that would change for a newly flush Iran.','None','00:17:14.800','00:17:18.303','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',69.87,100.00),(6509,10,'change -- you\'ll recall that when President Obama took office, there was a situation where the','None','00:17:22.307','00:17:28.380','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',35.88,100.00),(6510,10,'international community was fractured in terms of how to confront Iran and their nuclear ambitions.','None','00:17:28.380','00:17:33.852','FEAR','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',62.71,100.00),(6511,10,'At the same time, this was a problematic dynamic because the Iranian people inside of Iran was unified','None','00:17:33.852','00:17:42.161','SADNESS','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',46.47,100.00),(6512,10,'in support of the government\'s pursuit of a nuclear weapons program.','None','00:17:42.161','00:17:47.633','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',78.58,100.00),(6513,10,'Because of the President\'s leadership, because of the strong actions taken by the','None','00:17:47.633','00:17:51.637','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',92.06,100.00),(6514,10,'Now the international community is united in ensuring that Iran cannot obtain a nuclear weapon,','None','00:17:54.640','00:17:58.677','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',92.33,100.00),(6515,10,'by the poor economic conditions in that country.','None','00:18:06.919','00:18:09.154','SADNESS','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',82.84,100.00),(6516,10,'And we\'ve seen that economy only weaken further over time because of the pressure that\'s being applied','None','00:18:09.154','00:18:15.727','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',49.47,100.00),(6517,10,'by the international community.','None','00:18:15.727','00:18:17.095','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',43.13,100.00),(6518,10,'And that pressure, again, that\'s put in place by the international community and has prompted a reaction','None','00:18:17.095','00:18:23.168','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',81.67,100.00),(6519,10,'on the part of the Iranian population because of the poor economy -- that is what has prompted Iran to come','None','00:18:23.168','00:18:29.174','SADNESS','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',47.46,100.00),(6520,10,'to the negotiating table and start having constructive conversations with us about how to curtail and,','None','00:18:29.174','00:18:35.848','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',96.45,100.00),(6521,10,'a nuclear weapon.','None','00:18:39.952','00:18:40.953','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',58.04,100.00),(6522,10,'So, again, the pressure that they\'re responding to is an economic one.','None','00:18:40.953','00:18:43.922','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',96.38,100.00),(6523,10,'would use those additional resources to try to relieve that economic pressure that they\'re feeling.','None','00:18:51.530','00:18:55.634','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',95.24,100.00),(6524,10,'But again, I\'m not going to make any predictions about what they\'re going to do, and I certainly am not','None','00:18:55.634','00:18:59.638','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',68.66,100.00),(6525,10,'going to be in a position to prescribe what they should do.','None','00:18:59.638','00:19:03.342','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',53.93,100.00),(6526,10,'This is a sovereign country that will make their own decisions.','None','00:19:03.342','00:19:06.345','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',96.02,100.00),(6527,10,'The last point -- two last points that I\'ll make -- one is that there continue to be other sanctions that','None','00:19:06.345','00:19:10.549','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',70.44,100.00),(6528,10,'will remain in place even if we are able to reach a nuclear agreement.','None','00:19:10.549','00:19:15.120','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',81.96,100.00),(6529,10,'There are a host of sanctions that the international community has placed on Iran in response','None','00:19:15.120','00:19:19.892','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',76.38,100.00),(6530,10,'to their support for terrorism, some weapons proliferation activities that have aroused','None','00:19:19.892','00:19:27.099','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',56.29,100.00),(6531,10,'the concern of the international community.','None','00:19:27.099','00:19:29.401','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',47.27,100.00),(6532,10,'And so the point is there are a large number of sanctions that will remain in place.','None','00:19:29.401','00:19:35.674','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',69.93,100.00),(6533,10,'Michelle.','None','00:19:35.674','00:19:36.408','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',37.30,100.00),(6534,10,'The Press: Hey, Josh.','None','00:19:36.408','00:19:37.409','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',60.57,100.00),(6535,10,'I know you said that the incident in Texas is, of course, under investigation.','None','00:19:37.409','00:19:40.646','FEAR','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',58.87,100.00),(6536,10,'But regardless of what the investigation reveals, just given the way this played out,','None','00:19:40.646','00:19:45.484','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',42.52,100.00),(6537,10,'the type of event it was, the fact that at least one','None','00:19:45.484','00:19:47.986','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',52.56,100.00),(6538,10,'as a terrorist attack?','None','00:19:54.159','00:19:55.561','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',50.15,100.00),(6539,10,'Mr. Earnest: Well, I think I indicated in response to Darlene\'s question that it\'s because of the quick','None','00:19:55.561','00:20:00.866','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',96.72,100.00),(6540,10,'thinking and professionalism of local law enforcement in Texas that they were able to foil what appears to be','None','00:20:00.866','00:20:07.773','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',97.20,100.00),(6541,10,'an attempted terrorist attack.','None','00:20:07.773','00:20:10.309','FEAR','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',74.44,100.00),(6542,10,'Again, we\'re grateful to the courageous actions of the individuals that prevented further bloodshed','None','00:20:10.309','00:20:18.150','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',92.29,100.00),(6543,10,'at the site.','None','00:20:18.150','00:20:19.418','FEAR','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',39.98,100.00),(6544,10,'The Press: Okay.','None','00:20:19.418','00:20:20.252','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',96.58,100.00),(6545,10,'There\'s been a lot of emphasis, not just here over this today,','None','00:20:20.252','00:20:23.055','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',42.67,100.00),(6546,10,'but over the past year, on foreign fighters and on trying to stop this.','None','00:20:23.055','00:20:26.758','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',79.79,100.00),(6547,10,'But it seems like the greater risk is always going to be the path of least resistance,','None','00:20:26.758','00:20:31.063','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',30.58,100.00),(6548,10,'that\'s also the hardest thing to prevent.','None','00:20:38.370','00:20:40.539','SADNESS','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',63.16,100.00),(6549,10,'of the foreign fighters?','None','00:20:47.813','00:20:49.314','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',54.91,100.00),(6550,10,'Mr. Earnest: Well, this is something that the United States government has been focused on in both','None','00:20:49.314','00:20:53.685','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',97.06,100.00),(6551,10,'of these issues, both in terms of foreign fighters, as well as efforts that are underway by extremists,','None','00:20:53.685','00:20:59.157','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',62.87,100.00),(6552,10,'including those inside of ISIL, to use social media to try to radicalize individuals','None','00:20:59.157','00:21:03.895','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',91.28,100.00),(6553,10,'and inspire them to carry out acts of violence.','None','00:21:03.895','00:21:05.897','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',81.55,100.00),(6554,10,'We\'re mindful of both threats.','None','00:21:05.897','00:21:06.898','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',70.86,100.00),(6555,10,'And when it comes to foreign fighters, the President, as you\'ll recall, convened a meeting of the','None','00:21:06.898','00:21:13.005','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',41.37,100.00),(6556,10,'to stop the flow of fighters -- or at least reduce the flow of fighters to the Middle East who are','None','00:21:17.676','00:21:26.218','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',69.93,100.00),(6557,10,'taking up arms alongside ISIL.','None','00:21:26.218','00:21:28.387','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',43.81,100.00),(6558,10,'And we\'re mindful of that threat.','None','00:21:28.387','00:21:30.389','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',64.35,100.00),(6559,10,'We\'ve worked cooperatively with the international community.','None','00:21:30.389','00:21:32.391','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',96.47,100.00),(6560,10,'And there have been steps taken by law enforcement in this country to prevent individuals in the','None','00:21:32.391','00:21:37.496','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',54.53,100.00),(6561,10,'United States from traveling to Syria or to other places in the region with the aspiration of fighting','None','00:21:37.496','00:21:43.001','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',39.55,100.00),(6562,10,'alongside ISIL.','None','00:21:43.001','00:21:44.736','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',40.95,100.00),(6563,10,'But we continue to be keenly aware and vigilant about the threat that is posed by a so-called lone wolf,','None','00:21:44.736','00:21:54.012','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',89.86,100.00),(6564,10,'where you have an individual who is disaffected and is','None','00:21:54.012','00:22:00.485','SADNESS','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',57.69,100.00),(6565,10,'vulnerable to some of the kind of recruitment efforts that we see ISIL employ through social media.','None','00:22:00.485','00:22:07.793','FEAR','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',95.66,100.00),(6566,10,'And, again, I can\'t speak to what happened in this particular situation because it\'s still under','None','00:22:07.793','00:22:12.597','SADNESS','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',53.75,100.00),(6567,10,'And there are periodically law enforcement actions','None','00:22:15.834','00:22:21.006','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',47.53,100.00),(6568,10,'And so I think that is an indication that our law enforcement community, our intelligence professionals,','None','00:22:32.984','00:22:38.356','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',84.64,100.00),(6569,10,'and our homeland security officials continue to be vigilant about this ongoing threat.','None','00:22:38.356','00:22:42.527','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',43.53,100.00),(6570,10,'The Press: Okay.','None','00:22:42.527','00:22:43.428','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',96.58,100.00),(6571,10,'And lastly, the possible release of Omar Khadr in Canada, the former Gitmo detainee -- the thought that','None','00:22:43.428','00:22:50.368','FEAR','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',86.79,100.00),(6572,10,'he may soon be released from prison there.','None','00:22:50.368','00:22:53.638','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',84.04,100.00),(6573,10,'How does the administration feel about that?','None','00:22:53.638','00:22:56.308','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',56.73,100.00),(6574,10,'Mr. Earnest: Well, I haven\'t seen those specific reports, but obviously the United States has a strong','None','00:22:56.308','00:23:01.880','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',98.42,100.00),(6575,10,'and important alliance with Canada, and whenever there are transfers that are conducted','None','00:23:01.880','00:23:11.623','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',94.31,100.00),(6576,10,'from the prison at Guantanamo Bay to other countries, it is done with a set of security requirements','None','00:23:11.623','00:23:17.596','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',33.88,100.00),(6577,10,'in place.','None','00:23:17.596','00:23:18.697','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',36.62,100.00),(6578,10,'And the United States stays in close touch with our partners who are working with us in the effort','None','00:23:18.697','00:23:25.003','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',87.29,100.00),(6579,10,'to close the prison at Guantanamo Bay as they apply the security requirements that we and they believe','None','00:23:25.003','00:23:30.976','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',57.27,100.00),(6580,10,'are necessary to protect the citizens in both our countries.','None','00:23:30.976','00:23:35.514','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',81.35,100.00),(6581,10,'Mara.','None','00:23:35.514','00:23:36.581','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',30.41,100.00),(6582,10,'The Press: To follow up on Justin\'s question about overtime.','None','00:23:36.581','00:23:39.251','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',50.43,100.00),(6583,10,'Do you have -- I know you can\'t say when OMB will make','None','00:23:39.251','00:23:42.621','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',55.17,100.00),(6584,10,'Other rules that the President has asked labor to develop have come out much quicker.','None','00:23:45.924','00:23:50.462','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',64.19,100.00),(6585,10,'Mr. Earnest: Well, this is one particular rule that was the subject of extensive study.','None','00:23:50.462','00:23:57.335','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',96.18,100.00),(6586,10,'conversations with people who would be affected by this decision -- that included a wide variety','None','00:24:01.807','00:24:09.114','FEAR','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',71.61,100.00),(6587,10,'of employers, but also organizations that represent the interests of working people.','None','00:24:09.114','00:24:16.087','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',48.51,100.00),(6588,10,'I know that there is a body of academic work that\'s been','None','00:24:16.087','00:24:18.890','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',95.68,100.00),(6589,10,'But as to why this one took longer than other rules have','None','00:24:27.699','00:24:30.602','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',52.30,100.00),(6590,10,'taken, I can\'t speak to that.','None','00:24:30.602','00:24:32.671','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',66.43,100.00),(6591,10,'That may be something that the Department of Labor can speak to once a final recommendation has been','None','00:24:32.671','00:24:37.242','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',55.45,100.00),(6592,10,'moved forward.','None','00:24:37.242','00:24:41.413','FEAR','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',47.59,100.00),(6593,10,'Let\'s see, let\'s move around a little bit.','None','00:24:41.413','00:24:42.180','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',68.00,100.00),(6594,10,'Bill Press.','None','00:24:42.180','00:24:43.281','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',40.18,100.00),(6595,10,'The Press: Josh, I want to come back to Garland, Texas for a second, in that this event was an event that','None','00:24:43.281','00:24:47.285','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',49.66,100.00),(6596,10,'was deliberately planned to offer a prize for the worst depiction, if you will, of Mohammed.','None','00:24:47.285','00:24:52.958','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',77.76,100.00),(6597,10,'Is it in -- do you believe, is it, while we all condemn the violence,','None','00:24:52.958','00:24:57.696','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',85.71,100.00),(6598,10,'Mr. Earnest: Well, again, the principle that we have cited here is that no act of expression,','None','00:25:03.068','00:25:10.308','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',82.62,100.00),(6599,10,'even if it\'s an offensive expression, can justify an act of terrorism,','None','00:25:10.308','00:25:17.148','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',97.56,100.00),(6600,10,'or even an act of violence.','None','00:25:17.148','00:25:19.417','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',84.13,100.00),(6601,10,'And that\'s why I\'m reluctant to offer -- render my own judgment or the judgment of the United States government','None','00:25:19.417','00:25:25.924','FEAR','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',98.29,100.00),(6602,10,'about this particular act of expression.','None','00:25:25.924','00:25:28.493','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',36.81,100.00),(6603,10,'But there certainly is no room in our society,','None','00:25:28.493','00:25:35.000','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',44.66,100.00),(6604,10,'and it certainly doesn\'t reflect a commitment to','None','00:25:35.000','00:25:40.572','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',92.79,100.00),(6605,10,'The Press: This organization -- you don\'t have to.','None','00:25:46.611','00:25:48.213','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',75.65,100.00),(6606,10,'The organization has been identified by the Southern Poverty Law Center as a hate group,','None','00:25:48.213','00:25:53.118','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',95.78,100.00),(6607,10,'and it seems they organized this event deliberately to provoke a response.','None','00:25:53.118','00:25:57.022','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',57.97,100.00),(6608,10,'Are they in any way responsible for what happened?','None','00:25:57.022','00:25:59.457','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',83.43,100.00),(6609,10,'Mr. Earnest: Well, again, there\'s no justification for an act of violence and an attempted act','None','00:25:59.457','00:26:03.495','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',74.98,100.00),(6610,10,'of terrorism like the one that we saw.','None','00:26:03.495','00:26:05.764','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',68.52,100.00),(6611,10,'And even those who do find these expressions offensive','None','00:26:05.764','00:26:11.536','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',98.02,100.00),(6612,10,'would say that it does not justify an act of violence.','None','00:26:22.647','00:26:25.917','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',94.37,100.00),(6613,10,'And I think that\'s the principle that\'s at stake here.','None','00:26:25.917','00:26:28.920','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',51.18,100.00),(6614,10,'And it\'s going to be something that we\'ll continue to -- there\'s a lot more for us to learn about','None','00:26:28.920','00:26:35.160','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',93.33,100.00),(6615,10,'what exactly took place in Texas and our intelligence and law enforcement professionals are','None','00:26:35.160','00:26:40.365','FEAR','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',33.05,100.00),(6616,10,'Jon.','None','00:26:43.301','00:26:44.569','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',37.15,100.00),(6617,10,'The Press: Just a couple questions on Iran.','None','00:26:44.569','00:26:47.005','FEAR','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',48.28,100.00),(6618,10,'First of all, June 30th is our deadline, correct, for the --','None','00:26:47.005','00:26:51.943','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',81.02,100.00),(6619,10,'Mr. Earnest: That is correct.','None','00:26:51.943','00:26:53.144','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',97.04,100.00),(6620,10,'The Press: Is that also -- you previously said that the earlier deadline was basically the real deadline.','None','00:26:53.144','00:26:59.050','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',70.94,100.00),(6621,10,'Is there any wiggle room on this June 30th deadline?','None','00:26:59.050','00:27:02.220','FEAR','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',48.14,100.00),(6622,10,'is the day that the Joint Plan of Action would expire.','None','00:27:04.756','00:27:09.828','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',51.12,100.00),(6623,10,'This is the interim agreement that was reached between Iran and the international community.','None','00:27:09.828','00:27:13.231','FEAR','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',36.63,100.00),(6624,10,'So the point is there are consequences for not meeting that deadline.','None','00:27:16.901','00:27:21.873','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',47.36,100.00),(6625,10,'I know that there have been earlier negotiations where the deadline has slipped a day or two.','None','00:27:21.873','00:27:30.048','FEAR','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',79.24,100.00),(6626,10,'But as the President said in relation to the April 30th deadline, we\'ve been negotiating here for more','None','00:27:30.048','00:27:37.155','FEAR','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',36.93,100.00),(6627,10,'than a year and a half -- or at least about a year and','None','00:27:37.155','00:27:41.426','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',33.32,100.00),(6628,10,'a half, and the time has come for the international community and, most importantly,','None','00:27:41.426','00:27:45.497','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',91.15,100.00),(6629,10,'Iran to make some serious decisions about their commitment to resolving this situation through diplomacy.','None','00:27:45.497','00:27:53.171','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',85.71,100.00),(6630,10,'The President and the international community have acted decisively.','None','00:27:53.171','00:27:56.241','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',90.99,100.00),(6631,10,'We\'ve been clear about what our expectations are in terms of shutting down every pathway that Iran','None','00:27:56.241','00:28:01.046','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',90.09,100.00),(6632,10,'has to a nuclear weapon, and about imposing the most stringent and intrusive set of inspections that have','None','00:28:01.046','00:28:07.252','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',60.27,100.00),(6633,10,'ever been imposed on a country\'s nuclear program.','None','00:28:07.252','00:28:11.523','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',83.21,100.00),(6634,10,'That\'s what the United States and the international community requires in this agreement.','None','00:28:11.523','00:28:16.227','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',71.13,100.00),(6635,10,'And there are still important details to be worked out.','None','00:28:16.227','00:28:20.165','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',97.27,100.00),(6636,10,'But we continue to be hopeful that we\'ll be able to successfully complete an agreement by June 30th','None','00:28:20.165','00:28:26.805','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',98.78,100.00),(6637,10,'through diplomacy, is by far the best way for us to prevent Iran from obtaining a nuclear weapon.','None','00:28:33.244','00:28:39.317','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',67.70,100.00),(6638,10,'The Press: You do have some pretty fundamental differences still.','None','00:28:39.317','00:28:42.387','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',55.21,100.00),(6639,10,'What is the alternative?','None','00:28:42.387','00:28:43.988','FEAR','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',46.16,100.00),(6640,10,'What happens if there is no agreement by the 30th or by a day or two after the 30th?','None','00:28:43.988','00:28:47.926','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',42.83,100.00),(6641,10,'What we\'re focused on right now is trying to -- is to complete these negotiations.','None','00:28:49.627','00:28:55.233','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',61.61,100.00),(6642,10,'And I know that our technical experts even this week have been in touch with their Iranian counterparts','None','00:28:55.233','00:29:00.472','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',94.84,100.00),(6643,10,'The thing we continue to be mindful of is that, while this broader political framework has been','None','00:29:04.309','00:29:08.847','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',90.79,100.00),(6644,10,'will allow both sides to live up to the terms of this broader','None','00:29:16.788','00:29:19.691','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',96.87,100.00),(6645,10,'political outline.','None','00:29:19.691','00:29:20.692','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',54.63,100.00),(6646,10,'So we\'re mindful of the importance of those details, and that\'s why, here, even a couple of months in advance','None','00:29:20.692','00:29:26.331','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',65.30,100.00),(6647,10,'of the deadline, this is something that our experts are working on.','None','00:29:26.331','00:29:31.603','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',76.44,100.00),(6648,10,'The Press: Because the President, a number of times, and you have as well, have basically portrayed the','None','00:29:31.603','00:29:36.341','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',58.15,100.00),(6649,10,'But I mean, that\'s not the choice you\'re facing at the end of June 30th, is it?','None','00:29:39.210','00:29:44.182','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',40.86,100.00),(6650,10,'So what -- that\'s what I\'m trying to get a sense of --','None','00:29:51.689','00:29:54.526','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',46.82,100.00),(6651,10,'what happens if you don\'t get a deal?','None','00:29:54.526','00:29:56.528','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',52.82,100.00),(6652,10,'Mr. Earnest: Well, the reason that we have described it this way is that those critics of this','None','00:29:56.528','00:30:00.665','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',95.28,100.00),(6653,10,'negotiation don\'t suggest that there\'s some other deal that could be reached through negotiation.','None','00:30:00.665','00:30:06.538','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',69.70,100.00),(6654,10,'They\'re essentially throwing out the diplomatic option, which I guess only leaves you with','None','00:30:06.538','00:30:12.777','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',75.53,100.00),(6655,10,'the military option.','None','00:30:12.777','00:30:13.778','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',36.80,100.00),(6656,10,'I haven\'t heard a suggestion that there is some other option out there.','None','00:30:13.778','00:30:16.781','FEAR','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',33.78,100.00),(6657,10,'The Press: Okay, but you just said a deal has got to','None','00:30:16.781','00:30:18.783','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',90.74,100.00),(6658,10,'You\'ve been negotiating for a year and a half.','None','00:30:20.952','00:30:22.587','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',41.37,100.00),(6659,10,'If you can\'t get there, you have these fundamental differences about when sanctions are being lifted,','None','00:30:22.587','00:30:25.490','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',61.24,100.00),(6660,10,'what is your alternative?','None','00:30:25.490','00:30:28.126','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',41.35,100.00),(6661,10,'Or accept war?','None','00:30:32.430','00:30:34.332','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',43.37,100.00),(6662,10,'Mr. Earnest: Well, I think what we are trying to do, and I think what we are forcing the Iranians to do,','None','00:30:34.332','00:30:41.039','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',91.31,100.00),(6663,10,'is to try to agree on all the details that support','None','00:30:41.039','00:30:48.446','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',90.17,100.00),(6664,10,'this broader political understanding that\'s been reached a month or so ago.','None','00:30:48.446','00:30:52.550','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',61.43,100.00),(6665,10,'And that\'s what we\'re focused on.','None','00:30:52.550','00:30:54.786','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',70.67,100.00),(6666,10,'We believe it\'s clearly in the best interest of the international community, and Iran has something to gain','None','00:30:54.786','00:30:59.724','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',97.44,100.00),(6667,10,'from this, as well.','None','00:30:59.724','00:31:00.992','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',41.29,100.00),(6668,10,'And that\'s why we\'re so focused on this particular objective.','None','00:31:00.992','00:31:04.229','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',78.86,100.00),(6669,10,'Would the administration be troubled if this bill died -- I mean, between the machinations of -- maneuvers','None','00:31:12.203','00:31:18.343','SADNESS','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',94.90,100.00),(6670,10,'of folks like Tom Cotton and Marco Rubio, if this bill died in the Senate?','None','00:31:18.343','00:31:23.915','SADNESS','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',48.85,100.00),(6671,10,'Would that be a problem?','None','00:31:25.550','00:31:26.551','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',49.38,100.00),(6672,10,'of negotiations.','None','00:31:31.089','00:31:32.090','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',44.99,100.00),(6673,10,'But at the same time, by working diligently in bipartisan fashion, we were able to reach','None','00:31:32.090','00:31:37.428','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',97.47,100.00),(6674,10,'a compromise that was approved unanimously -- not','None','00:31:37.428','00:31:42.667','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',69.95,100.00),(6675,10,'just with bipartisan support, but approved by every single Democrat and Republican that serves','None','00:31:42.667','00:31:46.704','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',92.26,100.00),(6676,10,'on the Senate Foreign Relations Committee.','None','00:31:46.704','00:31:49.107','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',41.63,100.00),(6677,10,'But ultimately, it will be the responsibility of individual senators to decide whether or not','None','00:31:49.107','00:31:53.244','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',49.56,100.00),(6678,10,'they\'re going to go along with this compromise proposal that\'s got strong bipartisan support,','None','00:31:53.244','00:31:58.816','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',96.18,100.00),(6679,10,'or if there might be other factors in play that might be affecting the decision that they\'re making in terms','None','00:31:58.816','00:32:04.222','FEAR','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',49.95,100.00),(6680,10,'of casting this vote.','None','00:32:04.222','00:32:05.623','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',61.77,100.00),(6681,10,'The Press: But there would be no mourning here at the White House if that bill died in the Senate?','None','00:32:05.623','00:32:09.627','SADNESS','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',89.40,100.00),(6682,10,'Mr. Earnest: Well, again, we\'ve made clear what our starting position was, but we\'ve also made clear that','None','00:32:09.627','00:32:14.666','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',96.92,100.00),(6683,10,'the compromise that was reached by Chairman Corker and Senator Cardin is a reasonable and','None','00:32:14.666','00:32:22.173','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',95.72,100.00),(6684,10,'acceptable one.','None','00:32:22.173','00:32:23.174','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',96.97,100.00),(6685,10,'And that\'s I think why -- I think that\'s also the opinion of every single Democrat and every','None','00:32:23.174','00:32:27.145','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',61.69,100.00),(6686,10,'Cheryl.','None','00:32:30.148','00:32:32.417','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',37.71,100.00),(6687,10,'he expects to come up very soon.','None','00:32:37.889','00:32:39.657','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',87.32,100.00),(6688,10,'Do you have the votes now for that bill?','None','00:32:39.657','00:32:42.126','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',66.62,100.00),(6689,10,'Well, again, I think you\'d have to check with Senator McConnell.','None','00:32:44.729','00:32:48.032','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',56.08,100.00),(6690,10,'for a whip count.','None','00:32:57.075','00:32:59.977','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',83.20,100.00),(6691,10,'I think you\'ve seen the President devote significant personal time and attention to making the case','None','00:32:59.977','00:33:07.218','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',97.74,100.00),(6692,10,'to individual members of Congress about why this is something they should support.','None','00:33:07.218','00:33:11.222','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',67.24,100.00),(6693,10,'He has talked to both Democrats and Republicans, but the case the President has made to Democrats has','None','00:33:11.222','00:33:16.294','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',77.11,100.00),(6694,10,'And the President is hopeful that Democrats, as they take a clear-eyed look at this proposal,','None','00:33:28.639','00:33:36.347','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',97.71,100.00),(6695,10,'will acknowledge that the best way to advance the kinds of progressive values and the best way','None','00:33:36.347','00:33:43.388','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',95.16,100.00),(6696,10,'to advance the interests of middle-class families all across the country is to support this particular','None','00:33:43.388','00:33:48.860','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',92.12,100.00),(6697,10,'that Democrats will give that a fair look as well.','None','00:34:02.106','00:34:04.108','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',96.80,100.00),(6698,10,'The Press: Will the President have any new message or announcement when he goes to Oregon on Friday?','None','00:34:04.108','00:34:11.115','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',39.93,100.00),(6699,10,'Byron.','None','00:34:12.617','00:34:13.985','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',40.52,100.00),(6700,10,'The Press: Thanks, Josh.','None','00:34:13.985','00:34:15.052','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',90.90,100.00),(6701,10,'FHFA is reviewing and possibly -- reviewing a possible boost to the pay of the CEOs of Fannie Mae','None','00:34:15.052','00:34:23.094','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',60.31,100.00),(6702,10,'and Freddie Mac.','None','00:34:23.094','00:34:24.362','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',35.42,100.00),(6703,10,'Does the White House have a reaction to that news?','None','00:34:24.362','00:34:26.264','FEAR','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',47.66,100.00),(6704,10,'that the current limits on compensation that are in','None','00:34:31.836','00:34:37.775','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',55.77,100.00),(6705,10,'place for executives at Fannie Mae and Freddie Mac should not be raised.','None','00:34:37.775','00:34:44.449','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',49.22,100.00),(6706,10,'provided to those particular organizations, to those institutions, and it\'s the view of the','None','00:34:50.087','00:34:55.827','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',81.22,100.00),(6707,10,'remain in place.','None','00:35:02.133','00:35:04.869','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',84.31,100.00),(6708,10,'The Press: The two CEOs of those entities get paid a small fraction of what other CEOs in the same','None','00:35:04.869','00:35:10.641','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',51.50,100.00),(6709,10,'industry get paid.','None','00:35:10.641','00:35:12.310','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',87.33,100.00),(6710,10,'They also get paid less than executives at those entities.','None','00:35:12.310','00:35:15.680','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',58.41,100.00),(6711,10,'Given that there\'s no plan to wind down these entities, why shouldn\'t they get close to the industry','None','00:35:15.680','00:35:22.820','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',35.94,100.00),(6712,10,'level of compensation?','None','00:35:22.820','00:35:24.589','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',31.38,100.00),(6713,10,'Mr. Earnest: The reason that these entities are different than some of the financial entities that you see in the','None','00:35:24.589','00:35:33.664','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',88.49,100.00),(6714,10,'executives of those institutions to be subject to compensation limits.','None','00:35:49.280','00:35:53.484','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',57.84,100.00),(6715,10,'And more importantly, that\'s the view of the Treasury Department.','None','00:35:53.484','00:35:56.687','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',49.52,100.00),(6716,10,'There\'s a responsibility that FHFA has to consult with the Treasury Department when making these kinds','None','00:35:56.687','00:36:01.893','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',40.55,100.00),(6717,10,'of decisions.','None','00:36:01.893','00:36:04.262','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',57.22,100.00),(6718,10,'And that\'s a view that the Treasury Department has expressed.','None','00:36:04.262','00:36:07.265','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',51.80,100.00),(6719,10,'At the same time, both the Treasury Department and we here at the White House acknowledge that','None','00:36:07.265','00:36:11.269','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',93.09,100.00),(6720,10,'this falls within the independent jurisdiction of the independent FHFA.','None','00:36:11.269','00:36:15.673','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',48.44,100.00),(6721,10,'The Press: So given that taxpayer money is on the line with these entities, there\'s no concern that the','None','00:36:15.673','00:36:21.812','FEAR','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',48.97,100.00),(6722,10,'compensation limits prevent those entities from attracting the top talent and the best administrators?','None','00:36:21.812','00:36:27.184','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',42.21,100.00),(6723,10,'Mr. Earnest: It hasn\'t so far.','None','00:36:27.184','00:36:28.185','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',94.74,100.00),(6724,10,'We\'ve seen some very highly skilled and experienced financial professionals who have been working hard at','None','00:36:28.185','00:36:34.992','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',98.69,100.00),(6725,10,'Fannie Mae and Freddie Mac.','None','00:36:34.992','00:36:36.327','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',40.30,100.00),(6726,10,'This has particularly been true since some important reforms have been put in place.','None','00:36:36.327','00:36:41.032','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',96.95,100.00),(6727,10,'And we have seen the financial picture of these entities improve rather dramatically in just the','None','00:36:41.032','00:36:46.604','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',96.63,100.00),(6728,10,'last six or seven years in ways that many financial analysts didn\'t expect.','None','00:36:46.604','00:36:53.578','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',46.39,100.00),(6729,10,'There\'s still important work to do in terms of these reforms and still important decisions to be made about','None','00:36:53.578','00:36:58.583','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',97.99,100.00),(6730,10,'the ultimate structure of these entities.','None','00:36:58.583','00:37:06.390','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',58.29,100.00),(6731,10,'But I think the point is that, thus far, we\'ve seen individuals with significant financial','None','00:37:06.390','00:37:11.696','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',97.98,100.00),(6732,10,'And at the same time, they\'re able to do that without making a particularly significant','None','00:37:16.434','00:37:24.542','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',97.64,100.00),(6733,10,'in the private sector.','None','00:37:31.449','00:37:33.084','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',49.43,100.00),(6734,10,'Chris.','None','00:37:33.084','00:37:34.218','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',40.07,100.00),(6735,10,'The Press: Thanks, Josh.','None','00:37:34.218','00:37:34.952','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',90.90,100.00),(6736,10,'Going back to trade for just a minute, and I wanted to ask if you had any reaction to','None','00:37:34.952','00:37:40.257','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',57.99,100.00),(6737,10,'John Boehne