'00:38:31.842','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',57.85,100.00),(6746,10,'I think in the mind of the President, it\'s the responsibility for the Speaker of the House','None','00:38:31.842','00:38:35.813','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',53.74,100.00),(6747,10,'The good news is, is that he has a Democratic President who shares at least one of those priorities,','None','00:38:41.185','00:38:46.357','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',95.61,100.00),(6748,10,'and a Democratic President who signaled a willingness to make the case to members of Congress in his own party','None','00:38:46.357','00:38:53.431','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',71.14,100.00),(6749,10,'But ultimately, it seems a little early for a pretty','None','00:38:58.903','00:39:04.742','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',94.02,100.00),(6750,10,'you advance the agenda when you\'ve got the majority in the House of Representatives.','None','00:39:12.016','00:39:16.387','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',95.13,100.00),(6751,10,'The Press: But it\'s something the President wants, and she\'s someone --','None','00:39:16.387','00:39:19.390','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',74.53,100.00),(6752,10,'Mr. Earnest: Sure it is.','None','00:39:19.390','00:39:20.391','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',98.60,100.00),(6753,10,'And that\'s why you\'ve seen the President -- The Press: -- who could win over some Democrats who','None','00:39:20.391','00:39:22.493','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',73.50,100.00),(6754,10,'are on the fence about this.','None','00:39:22.493','00:39:23.394','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',57.57,100.00),(6755,10,'Mr. Earnest: Well, I think that what you have seen is that you have seen the President make a very strong','None','00:39:23.394','00:39:26.731','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',98.92,100.00),(6756,10,'case to Democrats in the United States Congress','None','00:39:26.731','00:39:32.236','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',63.20,100.00),(6757,10,'progressive values that the President has championed throughout his six or six and a half years','None','00:39:36.240','00:39:41.045','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',94.68,100.00),(6758,10,'in office now.','None','00:39:41.045','00:39:42.813','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',48.41,100.00),(6759,10,'And the President has made that case publicly; he\'ll do it again on Friday out in Oregon.','None','00:39:42.813','00:39:51.555','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',63.96,100.00),(6760,10,'The President has made that case privately, most recently in a meeting that he convened with some','None','00:39:51.555','00:39:56.694','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',50.78,100.00),(6761,10,'members of the New Democrat Coalition here at the White House last week.','None','00:39:56.694','00:40:00.698','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',60.55,100.00),(6762,10,'So we\'ve been clear about the case that we\'re willing to make and so the President has taken','None','00:40:00.698','00:40:06.270','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',97.56,100.00),(6763,10,'on that responsibility.','None','00:40:06.270','00:40:07.404','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',38.80,100.00),(6764,10,'I guess we\'d like to see the Speaker of the House, who actually presides over the majority in the House','None','00:40:07.404','00:40:11.375','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',88.33,100.00),(6765,10,'of Representatives, assume a similar level of responsibility for advancing a piece of','None','00:40:11.375','00:40:15.412','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',84.86,100.00),(6766,10,'legislation that he himself has called a priority.','None','00:40:15.412','00:40:19.083','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',67.15,100.00),(6767,10,'The Press: And on another topic.','None','00:40:19.083','00:40:20.384','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',53.37,100.00),(6768,10,'The President posted a message of condolence on Dave Goldberg\'s Facebook page.','None','00:40:20.384','00:40:23.621','SADNESS','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',46.02,100.00),(6769,10,'Mark Zuckerberg, among others responded to it.','None','00:40:23.621','00:40:25.523','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',62.56,100.00),(6770,10,'I\'m wondering if you could tell us anything about the President\'s relationship with him or anything else','None','00:40:25.523','00:40:31.295','FEAR','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',72.27,100.00),(6771,10,'about how long they knew each other and anything else that -- if you\'ve spoken to him about it.','None','00:40:31.295','00:40:38.235','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',53.65,100.00),(6772,10,'Mr. Earnest: Well, the President did have the opportunity to write this note that was posted','None','00:40:38.235','00:40:44.475','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',98.24,100.00),(6773,10,'And the President had the opportunity to get to know Dave and Sheryl a little bit over the years,','None','00:40:48.345','00:40:55.653','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',80.92,100.00),(6774,10,'and I think the President\'s impression of Dave is consistent with the impression that we\'ve seen','None','00:40:55.653','00:41:03.394','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',96.48,100.00),(6775,10,'in much of the news coverage of his death over the last 72 hours or so.','None','00:41:03.394','00:41:08.065','SADNESS','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',27.76,100.00),(6776,10,'As the President said in his Facebook message, Dave was somebody who really left an impression','None','00:41:08.065','00:41:14.471','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',33.90,100.00),(6777,10,'the institutions with which he was associated.','None','00:41:26.450','00:41:30.120','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',57.01,100.00),(6778,10,'But he was also willing to use that talent to help other entrepreneurs and other people who were','None','00:41:30.120','00:41:34.191','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',98.34,100.00),(6779,10,'striving to make their mark.','None','00:41:34.191','00:41:39.363','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',60.24,100.00),(6780,10,'And he leaves behind quite a legacy in terms of the large number of entrepreneurs and innovators that can talk','None','00:41:39.363','00:41:47.071','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',95.46,100.00),(6781,10,'about the way that they benefitted from the counsel, advice, and mentoring of somebody of Dave\'s stature.','None','00:41:47.071','00:41:56.981','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',98.77,100.00),(6782,10,'Let\'s see -- Anita.','None','00:41:56.981','00:41:59.416','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',71.20,100.00),(6783,10,'The Press: I just wanted to go back to the shooting.','None','00:41:59.416','00:42:01.485','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',77.77,100.00),(6784,10,'I know that local law enforcement said that they were aware of the event -- the contest that','None','00:42:01.485','00:42:06.190','FEAR','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',60.94,100.00),(6785,10,'was happening.','None','00:42:06.190','00:42:07.191','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',35.46,100.00),(6786,10,'The organizers had already gotten additional security.','None','00:42:07.191','00:42:09.927','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',67.07,100.00),(6787,10,'I\'m wondering what the White House knew about it.','None','00:42:09.927','00:42:12.096',