'Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',35.82,100.00),(6805,10,'How closely is the President paying attention?','None','00:43:28.439','00:43:31.542','FEAR','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',40.18,100.00),(6806,10,'In fact, it could mean a total change in leadership.','None','00:43:31.542','00:43:34.578','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',49.08,100.00),(6807,10,'Mr. Earnest: The President is obviously following the elections that are taking place in a country with whom','None','00:43:34.578','00:43:40.150','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',72.86,100.00),(6808,10,'we have such a special relationship.','None','00:43:40.150','00:43:42.152','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',92.09,100.00),(6809,10,'But I don\'t know that I have a whole lot to say about','None','00:43:44.288','00:43:46.290','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',52.33,100.00),(6810,10,'the current status of those elections, again, because I\'m unwilling to speak about this election','None','00:43:46.290','00:43:52.096','FEAR','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',94.16,100.00),(6811,10,'in a way that might leave anybody with the impression that we\'re supporting one side or another.','None','00:43:52.096','00:43:57.768','LOVE','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',61.60,100.00),(6812,10,'Tommy.','None','00:43:57.768','00:43:59.069','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',37.57,100.00),(6813,10,'The Press: Thanks, Josh.','None','00:43:59.069','00:43:59.770','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',90.90,100.00),(6814,10,'I have two topics.','None','00:43:59.770','00:44:00.771','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',40.14,100.00),(6815,10,'First of all, on this string of recent incidents of police violence against unarmed citizens that the','None','00:44:00.771','00:44:06.143','FEAR','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',47.20,100.00),(6816,10,'President noted are showing up on video just about every week.','None','00:44:06.143','00:44:09.613','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',70.06,100.00),(6817,10,'Something I\'ve heard him say and then I\'ve heard you say on a number of occasions with these incidents','None','00:44:09.613','00:44:15.019','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',59.78,100.00),(6818,10,'is that in the context of those incidents, the overwhelming majority of police officers act','None','00:44:15.019','00:44:22.493','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',61.58,100.00),(6819,10,'And I\'m wondering, when we look at the Freddie Gray incident and Walter Scott and in incident after','None','00:44:24.728','00:44:30.934','FEAR','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',62.20,100.00),(6820,10,'We haven\'t seen a single incident where a police officer, other than the ones participating','None','00:44:35.706','00:44:41.945','FEAR','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',54.16,100.00),(6821,10,'in the event, have acted properly and intervened on behalf of the citizen.','None','00:44:41.945','00:44:44.948','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',52.99,100.00),(6822,10,'So I\'m wondering, on what basis do you and the President make that statement in that context?','None','00:44:44.948','00:44:49.653','FEAR','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',58.88,100.00),(6823,10,'When they\'re put to this test, when police officers are committing violence against','None','00:44:51.989','00:44:57.895','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',90.98,100.00),(6824,10,'an unarmed citizen, why would anybody think that the overwhelming majority of them are good when we\'ve','None','00:44:57.895','00:45:04.535','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',59.73,100.00),(6825,10,'seen evidence that not a single one of them has been?','None','00:45:04.535','00:45:07.604','FEAR','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',45.68,100.00),(6826,10,'Mr. Earnest: Tommy, I think we do that based on the experience that the vast majority of Americans has','None','00:45:07.604','00:45:13.277','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',97.05,100.00),(6827,10,'when they\'re dealing with local law enforcement -- that they find these individuals to be','None','00:45:13.277','00:45:17.281','FEAR','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',57.67,100.00),(6828,10,'the communities that they\'re sworn to serve and protect.','None','00:45:22.386','00:45:24.354','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',45.02,100.00),(6829,10,'And, again, I think that\'s the experience of many','None','00:45:24.354','00:45:30.994','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',73.56,100.00),(6830,10,'Americans when they come into contact with law enforcement professionals.','None','00:45:30.994','00:45:35.466','FEAR','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',55.20,100.00),(6831,10,'And, again, I think the fact that these particular -- the President alluded to this a little bit in his','None','00:45:35.466','00:45:41.071','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',73.16,100.00),(6832,10,'is because they are a departure from the','None','00:45:47.744','00:45:53.984','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',71.37,100.00),(6833,10,'experience that most Americans have when they\'re dealing with law enforcement.','None','00:45:53.984','00:45:57.988','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',40.30,100.00),(6834,10,'And they are a departure from the kind of professionalism that the vast majority','None','00:45:57.988','00:46:02.993','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',88.76,100.00),(6835,10,'of law enforcement officers show when they\'re doing their job.','None','00:46:02.993','00:46:05.963','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',45.46,100.00),(6836,10,'The Press: It doesn\'t seem like -- if we\'re having one of these every week, that if the vast majority of officers','None','00:46:05.963','00:46:10.134','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',56.59,100.00),(6837,10,'on that guy, give this guy some medical help?','None','00:46:21.812','00:46:23.814','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',50.27,100.00),(6838,10,'Why haven\