','00:57:51.668','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',41.38,100.00),(6983,10,'initiatives to address the needs of the Iraqi people and to foster cooperation across all communities.','None','00:57:51.668','00:57:57.073','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',93.84,100.00),(6984,10,'I would anticipate that the President will also have an opportunity to see President Barzani while he\'s here,','None','00:57:57.073','00:58:02.345','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',82.81,100.00),(6985,10,'as well.','None','00:58:02.345','00:58:03.179','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',48.24,100.00),(6986,10,'The Press: One more question.','None','00:58:03.179','00:58:04.214','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',57.79,100.00),(6987,10,'The Chief of Staff of President Barzani has said that the President will raise the issue of','None','00:58:04.214','00:58:09.219','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',64.93,100.00),(6988,10,'What would be the response of the White House with that in mind?','None','00:58:15.892','00:58:19.796','FEAR','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',42.04,100.00),(6989,10,'Mr. Earnest: It continues to be the view of the United States that a unified Iraq that\'s governed in an','None','00:58:19.796','00:58:25.468','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',96.47,100.00),(6990,10,'And that was part of the strong case that the','None','00:58:29.572','00:58:34.911','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',7