ation between President Barzani and','None','00:59:33.603','00:59:44.380','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',97.34,100.00),(7000,10,'President Obama, but also the people and the security forces in the Kurdistan region of Iraq,','None','00:59:44.380','00:59:48.785','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',45.84,100.00),(7001,10,'and the United States.','None','00:59:48.785','00:59:49.852','ANGER','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',37.60,100.00),(7002,10,'And that means that the leaders will have plenty to discuss this afternoon, and I would anticipate that once','None','00:59:49.852','00:59:54.958','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',86.45,100.00),(7003,10,'the meeting has concluded that we\'ll have a readout of the meeting for you.','None','00:59:54.958','00:59:58.394','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',83.60,100.00),(7004,10,'All right, Bob, I\'ll give you the last one.','None','00:59:58.394','01:00:01.564','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',94.11,100.00),(7005,10,'The Press: Thanks, Josh.','None','01:00:01.564','01:00:02.532','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',90.90,100.00),(7006,10,'Just to follow up on the police issue, does the President support universal police, body,','None','01:00:02.532','01:00:09.872','JOY','Will translate during reel generation...','NORMAL','2026-09-17 19:52:22','2026-09-17 19:52:22',90.75,100.00),(7007,10,'And to the point you made about the broader concerns, Boehner has said that one of the base causes is 50 years','None','01:00:11.908','01:00:18.047','ANGER','Will translate during reel 